translate schinese ep12_intro_label_d4864a10:

    # isa "A life where we weren't just Mom, Dad, and Daughter. But a life where we were also best friends and could talk to each other as such."
    isa "一种生活，我们不只是妈妈、爸爸和女儿。而是一种生活，我们也是最好的朋友，可以像朋友一样彼此交谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:361
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_c643fe5d:

    # isa "*{i}Sobs{/i}*"
    isa "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:365
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_f8fda0fb:

    # isa "I don't know how to do this without them."
    isa "我不知道没有你们该怎么继续下去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:366
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_95aba818:

    # isa "I don't know how to do this without you either."
    isa "我不知道没有你我该怎么办。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:368
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_80912fee:

    # jam "You're not without me. I'm right here."
    jam "你不是一个人，我在你身边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:369
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_c21f80a1:

    # jam "We'll get through this together. We'll grow stronger for it."
    jam "我们能一起度过这一切。我们会因此变得更坚强。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:373
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_6ac67b21:

    # jam "Let's grab some air."
    jam "我们出去透透气吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:377
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_d9b45f42:

    # jam "Did you grow up with this pool?"
    jam "你小时候就住这儿吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:379
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_c0782357:

    # isa "No. This entire area used to be grass and a couple of trees."
    isa "这块地方以前全是草地和几棵树。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:381
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_28be2b48:

    # isa "The same goes for the garage. It was all grass and gravel used as a parking space."
    isa "和车库也是一样。以前这里全是草地和碎石子，用来当停车场。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:382
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_e93e2259:

    # isa "I remember Dad had the hardest time getting the permit to build the garage."
    isa "我记得我爸当时为了建车库，申请许可可算是费了老大的劲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:384
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_a01cf508:

    # isa "He told me how much he hated the rules and regulations of this city."
    isa "他跟我说起他有多讨厌这个城市的种种规定和条例。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:385
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_bcb826f6:

    # isa "And he told me that the only way to get a timely permit was to act upset and annoyed with the building authority."
    isa "他跟我说，要想及时拿到许可，就得装出对建筑部门很不满的样子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:387
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_c17ea2e0:

    # isa "You'd think being rude would have the opposite effect, but they were swamped with granting permits and would process the annoying people faster to get rid of them."
    isa "你得想啊，按理说粗鲁应该起反效果，可他们那会儿正被一堆申请压得喘不过气，干脆就把这些烦人的家伙优先处理掉，省得麻烦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:388
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_92b6afca:

    # isa "Haha... It wasn't until he scolded them that he finally got it approved."
    isa "哈哈……直到他骂了他们一顿，才终于批下来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:389
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_151f4417:

    # isa "Dad didn't like himself for doing that, but it worked just as people advised him."
    isa "爸爸自己也不喜欢这么做，但结果和别人建议的一样有效。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:391
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_4183b1c0:

    # isa "When they built the pool, I didn't think they would want to go through that entire process again."
    isa "他们建泳池的时候，我根本没想到他们还会走一遍同样的流程。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:392
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_5a6c6957:

    # isa "Apparently, it was much simpler with the pool than with the garage."
    isa "显然，建游泳池比建车房简单多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:393
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_9096f2cf:

    # isa "They built the pool after I had left for college, and Dad said they had me to thank for it."
    isa "他们在我上大学后建了这个泳池，爸爸说这全得感谢我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:394
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_059ef282:

    # isa "I had told them to move on and do something for their own enjoyment, and this pool was it."
    isa "我跟他们说过要放手去做些让自己开心的事，这个泳池就是他们这么做的结果。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:396
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_c1b71ed0:

    # isa "I'm proud that they did this for themselves, but I wish they could have grown old in this house."
    isa "我为他们能为自己这么做感到骄傲，但真希望他们能在这栋房子里老去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:397
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_70c9602a:

    # isa "And now... I have to decide the fate of their home... It's too sudden."
    isa "现在……我得决定他们家的未来……太突然了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:398
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_bb10a9d9:

    # isa "It's way too sudden!"
    isa "这太突然了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:400
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_897857cb:

    # jam "I know how hard this must be. Let me offer you my thoughts."
    jam "我知道这对你来说有多难。让我分享一下我的想法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:402
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_a5a1f9f5:

    # jam "You obviously have a lot of memories here, in this house that defined your childhood."
    jam "你显然在这里有很多回忆，这栋房子定义了你的童年。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:403
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_e9834d49:

    # jam "This is the house that connects you to your parents."
    jam "这栋房子连接着你和父母。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:404
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_4e85d6e7:

    # jam "I could never ask you to sell it."
    jam "我永远不能让你卖掉它。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:406
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_067beaff:

    # isa "But James... We don't live here. This is not our city."
    isa "但James……我们不住在这里。这可不是我们的城市。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:408
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_9212fd54:

    # jam "But it can be our future."
    jam "但这可以成为我们的未来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:410
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_cbbaa0a8:

    # jam "You know me; I'm somewhat flexible with where I live. And you can always get a job here. There are libraries here, aren't there?"
    jam "你了解我的，我住哪儿都行。你也能在这儿找到工作，这儿有图书馆，不是吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:411
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_2443ca86:

    # jam "With the inheritance, we can make this change for ourselves."
    jam "有了这笔遗产，我们自己就能做出这个改变。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:413
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_9e427eae:

    # jam "I know we shouldn't make rash and big decisions right now, but time is a luxury we don't have."
    jam "我知道我们现在不应该草率地做重大决定，但时间是我们无法奢侈浪费的东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:414
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_34cf4273:

    # jam "And I'm telling you if this house is where you see your future, and if it brings you happiness to live here again..."
    jam "而且我告诉你，如果这栋房子是你看到未来的模样，如果再次住在这里能让你感到幸福……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:415
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_3001d757:

    # jam "I'm with you all the way."
    jam "我完全支持你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:422
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_2097d34b:

    # jam "It was the right call to hire movers."
    jam "这是雇搬家公司是个正确的决定。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:424
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_b0304958:

    # isa "We'll get sweaty enough from unpacking."
    isa "我们会搬东西搬得满头大汗。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:426
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_fd3981dc:

    # jam "What do you want to do with their furniture?"
    jam "你想怎么处理他们的家具？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:428
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_45b25426:

    # isa "I want to keep some of it."
    isa "我想留一些下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:429
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_e1b16d57:

    # isa "These specific memories pop into my head when I look at them."
    isa "这些特定的回忆在我看到它们时总会浮现在脑海里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:431
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_4bc2a076:

    # isa "But at the same time, their taste was different from mine. Lots of it has to go..."
    isa "但与此同时，他们的品味和我不太一样。很多东西都得扔掉……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:432
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_07bf3521:

    # jam "Then, I'll leave those decisions up to you."
    jam "那部分就交给你决定吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:434
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_f1a4e551:

    # wo2 "Is this the bedroom you want it in?"
    wo2 "这是你要放卧室的地方吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:436
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_2c6e9e37:

    # isa "Oh! No! Nothing goes in there! You can put it in the big room upstairs."
    isa "哦！不行！什么也不能放进去！你可以把它放在楼上那间大房间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:438
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_122b25fd:

    # isa "I'm sorry about the stairs."
    isa "对不起，楼梯的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:440
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_7c3739da:

    # wo2 "Don't be; it's our job."
    wo2 "别担心；这是我们的工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:442
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:450
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_fb623a7e_1:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:452
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_7070820e:

    # isa "I don't want to sleep here."
    isa "我可不想在这儿睡觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:454
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_aeb92780:

    # jam "I wouldn't either. We don't have to make it our bedroom."
    jam "我也不想要。我们没必要把它当成卧室。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:456
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_1fb1c465:

    # isa "Then what will it be?"
    isa "那它会变成什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:458
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_72a78fb3:

    # jam "It can be anything you want."
    jam "它可以是你们想要的任何东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:460
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_996ebff3:

    # jam "We could turn it into a guest room..."
    jam "我们也可以把它改成客房……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:461
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_d21046ec:

    # jam "Or a study..."
    jam "或者一个学习室……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:463
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_7ed74da2:

    # jam "Or... We can leave it as it is."
    jam "或者……我们保持原样也行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:464
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_36fa9ff6:

    # jam "It's your call."
    jam "你决定就好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:468
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_f5c58b6e:

    # jam "Take the time you need. I'll check on the movers."
    jam "花点时间吧。我会去查看搬运工的情况。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:470
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_13a5f0bc:

    # isa "James."
    isa "James。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:472
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_cb9d1451:

    # jam "Yes?"
    jam "你确定吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:474
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_0f453e17:

    # isa "I love you."
    isa "我爱你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:476
translate schinese ep12_intro_label_6f5b00ef:

    # jam "I love you too."
    jam "我也爱你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:518
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_0edb5fe5:

    # js "What did the doctor say?"
    js "医生怎么说的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:520
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_9dd470fc:

    # my "They rushed Derek to surgery. They will stitch him up, but they don't reattach fingertips unless they are thumbs."
    my "他们把Derek送进了手术室。他们会缝合他的伤口，但除非是拇指，否则不会重新接上手指。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:521
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_257a2a6f:

    # my "And with the way he cut it off and how the fingertip looked, they concluded it was better not to reattach it."
    my "而且他把手指砍掉的方式，还有指尖的状况，他们觉得还是不接回去比较好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:523
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d2a8e979:

    # sa "They won't reattach it!? Will he have to live without the finger?"
    sa "他们不会重新接上吗？他得一辈子没这根手指活？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:525
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_4fff85c7:

    # my "He lost slightly more than the tip. He should regain the function of what's left of the index finger... But yeah..."
    my "他失去的不只是指尖。剩下的食指应该还能恢复功能……不过就是这样了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:527
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d32e9ad4:

    # sa "How long will surgery take?"
    sa "手术要多久？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:529
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_0924450b:

    # my "It won't take long, since they're just stitching him back up - maybe an hour or two."
    my "不会太久，他们只是把他缝合起来——大概一两个小时而已。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:531
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d9ea6646:

    # js "We can wait here until he wakes up."
    js "我们可以在外面等他醒来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:533
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_16533482:

    # my "He is awake. They are giving him local anesthetics."
    my "他醒了。他们正在给他局部麻醉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:534
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_22957340:

    # my "And yeah, I'm not leaving until I get to see him again."
    my "而且，我也不打算走，直到再见到他为止。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:536
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e8c004d4:

    # sa "We will all wait for him."
    sa "我们都在这儿等他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:540
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_15db0b91:

    # ji "I'm still shaking..."
    ji "我还在发抖..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:542
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_fcadbc4d:

    # js "He'll be alright."
    js "他没事的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:548
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_7e9fe4db:

    # sa "[name]? How are you?"
    sa "[name]你怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:550
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b5dd892a:

    # mc "I think the adrenaline has worn off. I feel sick."
    mc "我觉得肾上腺素已经消退了，我现在感觉恶心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:551
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b174c338:

    # mc "About Derek... And..."
    mc "关于Derek……还有……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:553
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_dcf9f909:

    # mc "Bella? How are you doing?"
    mc "贝拉？你怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:557
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2ce80efe:

    # ji "*{i}Sniffles{/i}* Bella?"
    ji "*{i}抽泣{/i}*贝拉？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:561
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_fc4d1c80:

    # mc "Bella... I'm...confused."
    mc "贝拉……我有点迷糊。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:562
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_4225f53e:

    # mc "What is that room?"
    mc "那间屋子是什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:564
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1ac87104:

    # ji "[name]..."
    ji "[name]..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:566
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_499e9f1b:

    # mc "We all saw it. It turned my stomach to see what was in there."
    mc "我们所有人都看到了。看到里面的东西，我胃里一阵翻腾。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:568
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_cf1f364e:

    # ji "But don't push her on it."
    ji "但别逼她谈这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:570
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_733e82ae:

    # isa "It's ok, Jill."
    isa "没关系，Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:572
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_4fe22c58:

    # isa "I hoped that I'd never have to tell you about this because it's too hard for me to talk about."
    isa "我希望我永远不用告诉你们这件事，因为对我来说说出来实在太难了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:573
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c4cb2ea3:

    # isa "But you all saw it... And..."
    isa "但你们所有人都看到了……还有……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:575
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1c70ace7:

    # ji "Bella, you don't have to explain yourself."
    ji "贝拉，你不用解释自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:577
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d810c22f:

    # isa "If I don't, it will loom over me like a dark cloud."
    isa "如果我不说，它就会像一片阴云一样一直笼罩着我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:582
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c99a3d9e:

    # isa "I met my husband, James, back in my second year of college."
    isa "我是在大二的时候遇见我丈夫James的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:583
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a815b17b:

    # isa "He was taking single classes and learning different languages."
    isa "他当时只上单科课程，正在学习各种语言。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:590
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_8b9f43f2:

    # isa "We often ran into each other while studying at the campus library, and we took a liking to each other."
    isa "我们经常在校园图书馆学习时碰面，渐渐地，我们彼此产生了好感。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:598
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1ca729d3:

    # isa "It didn't take long for us to fall in love, but I didn't realize whom I had fallen in love with."
    isa "我们没过多久就相爱了，但我直到后来才明白自己爱上了谁。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:600
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_10f5a521:

    # isa "James was three years older than me, and he served in the Special Forces."
    isa "James比我大三岁，他在特种部队服役。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:602
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_5bac6eb5:

    # isa "He was taking classes between missions, and when I realized that he was going away on an intermittent basis, I thought that was it for us."
    isa "他在任务之间上课，当我意识到他经常间歇性地外出执行任务时，我以为我们的关系就这样结束了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:604
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_780ce526:

    # isa "But when he returned home, he hadn't forgotten about me."
    isa "但当他回来时，他还没忘记我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:605
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_af1b256e:

    # isa "And my love for him was...still as big as before he left."
    isa "我对他的爱……依然和他离开前一样强烈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:607
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_53d9b95a:

    # isa "We both felt it. It was true love."
    isa "我们俩都感到了。那是真正的爱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:609
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_46c2da5f:

    # isa "After I graduated from college, we moved in together."
    isa "我大学一毕业，我们就一起搬进去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:610
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_4c2b06a2:

    # isa "I got used to him being away for long periods. It wasn't the best for our relationship, but it made the time we spent together invaluable."
    isa "我渐渐习惯了他长时间离开。虽然这对我们的关系不太好，但我们在一起的时光变得格外珍贵。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:612
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c446c13c:

    # isa "When I was 26 years old, my parents died suddenly."
    isa "26岁那年，我父母突然去世了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:613
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_ff0738aa:

    # isa "They lost their lives in a freak car accident after getting T-boned by a truck."
    isa "他们死于一场离奇的车祸，被一辆卡车迎面撞上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:615
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e72db348:

    # isa "At that time, it was the toughest crisis of my life. Luckily, I had James by my side."
    isa "那时候是我人生中最艰难的时期。幸运的是，我有James在我身边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:616
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1cd9790f:

    # isa "He was granted permission to stay off work for a while, and we decided to move into my parents' home - my house."
    isa "他被准许暂时休工，我们决定搬进我父母家——我的房子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:617
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_7a173667:

    # isa "It was hard, but we started a new life together here."
    isa "很难，但我们在这里开始了新的生活。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:619
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_0ac62f25:

    # isa "After a few years, we got married."
    isa "几年后，我们结了婚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:621
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_82b40de1:

    # isa "We talked about having a child, but it wasn't feasible with his work."
    isa "我们讨论过要个孩子，但他的工作实在不允许。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:622
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_3ae357b5:

    # isa "He would be away on up to year-long missions, and I'd only hear from him a couple of times per month at best."
    isa "他每次都会离开一整年，我一个月最多只能收到他几次消息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:624
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_45db8e3d:

    # isa "I felt so alone when he was away, but life became a routine."
    isa "他不在的时候我感觉特别孤单，但生活渐渐变成了一种固定的节奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:626
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b78652bf:

    # isa "After I had turned 30, I told him I wanted a child and that I wouldn't be able to wait much longer."
    isa "三十岁那年，我告诉他我想有个孩子，而且我等不下去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:627
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c9792b57:

    # isa "We were both getting older, and it felt like time kept passing us by."
    isa "我们都在变老，感觉时间一直在慢慢从我们身边溜走。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:629
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2081a286:

    # isa "He wanted us to try to get pregnant, but I feared it would be too hard for me to take care of a child on my own when he's away at work."
    isa "他想让我们试着怀孕，但我担心自己一个人带孩子会太难，尤其是他工作的时候总是不在身边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:630
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_ebec6cd1:

    # isa "He said he was planning his retirement, but that it wasn't possible yet."
    isa "他说他正在计划退休，但说这还不能实现。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:632
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_676be3e4:

    # isa "Even so...we started trying."
    isa "即便如此……我们开始尝试了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:634
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d8aaceef:

    # isa "We tried... And we tried..."
    isa "我们试了...我们试了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:635
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_33df6456:

    # isa "I was naive. I thought getting pregnant would be easy."
    isa "我太天真了。我以为怀孕很容易。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:636
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_6062e431:

    # isa "I thought having unprotected sex once or twice was enough."
    isa "我以为只要发生无保护性行为一两次就足够了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:638
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_80d86aa7:

    # isa "But the older you get, the harder it gets."
    isa "但你越老，就越难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:639
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_50bce4ee:

    # isa "And it didn't help that James left for work while we were trying."
    isa "而且他离开去上班的时候，我们正处在那个阶段。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:641
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_32f9fc07:

    # isa "But then, one day, he returned from a mission and said what I had waited to hear."
    isa "但有一天，他从任务回来，说了我一直在等的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:642
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1348d9c3:

    # isa "\"I'm retiring.\""
    isa "“我退休了。”"

# episode12\update12.rpy:644
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_69fc4820:

    # isa "I couldn't believe my ears."
    isa "我简直不敢相信自己的耳朵。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:645
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_fb5c678f:

    # isa "He said he would go on one final mission in four months and then return as a free man. And that our future could be anything that I wanted."
    isa "他说他还有四个月就要执行最后一次任务，之后就会作为一个自由的人回来。他还说，我们的未来可以是我想过的任何样子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:647
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d88c3f98:

    # isa "I was overjoyed to hear that, and it was as if something changed inside of me."
    isa "我听到那个消息高兴得不行，感觉心里有什么东西变了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:649
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b5facf53:

    # isa "We both cried when we learned that I was pregnant."
    isa "我们俩得知我怀孕的时候都哭了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:650
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_93fab027:

    # isa "For me, they were happy tears, but for him... the tears were twofold."
    isa "对我而言，那是喜极而泣，但对他来说，眼泪却包含了两重意思。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:652
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_48e4c816:

    # isa "Although he was happy about the baby, he was also sad that he had to leave me again during pregnancy."
    isa "虽然他为宝宝感到高兴，但也因为要在怀孕期间离开我而感到难过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:653
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1a88dcc9:

    # isa "For the first time, I truly felt that he didn't want to leave."
    isa "第一次，我真正感觉到他不想离开。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:655
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b6072bd6:

    # isa "I didn't want him to leave either. I begged him to stay."
    isa "我也不希望他离开。我求他留下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:656
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_3511f8dd:

    # isa "He told me he was sorry and wished he could get out of it, but he couldn't."
    isa "他跟我说他很抱歉，说他真希望可以摆脱这一切，但他实在没办法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:658
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_ee2b5f63:

    # isa "I saw the remorse in his eyes as he left."
    isa "我看到他离开时眼中满是懊悔。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:659
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_92416925:

    # isa "It hurt to see him leave, but it was supposed to be the final time he left me like that..."
    isa "看到他离开我，心里很痛，但这次本该是他最后一次这样离开我了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:662
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c42fd757:

    # isa "And it was..."
    isa "而且它……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:663
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d0c61c24:

    # isa "But in a different way than I had imagined."
    isa "但这次离开的方式，和我想象的不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:666
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_19b9607a:

    # isa "One night, I received a phone call."
    isa "有一天晚上，我接到了一个电话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:667
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_caf9b252:

    # isa "It was an officer calling me to tell me that James was M.I.A."
    isa "是一名军官打电话告诉我，James被列为M.I.A。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:668
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_10e09292:

    # js "M.I.A.?"
    js "M.I.A.？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:670
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_8b4380e8:

    # isa "Missing in action."
    isa "失踪了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:671
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a94f10f1:

    # isa "The officer couldn't tell me any details but said there was a chance that James was still alive."
    isa "警察没给我任何细节，但说还有可能James还活着。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:672
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_cd623cd0:

    # isa "However, they presumed that he was either dead or abducted."
    isa "不过他们认为他要么死了，要么被绑架了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:674
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1a5add2a:

    # isa "I dropped the phone and screamed out loud as I received the news."
    isa "我扔掉了电话，大声尖叫了出来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:675
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_9f4a1ee0:

    # isa "It felt like a nightmare. Everything was spinning, and I felt helpless."
    isa "感觉像场噩梦。一切都在旋转，我感到无助。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:677
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c5a028e0:

    # isa "During the emotional time that followed, my stomach started hurting."
    isa "在那段情绪低落的时光里，我的肚子开始疼了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:679
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_fdf04e7f:

    # isa "I had a miscarriage..."
    isa "我流产了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:681
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e9042af2:

    # isa "I prayed that James still would return, but if he were alive, I wouldn't know how to tell him that our daughter was dead."
    isa "我祈祷着James还能回来，但如果他活着，我却不知道该怎么告诉他，我们的女儿已经死了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:683
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_84203c11:

    # isa "And I felt that I had to leave the nursery I prepared for her that way until he had returned..."
    isa "我觉得自己只能一直保留那间为她准备的婴儿房，直到他回来……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:692
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e530cd7f:

    # isa "I forgot to lock it..."
    isa "我忘记锁上了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:693
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2afaa669:

    # isa "If I had locked it... You wouldn't have known."
    isa "如果我当时锁上了……你也不会知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:695
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1a10b5d0:

    # ji "You have nothing to be ashamed of, Bella."
    ji "你没什么好觉得羞耻的，贝拉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:697
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_94276c35:

    # isa "I need to get some air."
    isa "我需要出去透透气。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:701
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:703
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_85e0d5fe:

    # mc "What do I do? Can I follow?"
    mc "我该怎么办？我能跟上去吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:705
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_bf6a033a:

    # my "Yes. Go with them."
    my "对，跟上去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:707
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_d8513dd7:

    # mc "But... But... What do I say?"
    mc "但...但...我该说什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:709
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_7409716c:

    # my "Just be there for her."
    my "只要在她身边就行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:714
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_90a87589:

    # isa "*{i}Shudders{/i}*"
    isa "*{i}发抖{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:716
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e65407e0:

    # ji "Bella, it's too cold outside."
    ji "贝拉，外面太冷了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:718
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_f0cb6408:

    # isa "I can't go back in there."
    isa "我不能回去那儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:720
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_77a33b15:

    # ji "Everyone understands. They will support you. Right, [name]?"
    ji "大家都能理解。他们会支持你的。对吧，[name]?"

# episode12\update12.rpy:722
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_f6043ed5:

    # mc "Uh... Yeah."
    mc "嗯... 是的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:724
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_43342e95:

    # ji "If you can't go back inside, at least let's sit in the car for a while."
    ji "如果你不能进去的话，至少让我们在车里坐一会儿吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:734
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_fa38dbe3:

    # isa "After I had miscarried... I was lost."
    isa "流产之后……我整个人都垮了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:736
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_73e95df2:

    # isa "I stayed at home from work for a while."
    isa "我请了几天假待在家里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:738
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a712869f:

    # isa "And they gave me antidepressants to manage the sorrow."
    isa "他们给我开了抗抑郁药来缓解悲伤。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:739
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_bbc57712:

    # isa "But no amount of pills could make it better."
    isa "但再怎么吃药也没法让我好起来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:741
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_200d7ce7:

    # isa "I had lost everything of importance to me."
    isa "我失去了对我最重要的所有东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:742
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_f5baac2a:

    # isa "I tried my best to survive the hell I was living in, but I couldn't..."
    isa "我拼了命想活下去，可我还是撑不下去了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:743
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2b850d12:

    # ji "*{i}Sobs{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:749
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_4e1fc8b2:

    # isa "I went back to work and tried to return to daily life."
    isa "我回到工作岗位，努力重新适应日常生活。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:753
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1c60da46:

    # isa "I started to see James everywhere."
    isa "我开始在每个地方都看到James。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:754
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_19d8dd2f:

    # isa "He talked to me as if he were there with me. And I talked to him."
    isa "他跟我说话，就像他真的在我身边一样。而我，也跟他说话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:756
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_c146bfd1:

    # isa "But it was all in my head."
    isa "但这全都是我脑子里的幻觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:758
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_94aa681d:

    # isa "I wasn't ready to return to work, and they made me leave again."
    isa "我没准备好回去上班，他们又把我赶了出来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:759
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_34327c45:

    # isa "And as they were laying off personnel, I was laid off too."
    isa "随着他们裁员，我也被裁了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:761
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_01bcdf6c:

    # isa "With nowhere to go and no one by my side, I stopped caring about it all..."
    isa "无处可去，身边也没有人，我干脆就不再在乎这一切了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:762
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_f637acbd:

    # isa "I didn't want to live anymore."
    isa "我不想活了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:764
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_8495f2ab:

    # isa "So, I grabbed a bottle of sleeping pills they had given me and..."
    isa "于是我抓起一瓶他们给我的安眠药，打算……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:766
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1687cf73:

    # mc "Oh my God..."
    mc "天啊..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:769
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_bf93d7da:

    # isa "Luckily... My old neighbor spotted me as I collapsed on the kitchen floor."
    isa "幸好……我昏倒在我家厨房地板上时，老邻居看到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:771
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_236b64be:

    # isa "I woke up alone in a hospital bed."
    isa "我醒在医院的病床上，一个人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:772
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_cff44c07:

    # isa "It was as if something or someone didn't want me to go that way."
    isa "就像有什么东西或什么人不想让我走那条路。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:774
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a101b922:

    # isa "I was given a second chance, and the hospital coerced me into getting help."
    isa "我被给了第二次机会，医院逼着我接受帮助。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:780
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e3bef049:

    # mc "(I can't believe this... Fuck...)"
    mc "（我简直不敢相信...见鬼的...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:781
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a6e76b4c:

    # mc "(How is she doing now? Can I even ask her?)"
    mc "（她现在怎么样了？我甚至能问吗？）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:785
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1d8847df:

    # mc "I'm going to head back inside..."
    mc "我得回去了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:788
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_00ea0349:

    # ji "[name]?"
    ji "[name]?"

# episode12\update12.rpy:793
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1f18395c:

    # my "He is getting stitched up. We'll get out of here soon."
    my "他正在缝针，我们很快就能出去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:794
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_64863ad6:

    # my "No, you don't have to come here. We're all here with him; stay at home with Mom."
    my "不，你不用过来。我们都在这儿，让他待着，你回家陪陪你妈吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:796
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_1dfc17b8:

    # my "Yeah, I can do that. If you insist..."
    my "嗯，我行。如果你坚持的话……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:797
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a615c21d:

    # my "I'll let you know."
    my "我会通知你的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:799
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b4476510:

    # my "Uh... Wow. Bye."
    my "嗯...哇。拜拜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:801
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_495ba589:

    # js "What's wrong?"
    js "怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:803
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_5a3c454e:

    # my "Dad said he loved me. I think he was in shock."
    my "我爸说他爱我。我想他当时是震惊了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:805
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_37152217:

    # my "He wanted to come here, but I told him not to."
    my "他想过来，但我让他别来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:806
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_ba7cba2c:

    # my "But he insisted on seeing Derek, so I promised to let him know when we're leaving."
    my "但他坚持要见Derek，所以我答应告诉他我们什么时候离开。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:808
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_71b23cf0:

    # js "[name]? How is Bella?"
    js "[name]贝拉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:810
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_440695d7:

    # mc "I feel queasy."
    mc "我感觉有点反胃。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:812
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_a766a75b:

    # sa "What's the matter?"
    sa "怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:814
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_47a6770f:

    # mc "It's Bella... I..."
    mc "是贝拉……我……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:815
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e5b2aaa4:

    # mc "I can't handle this."
    mc "我受不了了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:817
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_b3aa1f7e:

    # sa "There isn't a perfect way of doing it. All you can do is sympathize and listen."
    sa "没有完美的方式能处理这种事。你只能表示同情，好好听她说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:819
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2ca053a0:

    # mc "She told me she attempted suicide."
    mc "她跟我说她尝试过自杀。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:821
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_86f9f4e7:

    # js "What?"
    js "怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:823
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_9d2e49e4:

    # mc "Help me. What do I even say to that?"
    mc "帮我一把。我该跟她说什么才好？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:824
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_2573b7b9:

    # mc "I... I..."
    mc "我……我……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:837
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_e3fc3f6b:

    # sa "Bella's car is gone. They left."
    sa "贝拉的车不见了，他们走了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:839
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_f4908772:

    # js "Jill is with her, right?"
    js "Jill现在在她身边吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:841
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_70d846e8:

    # my "Maybe they went back home."
    my "也许他们回去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:842
translate schinese ep12_hospital_label_3e35ed37:

    # my "Let them have some space. If Jill is with Bella, I'm sure they are all right."
    my "让他们有空间。如果Jill在贝拉身边，我想他们应该没事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:853
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_77500a1a:

    # ty "Everybody, get in the meeting room! NOW!!!"
    ty "大家，都给我进会议室！现在就立刻！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:855
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_d8323f49:

    # tr "Why are you shouting?"
    tr "你干嘛大喊大叫？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:857
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_80e93d18:

    # ty "Because it hurts to walk downstairs."
    ty "因为走下去会疼。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:858
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_83641706:

    # ty "Bring everyone! That's an order from your president."
    ty "召集所有人！这是会长的命令。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:860
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_8708477f:

    # tr "You heard him."
    tr "你听他说话了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:862
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f1c4d77a:

    # go "Aw... A meeting now? But it's our free time."
    go "唉...现在就要开会？但这是我们的自由时间啊。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:864
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_40424ac5:

    # tr "There better be a good reason to call a meeting at this hour."
    tr "这时候叫开会肯定有好事发生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:866
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_335f670c:

    # ty "They've surely done it this time. It's outrageous!"
    ty "他们这次肯定又干了什么。简直不可理喻！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:868
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_16c6e90a:

    # rich "Who has done what?"
    rich "谁干的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:870
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_3fe4e3b1:

    # ty "Those dirty fraternity slobs! The Delta Iota Kappas!"
    ty "那些肮脏邋遢的兄弟会混球！德尔塔·艾欧塔·卡帕！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:872
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_0ffb0fa4:

    # ty "I suppose none of you know anything about this."
    ty "我想你们应该都不知道这件事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:874
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_bdd7a44d:

    # cr "Is that a letter?"
    cr "这是信吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:876
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_326fa9ee:

    # ty "Aha! So, you do know about it! What do you know?"
    ty "啊！所以你确实知道这件事！你知道些什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:878
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5886a2c9:

    # cr "Nothing. I saw it in your hand and guessed it was a letter."
    cr "没什么。我看到你手里拿着，猜是封信。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:880
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_05838660:

    # ty "Well, my first guess was that it was a telegram, but it was not."
    ty "那我第一反应是电报，结果不是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:882
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_a615211b:

    # ty "What are you wearing!?"
    ty "你穿的是什么！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:884
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_c15cc7d6:

    # lu "..."
    lu "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:886
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_538a6659:

    # ty "That is MY suit! Are you stealing my look?"
    ty "那是我的西装！你这是在偷我的造型？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:888
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_ba101536:

    # cr "I warned you..."
    cr "我警告过你……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:890
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_2340c3b5:

    # ty "You cannot wear that. Take it off! It's an order."
    ty "你不能穿那身。脱下来！这是命令。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:892
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_a7fd3613:

    # lu "Come on! It's a suit. I bought it for myself."
    lu "行啊，这可是我买的，我自己穿的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:894
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_d36f789b:

    # rich "Seriously... That's a low-class move, Lucas."
    rich "说真的……这手段太下作了，Lucas。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:896
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_ccaac906:

    # ty "Do you think it's funny? Do you see anyone laughing?"
    ty "你觉得这好笑吗？你看到有人在笑吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:897
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_4482be68:

    # ty "You and I need to have a serious discussion about your future here if these are the kind of antics that you get your jollies from."
    ty "你我需要认真谈谈你的未来，如果这就是你找乐子的方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:899
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_b7caea9d:

    # tr "Can't this argument wait? Rich needs to return to writing his essay, and I had a long day."
    tr "这番争执能不能等会再说？Rich得回去写论文了，我今天一天都够累的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:900
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_b0e419b5:

    # tr "Get to the point about the letter."
    tr "说正经的，那封信到底怎么回事？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:904
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_d152ef52:

    # ty "As I was saying..."
    ty "我刚才说的……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:905
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_213c1ecd:

    # ty "Someone put this telegram-looking letter by my door. This is what it reads..."
    ty "有人把一封看起来像电报的信放在我的门前。这封信上写着……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:908
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_10135824:

    # ty "\"The DIKs\"-"
    ty "“《迪克》的创始人。”"

# episode12\update12.rpy:910
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_04666365:

    # ty "That's colloquial for Delta Iota Kappas, if you're not following."
    ty "这是指德尔塔·艾奥塔·卡帕斯，如果你不了解的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:912
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_b8a9e3b7:

    # ty "\"The DIKs are a threat that needs to be dealt with once and for all. The time is now.\""
    ty "“DIKs 是个必须彻底解决的威胁。现在就是时候了。”"

# episode12\update12.rpy:913
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_baca0c60:

    # ty "\"The proof in this letter should tell you all you need to know.\""
    ty "这封信里的证据应该已经说明了一切。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:914
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f0353790:

    # ty "\"The DIKs have wronged many. But together we are strong. Together we are Legion.\""
    ty "“DIKs伤害了很多人。但只要我们团结一致，就无所畏惧。我们就是军团。”"

# episode12\update12.rpy:916
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_7f483636:

    # lu "That sounds so cringe."
    lu "听起来太尴尬了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:918
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_1f1b9ba7:

    # cr "Shh..."
    cr "嘘..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:920
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5387b6e2:

    # ty "\"Let's bring the battle to their doorstep. Fight with all your might.\""
    ty "让我们把战场带到他们家门口，全力以赴地战斗。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:921
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_fa1c474c:

    # ty "\"If you're still not convinced. Look at the material using this link.\""
    ty "如果你还没被说服，就用这个链接看看材料。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:922
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_57fa27f9:

    # ty "And then it ends with a link to a website."
    ty "然后结尾是一个网站链接。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:924
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_6699e69a:

    # rich "What's on it?"
    rich "上面有什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:926
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5dd1d176:

    # ty "I haven't got the foggiest idea. All I had to see were the atrocious images in the envelope to know that this was the real deal."
    ty "我连个屁都摸不着。我只用看看信封里那些恶心的图片就知道，这玩意儿是真货。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:927
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5fc3d788:

    # ty "Take a look at them! Pass them around!"
    ty "看看这些！传开去！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:932
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_1f5f127a:

    # go "What are we looking at?"
    go "我们看到什么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:934
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_ce9f71d1:

    # lu "I saw some of these on campus already. Didn't you?"
    lu "我之前在学校里已经看到一些了。你没看到吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:935
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_4f976cd6:

    # lu "Mine has someone voiding their bladder on Tybalt's bed."
    lu "我的那张有人在我床上撒尿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:937
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f23019ec:

    # ty "Do you find this amusing!?"
    ty "你觉得这很好笑吗！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:939
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_6e69b972:

    # cr "No, I'm sure he doesn't. Right?"
    cr "不，我确定他不会。对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:941
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_bcd6f2c4:

    # lu "No..."
    lu "没……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:945
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_3b8a533c:

    # rich "Oh! That's your family's heirloom!"
    rich "哦！那可是你家传的传家宝！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:947
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_005702f6:

    # ty "It is! And there they are, posing with it as if it's theirs."
    ty "就是它！他们还摆在旁边合影，搞得像是自己的东西一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:949
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_864fa17e:

    # cr "And that's my cane and top hat. They stole those, too, and I'm missing a suit."
    cr "还有我的手杖和礼帽，他们也偷走了，我连一套西装都没了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:951
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_ee699d0f:

    # tr "These are pictures from your room... So, the DIKs were the burglars all along?"
    tr "这些是你房间的照片……所以，一直都是DIKs在搞偷窃？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:953
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_a25c1362:

    # ty "Theft and pranks! That's what they are all about."
    ty "盗窃和恶作剧！这就是他们干的一切。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:954
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_a6ad2f69:

    # ty "And from the sound of it, many more have been affected by the Delta Iota Kappas' antics."
    ty "听起来还有更多人受到了德尔塔·艾欧塔·卡帕兄弟会恶作剧的影响。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:956
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_ac496853:

    # go "I can't stand them either. On top of this, they stole Beth from me."
    go "我也不喜欢他们。更糟的是，他们还偷走了我的Beth。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:958
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f59e2bbc:

    # rich "Who's Beth?"
    rich "谁是Beth？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:960
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_86ed78a6:

    # cr "It's a girl he likes. She made out with a DIK at their Halloween party."
    cr "这是他喜欢的女孩。她在万圣节派对上和一个DIK接吻了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:962
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_b16244dc:

    # ty "They love taking what's not theirs to take - including our women."
    ty "他们喜欢拿不属于自己的东西——包括我们的女人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:964
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_d26b0361:

    # rich "Show us the website. I have to see what that one is about. What else did they do?"
    rich "展示给我们看看网站。我得看看那个到底是什么。他们还干了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:970
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5b4e6a3c:

    # ty "Nothing will surprise me at this stage. I'm sure there will be more material of this nature."
    ty "这种时候还有什么能让我吃惊的？我确定还会看到更多这种材料。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:974
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f2b2ebb4:

    # go "What's that?"
    go "那是什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:976
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_f86ee64b:

    # cr "It looks like drone footage of our mansion."
    cr "看起来像是我们庄园的无人机拍摄画面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:978
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_18d6be89:

    # tr "That's during our alumni party. Look... You guys are on it."
    tr "那是我们校友聚会的时候。看吧……你们几个都在上面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:979
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_eada11ce:

    # rich "They spied on us?"
    rich "他们偷看了我们？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:981
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_4f20c9ba:

    # ty "Reconnaissance... Classic thieves."
    ty "侦察... 经典的偷窥手段。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:982
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_dfb342b6:

    # ty "Don't forget how they ruined that party for us. And how they humiliated our esteemed guests."
    ty "别忘了他们是怎么毁了我们的派对，还有怎么羞辱我们的尊贵客人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:983
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_5936b1cf:

    # ty "This proves that it was premeditated."
    ty "这证明他们是有预谋的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:985
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_4e845e13:

    # tr "That's subpar behavior, but what are we going to do?"
    tr "这行为算不上什么好事，但我们能怎么办？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:987
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_3f19c65c:

    # ty "And that's the spirit! What are we going to do!?"
    ty "这才是我要的精神！我们该怎么办！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:990
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_3916b814:

    # ja "{i}I'm gonna fuck your brains out, [name]!{/i}"
    ja "{i}我要把你脑子搞烂[name]!{/i}"

# episode12\update12.rpy:992
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_30852fcd:

    # mc "{i}Ride me, Jade!{/i}"
    mc "{i}骑我，Jade！{/i}"

# episode12\update12.rpy:993
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_fd0b251e:

    # rich "Isn't that...?"
    rich "这不就是...？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:996
translate schinese ep12_prep_label_b30d9769:

    # ty "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!! MOMMY!!!"
    ty "不——！！！妈妈！！！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1009
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_69166a65:

    # "*{i}Door knock{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1010
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_68a1427f:

    # pa "Hello? Derek! Maya!"
    pa "你好？Derek！Maya！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1015
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_57e83408:

    # pa "Hello? The door was unlocked. I'm Patrick. I'm Derek and Maya's dad."
    pa "你好？门没锁。我是Patrick。我是Derek，还有Maya的爸爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1017
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_238e0afb:

    # pa "Hello? Is anyone at home?"
    pa "你好？家里有人吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1027
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_646ac0a2:

    # de "Dad?"
    de "爸爸？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1029
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ffb3efa2:

    # pa "Derek!"
    pa "Derek!"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1030
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_20744df3:

    # pa "What have you done to yourself?"
    pa "你把自己搞成什么样了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1032
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_74dd47f5:

    # de "My finger came off. It's the weirdest thing."
    de "我的手指掉了，太奇怪了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1034
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_1c9f8dd2:

    # pa "Dear Lord... How are you feeling?"
    pa "天啊……你感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1036
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c333cacd:

    # de "They gave me some painkillers and antibiotics... Haha... I'm doing fine..."
    de "他们给我开了点止痛药和抗生素……哈哈……我挺好的……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1038
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_bfe1245d:

    # de "The doctor said they couldn't put the fingertip back. So it will be shorter from now on."
    de "医生说他们不能把手指头接回去。从现在开始它就会短一点了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1039
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_721e5c27:

    # de "It's going to be weird not having a nail..."
    de "没指甲了还挺怪的..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1041
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_5ce97997:

    # pa "I was worried sick... Helen was too. She wanted to come, but I had to stop her."
    pa "我担心得要命……Helen也一样。她想过来，但我拦住了她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1043
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a90a37ab:

    # de "I'm fine. My friends helped me get to the hospital and back."
    de "我没事。我的朋友们帮我送我去医院又送我回来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1044
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_775e36ad:

    # de "I'm gonna call Mom and calm her down."
    de "我得给妈妈打个电话，让她别太担心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1048
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ebb4e092:

    # pa "Maya..."
    pa "Maya……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1051
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_76b2c4f1:

    # my "I thought you wouldn't come... How did you even know where Bella lived?"
    my "我以为你不会来……你到底是怎么知道贝拉住哪儿的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1053
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_2bee2bc5:

    # pa "I know, I know. But I had to see you. I checked the car app for recent trip data."
    pa "我知道，我知道。但我必须见你一面。我查了车用应用上的最近行程数据。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1054
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_95a52cf2:

    # pa "Are you ok?"
    pa "你没事吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1056
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_7937eb76:

    # my "I'm fine, Dad. But it was scary there for a moment."
    my "我没事，爸爸。但那会儿挺吓人的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1059
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_e14641af:

    # pa "I'm lucky that you were there with him."
    pa "我运气好，你在他身边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1061
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_69966b1d:

    # sa "You should have seen her; she did great. She didn't even hesitate after it happened."
    sa "你该看看她当时的样子，她表现得超棒，事情发生后都没犹豫过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1065
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b8c287a8:

    # pa "Josy... I wasn't expecting to meet you here."
    pa "Josy...我也没想到会在这里碰到你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1067
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a8c93e73:

    # js "Hello... It's...um...been a while."
    js "哈喽……呃……好久不见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1070
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d2c64cd8:

    # my "She's just my friend, Dad."
    my "她只是我朋友，爸爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1075
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_e8f35f5e:

    # my "Please, don't make a big deal of this, Dad."
    my "请别大惊小怪的，爸爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1077
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_13c06a44:

    # pa "Thank you all for being there for my son. I wanted to see for myself that he was ok."
    pa "谢谢大家在他需要的时候出现。我想亲自确认他没事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1078
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f771944b:

    # pa "And while I have you here, I'd also like to apologize for my behavior during Thanksgiving."
    pa "趁我还有机会，我也想为我在感恩节期间的行为道个歉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1080
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b3cde3e1:

    # pa "I'll leave and let you all recover. Again... Thank you for helping my son get to the hospital."
    pa "我会离开让大家好好恢复。再次感谢大家帮助我儿子送到医院。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1082
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_698abf49:

    # my "Dad, you can take the car. We'll manage without it."
    my "爸，你开车走吧，我们能搞定。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1084
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_386f9e6a:

    # pa "Are you sure?"
    pa "你确定吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1086
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_bc002754:

    # my "Mhm. The keys are in my jacket pocket."
    my "嗯，钥匙在我夹克口袋里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1090
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3937b9dd:

    # sa "That was something..."
    sa "那是个不错的开始..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1092
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ecc9950c:

    # my "I haven't had a chance to tell you yet, but we had a good moment together earlier today when we went to borrow the car."
    my "我还没来得及告诉你，但今天早上我们去借车的时候，我们之间有个不错的瞬间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1093
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_60a89e09:

    # my "I think there might be hope for him..."
    my "我觉得他还有机会..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1095
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b1d25b9f:

    # sa "That's amazing..."
    sa "这太棒了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1098
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_122387c7:

    # js "*{i}Mumbles{/i}* Friend..."
    js "*{i}嘟囔{/i}*朋友..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1102
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_9fd42a7f:

    # mc "Since Bella and Jill aren't here, should we try their phones?"
    mc "贝拉和Jill都不在，要不要试着打她们的电话？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1105
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_09d93d4d:

    # sa "I'll do it."
    sa "我来办。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1118
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3b215eb6:

    # js "[name]? How are you feeling?"
    js "[name]你感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1120
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f13622e3:

    # mc "I'm worried I fucked it up..."
    mc "我担心我搞砸了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1122
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_1f12ba22:

    # js "Fucked what up?"
    js "搞砸了啥？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1124
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_6fc7eb6b:

    # mc "Back at the hospital and in the car with Bella..."
    mc "回到医院，和贝拉一起坐在车里……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1125
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_83d2a295:

    # mc "I panicked..."
    mc "我慌了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1127
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_056deb38:

    # mc "I was at a loss for words..."
    mc "我都不知道该说什么了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1128
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_5346f401:

    # mc "You think you know someone..."
    mc "你真以为你了解一个人……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1130
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3042bd95:

    # mc "Not in a million guesses would I have guessed that this is what she kept in here."
    mc "猜一百万次，我也猜不到她在这里藏的是这种东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1132
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_5bd54443:

    # mc "I'm worried I made it worse for her. I forced it out of her, but at the same time, I couldn't handle hearing about it."
    mc "我担心我让她更难受了。我逼她说出来，但同时我也受不了听她讲这些。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1136
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_dec02a51:

    # js "We all react in different ways."
    js "我们每个人反应都不同。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1137
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_0a732ce6:

    # js "Like me, when Derek cut his finger... I just stood there."
    js "像我当初，当Derek划破手指的时候，我也是站在那儿一动不动。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1139
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a1af9bc3:

    # js "Everyone else was running around trying to help, but I froze."
    js "其他人正到处跑着帮忙，可我却僵在原地。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1140
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_6a47749e:

    # js "It took me a while to be helpful... Maybe that's what happened to you, too, with Bella."
    js "我过了一阵子才帮上忙……也许你面对贝拉时也是一样，当场愣住了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1142
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_591928ca:

    # sa "[name]! Josy! They're here."
    sa "[name]！Josy！她们到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1146
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ad98f017:

    # mc "Bella..."
    mc "贝拉……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1148
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_9bed5416:

    # isa "I'm sorry. But I had to leave."
    isa "对不起。但我必须离开。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1150
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_51a87f64:

    # js "Are you ok?"
    js "你没事吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1152
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_af8ce1ab:

    # isa "I feel stupid and ashamed. This is not how I wanted to tell anyone about this."
    isa "我觉得自己很蠢，也很丢脸。这不是我想要告诉任何人的方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1153
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3be54c6a:

    # isa "And definitely not when Derek was badly hurt."
    isa "尤其不能在Derek受了重伤的时候这样做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1155
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c73bb6e3:

    # isa "Derek, how are you doing?"
    isa "Derek，你感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1157
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f4eb790b:

    # de "Nine and a half out of ten. Haha!"
    de "九分半。哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1159
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_339f86cf:

    # my "He's on painkillers, but he'll be fine."
    my "他正在吃止痛药，但没事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1160
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_0570ee8a:

    # my "Maybe we should end the night."
    my "也许我们该结束这晚了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1162
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ec358d89:

    # isa "No. Please... That wouldn't make me feel better."
    isa "不。请……那样做不会让我感觉好受一点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1163
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b7f154a7:

    # isa "Please, stay. Let's talk and eat. I bet you're all hungry."
    isa "请留下，我们边吃边聊。我打赌你们都饿了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1164
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_37abf9de:

    # isa "If Derek is ok with it, of course."
    isa "如果Derek没问题的话，当然可以。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1166
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_0948b31c:

    # de "I'm fine. No Champagne though!"
    de "我没事。就是没香槟了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1168
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_62d3e204:

    # my "The food is all ruined..."
    my "这顿饭全毁了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:1171
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_29b2a9e0:

    # sa "Let's clean up and order pizza."
    sa "我们先收拾一下，然后点个披萨。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1186
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d905c0d0:

    # isa "I'm so sorry, guys."
    isa "各位，真的很抱歉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1188
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c1981e0f:

    # de "If there's anyone who should feel sorry, it's me. I ruined our night, didn't I?"
    de "如果有人该感到抱歉，那应该是我。我毁了我们的一晚，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1190
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_7497209d:

    # my "You guys don't have to keep apologizing. None of us blames you for anything that happened tonight."
    my "你们不用一直道歉。我们都没怪你们今晚发生的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1192
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_1d421b25:

    # isa "I can sense that you are worried about me, and I don't want you to feel on edge around me."
    isa "我能感觉到你担心我，我不想让你在我身边感到不安。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1193
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_1abef7e0:

    # isa "There will never be a good time to talk about this, but I don't want to end the story without telling you more."
    isa "从来就没有什么合适的时机去谈论这件事，但我不想在故事结束前，什么都没告诉你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1195
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_910113f5:

    # sa "You don't have to continue for our sake."
    sa "你们不用为了我们而继续说下去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1197
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b5b72374:

    # isa "But I want to because it gets better."
    isa "但我想要继续说下去，因为事情会变得更好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1200
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_4a59a132:

    # isa "As I told [name] in the car... After I had attempted to end my life, the hospital talked me into seeking help."
    isa "正如我告诉[name]在车里……在我试图结束自己的生命之后，医院劝我寻求帮助。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1210
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_54e273a6:

    # wom "My son's addiction eventually got the best of him."
    wom "我儿子的毒瘾最终把他给打败了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1211
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_73784aa8:

    # wom "He couldn't shake the demon inside, and he ended up taking his life...b-by..."
    wom "他甩不掉心里的那个恶魔，最后还是选择了结束自己的生命……拜——拜……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1212
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_14cdeb7a:

    # wom "...by jumping off a building."
    wom "...跳楼了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1214
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_b3d10dc8:

    # wom "*{i}Sobs{/i}* If I had only seen the signs earlier, I would have been able to help him."
    wom "*{i}抽泣{/i}*如果我早些时候看到那些迹象，就能帮助他了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1216
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ed04daad:

    # than "I hear that you're blaming yourself for your son's death."
    than "我听说你是在怪自己害死了儿子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1218
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3627d147:

    # wom "I do."
    wom "我确实这么想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1220
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c74b3296:

    # than "That's the demon inside {b}you{/b} speaking."
    than "体内的恶魔{b}你{/b}说话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1221
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_59e7a55c:

    # than "This might be triggering for some of you, but I will say it."
    than "这可能会让一些人感到不适，但我必须说出口。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1223
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c5189d45:

    # than "When someone who wants to commit suicide does it, and they don't let you know in any way, shape, or form..."
    than "当一个人想自杀却一点迹象都不给你时，他们根本没在求救。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1224
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_efedd3a4:

    # than "They aren't crying for help. They made a decision, and they went through with it."
    than "他们不是在求救。他们已经做出了决定，然后付诸行动了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1226
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_37b6cd5c:

    # than "If you see the signs, or if they try to tell you about it, that's them calling out for help."
    than "如果你看到迹象，或者他们试图告诉你些什么，那是在求救。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1227
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_334113e2:

    # than "I've seen this pattern with many people in my group over the years."
    than "我多年来在我们这个圈子里见过很多人的这种模式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1228
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f18fdbbe:

    # than "And regardless of whether there was a cry for help, those who remain tend to blame themselves."
    than "无论有没有人呼救，那些活下来的人往往会责怪自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1230
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_380cad72:

    # than "As you know, even I blamed myself for the loss of a loved one."
    than "正如你所知道的，我甚至曾因为失去亲人而责怪自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1232
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_75e8b811:

    # than "You might think it was your fault, it might have been your fault, or you found another way to blame yourself for it..."
    than "你可能会觉得是你的错，也可能是真的你的错，或者你找到了其他方式来责怪自己……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1233
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d4e7db45:

    # than "Regardless of why you blame yourself... You have to find a way to forgive yourself."
    than "不管你是怎么责怪自己的……你必须找到一种方式原谅自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1235
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_cf7f3d3a:

    # than "And that's the beauty of everyone here today. Together we can do that."
    than "这才是今天在座每个人最美的地方。我们一起能做到这一点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1236
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f69ba6a4:

    # than "And the healing starts with sharing."
    than "疗愈的第一步就是分享。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1237
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_4d2988ea:

    # than "Does anyone else have a story they'd like to share?"
    than "有人想分享自己的故事吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1241
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f1722d4c:

    # than "You don't have to share anything until you feel ready."
    than "你不用急着分享什么，等你准备好了再说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1242
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ac301fa7:

    # than "If no one else wants to share today, I'd like to introduce you to someone special..."
    than "如果今天没人想分享的话，我想介绍一位特别的人给大家认识……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1244
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_9eca158f:

    # than "Remember my story about Lana? This here is her younger sister, Jill."
    than "记得我上周讲的那个Lana的故事吗？这位就是她的妹妹，Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1246
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d3848662:

    # ji "Hi, everyone."
    ji "大家好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1248
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_6268ccbe:

    # than "Jill has lived through the same story as I told you last week, but from a different perspective."
    than "Jill也经历过我上周讲过的那个故事，只是从另一个角度。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1249
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a801f674:

    # than "Occasionally, she joins us to share her story and to listen to yours."
    than "偶尔她会加入我们，分享她的故事，也听听你们的经历。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1250
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_60132c04:

    # than "She's also a survivor like all of you."
    than "她也是个幸存者，跟你们所有人一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1252
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_6df868a0:

    # than "Jill? Would you like to tell us about your sister?"
    than "Jill，愿意给我们讲讲你姐姐吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1256
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a24827cc:

    # ji "I've done this many times, but I always find it hard to start talking."
    ji "我以前做过很多次，但每次开口都很难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1257
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_e3cb62f0:

    # ji "Yet I feel that putting my feelings into words has helped me cope."
    ji "但我觉得把感受用语言表达出来，确实帮助我缓解了很多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1259
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_e7555608:

    # ji "Today, it's easier for me to say that Lana is dead than it was before coming here."
    ji "今天，对我来说，说Lana已经死了比来这里之前要容易多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1260
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_88f0a222:

    # ji "I used to choke up saying those words - well, sometimes I still do - but it has gotten easier with time."
    ji "以前说这些话的时候我总是哽咽，有时候到现在还是这样，但时间久了，说起来就容易多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1262
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_abe0dfb0:

    # ji "Losing my sister... It has shaped my life."
    ji "失去妹妹……它改变了我的人生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1268
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_6fc21d73:

    # ji "Hi. I know I introduced myself to the group, but I'm Jill."
    ji "嗨，我知道我之前已经自我介绍了，但我就是Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1270
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_83aeec19:

    # isa "I'm sorry for your loss."
    isa "很抱歉听到你失去亲人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1272
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_e456206a:

    # ji "Thank you. And you are?"
    ji "谢谢。你是谁？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1274
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_86a46447:

    # isa "Isabella."
    isa "Isabella。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1276
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_392449dc:

    # ji "Thank you, Isabella. And how are you doing? Is the group working out for you?"
    ji "谢谢，Isabella。你怎么样？这帮人合你胃口吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1278
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d2657e43:

    # isa "I... I haven't opened up yet."
    isa "我……我还没敞开心扉呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1280
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_c5e6cb25:

    # ji "It's hard, isn't it?"
    ji "很难，不是吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1281
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_09c85e1b:

    # ji "What's the hardest part about it for you? For me, it was talking to strangers about someone I love."
    ji "对你来说最难的部分是什么？对我来说，就是跟陌生人谈一个我爱的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1282
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_913696a3:

    # ji "But after I had done it once, it felt liberating. Especially when I knew they all had similar stories."
    ji "但当我第一次做到之后，感觉整个人都轻松了。尤其是当我发现他们都有类似的故事时。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1284
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_1056dc51:

    # isa "I think it's like how you described it... Saying the words, that's the hardest part for me."
    isa "我觉得就像你描述的那样……说出口，才是最难的部分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1285
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_82d71d40:

    # isa "And to admit what harm I have done to myself."
    isa "承认我对自己造成了多大的伤害。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1289
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_209e9789:

    # ji "If you feel that it's too hard for you to say those words, you don't have to feel pressured to do it."
    ji "如果你觉得说出口那些话太难了，你不用强迫自己去做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1290
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_d5119291:

    # ji "Take it at your own pace. They'll come out of you eventually."
    ji "按你自己的节奏来，它们迟早会从你心里出来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1291
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_36ec9c9b:

    # ji "And trust me... It gets easier. Take it from someone who was inconsolable."
    ji "相信我……它会变得更容易。我是从一个曾哭到无法自拔的人那里说这话的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1293
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_a93b3a11:

    # ji "I'm glad that you're still here today, Isabella."
    ji "我很高兴你今天还能在这里，Isabella。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1294
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_f8fc05e8:

    # ji "And if you feel that it's easier to tell me in private, or someone else for that matter..."
    ji "如果你想私下跟我说，或者找别人说也行，我完全理解。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1295
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_cf550e51:

    # ji "You can say so. I'm sure there are many here who would want to listen to you."
    ji "你可以这么说。我确定这里有很多人想听你说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1304
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_ff346180:

    # isa "And that's how Jill and I met."
    isa "就是这样，我和Jill认识的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1306
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_653edb2a:

    # isa "Jill's help has been life-changing to me."
    isa "Jill的帮助彻底改变了我的人生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1307
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_bc4791ab:

    # isa "It was thanks to Jill that I managed to turn everything around."
    isa "多亏Jill，我才能彻底振作起来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1309
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_140a783a:

    # ji "You have helped me, too, I hope you know. In so many ways."
    ji "你也帮了我，我希望你知道，以很多种方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1311
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_124277ac:

    # isa "It still hurts, but the sorrow is different today."
    isa "它仍然痛，但今天的悲伤已经不一样了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1312
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_9edac6af:

    # isa "I want to move on and not feel alone anymore. I think that's what James would have wanted too."
    isa "我想往前看，不再感到孤单。我想，这大概也是James希望看到的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1315
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_7ac928a9:

    # isa "But taking those steps has felt tremendously hard for me, even though I've gotten help with that from someone special at this table."
    isa "但迈出这些步子对我来说感觉异常艰难，尽管有人特别在我身边帮助了我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1318
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_2fcddcd2:

    # sa "So, that's what has been going on between you two?"
    sa "所以，你们俩一直在一起？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:1320
translate schinese ep12_bellas_label_3e679271:

    # sa "So, have you two been together all this time?"
