    sy "当然，只要你的成绩够高，能算进你的专业就行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:2895
translate schinese ep12_sally_label_9be854d1:

    # sy "However, if you show that you can go above and beyond, you can use it to your advantage and get great opportunities."
    sy "不过，如果你能表现出超出预期的能力，就能把它变成自己的优势，获得很棒的机会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:2897
