# episode12\update12.rpy:3059
translate schinese ep12_jocks_label_091881d3:

    # al "If you ask me, he didn't punch him hard enough. I'd kick him in his nuts, too."
    al "要我说，他下手根本不够狠。我也会踢他蛋蛋的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:3061
translate schinese ep12_jocks_label_8288f35c:

    # dw "We all want to punch them and shit on their faces! But this is what happens when we do it without thinking."
    dw "我们谁都想冲上去揍他们一顿，踩他们脸上！但这就是我们不加思考就动手的下场。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:3062
