    dw "但竞争才刚刚开始..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:3092
translate schinese ep12_jocks_label_b7014453:

    # ch "I know. We just gotta do something. To show them and everyone else we're not cool with them."
    ch "我知道。我们得做点什么。要让他们和所有人看看，我们可不是好惹的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:3093
