    mc "不太好吧。我和Jill刚分手……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4273
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_3f4ad5f2:

    # mc "Not that good. Sage and I broke up..."
    mc "不太爽。我和Sage分手了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4275
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_6c20d02a:

    # mc "Not that good. Sage and I had a huge fight."
    mc "不太爽。我和Sage大吵了一架。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4278
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_ceda8d2a:

    # de "Oh... That explains it."
    de "哦……这下就明白了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4280
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_804602bb:

    # de "Oh... That explains it. What was the fight about?"
    de "哦……这下就明白了。那场争吵到底是因为什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4285
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_699f124e_1:

    # mc "Yeah... It wasn't pretty."
    mc "嗯……那场面真不咋地。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4287
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_becf5a5e:

    # de "How did you do it?"
    de "你是怎么做到的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4290
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_425d3867:

    # mc "I decided not to let her know about Jade."
    mc "我决定不让她知道关于Jade的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4291
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_4a954d3e:

    # mc "She didn't understand why I wanted to break up with her."
    mc "她不明白我为什么要和她分手。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4293
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_a85bee28:

    # de "What reason did you give her?"
    de "你跟她说什么理由？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4295
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_c0fa3e73:

    # mc "I told her I wasn't feeling it, but she didn't buy it."
    mc "我跟她说我感觉不到什么了，但她不信。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4296
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_303c11bf:

    # mc "She sensed that I was lying about why I broke up with her, but it didn't matter."
    mc "她察觉到我撒谎了，但那已经不重要了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4298
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_e2a9f4aa:

    # mc "I feel somewhat relieved that it's done..."
    mc "我感觉这件事终于结束了，多少有点释然……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4299
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_035f09b0:

    # mc "But at the same time... I didn't want to do it."
    mc "但与此同时……我也不太想这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4302
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_c4f49cc7:

    # de "I know, buddy. You sacrificed something for her."
    de "我知道，兄弟。你为她牺牲了一些东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4303
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_c4d84136:

    # de "She doesn't know it, and she never will, but you know it."
    de "她不知道，而且永远都不会知道，但你清楚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4304
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_fc401d54:

    # de "Try to find comfort in that."
    de "试着在那里面找点安慰吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4306
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_dbb6cc57:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I wish I could rewind time."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*我希望我能倒带时间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4308
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_51b1c385:

    # de "Life would be perfect if you could. Take the time you need to move on. There's no rush."
    de "如果能重来就好了。你慢慢来，不用着急。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4310
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_384122e1:

    # mc "Yeah... I will."
    mc "嗯……我会的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4312
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_483a972c:

    # de "When we talked earlier about this, you thought your relationship with Sage would be short-term."
    de "我们之前聊过这事时，你还觉得自己和Sage的关系不会长久。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4314
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_b1f452af:

    # mc "Yeah, but not this short. I feel like I'm wrong about things all the time."
    mc "嗯，但没想到会这么短。我总觉得自己老是在看错事情。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4315
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_1df1e7af:

    # mc "Maybe I was wrong about this, too."
    mc "也许我这次也想错了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4317
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_b0c9a470:

    # de "I think you did a good thing."
    de "我觉得你做得不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4318
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_2df584de:

    # de "There was no good choice for you. You did what you could."
    de "你当时根本没什么好选的。你已经尽力了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4320
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_a64e8bc0:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢谢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4322
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_0a4d86e1:

    # de "When we talked earlier about this, you didn't know what you wanted to be with Sage."
    de "我们之前谈过这件事的时候，你还不知道自己想和Sage有什么样的关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4323
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_af5f52b9:

    # de "That doesn't sound like it was love."
    de "那听起来不像是爱情。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4325
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_ac70f93c:

    # mc "Even so... It's going to take some time to recover from this."
    mc "就算这样……这事儿要花点时间才能恢复过来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4327
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_6f3787e4:

    # de "Take all the time you need. There was no good choice for you. You did what you could."
    de "随便你花多少时间。你当时没有好的选择，你已经尽力了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4329
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_a64e8bc0_1:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢谢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4330
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_006a9f76:

    # mc "But I'm not sure if we'll hang out together as a group again."
    mc "但我们可能不会再像以前那样一起出来玩了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4332
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_cb5ce93f:

    # mc "I decided to tell her about Jade."
    mc "我决定告诉她关于Jade的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4334
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_85030fc4:

    # de "Oh..."
    de "哦..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4336
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_3efe0811:

    # mc "If there were the tiniest chance that she'd forgive me, I wanted to try."
    mc "如果还有哪怕一丝她能原谅我的可能，我都想试试。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4337
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_e8a8cbdd:

    # mc "But she freaked out... I got to explain myself, but in the end, it didn't matter."
    mc "但她彻底崩溃了……我有机会解释，但最后也没用。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4339
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_6b2dfede:

    # mc "It crushed her. She was mad at me, and I think she was mad at her mom, too, but I took the blame."
    mc "这让她心碎了。她对我很生气，我想她也对她妈妈生气，但我却把责任全揽在自己身上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4340
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_859a9128:

    # mc "I owned up to my mistake... That's all I could do."
    mc "我承认了自己的错误……我只能做到这一步。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4342
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_069f36be:

    # mc "And I told her that I didn't want our relationship to end, and that there must be a way for her to forgive me."
    mc "我告诉她我不想我们的关系结束，而且一定有办法让她原谅我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4343
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_12a23e6c:

    # mc "But... She started hitting me as she broke up with me."
    mc "但她一边跟我分手，一边开始打我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4345
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_2abad44e:

    # de "There was no good choice in your situation. You did what you could."
    de "你当时那情况根本就没啥好选的。你已经尽力了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4346
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_9da1ff51:

    # de "I respect that you wanted to be honest with her, even though I would have taken a different approach to the situation."
    de "我理解你想要诚实面对她，虽然我处理方式可能会不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4348
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_fa45f281:

    # mc "Thanks..."
    mc "谢谢..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4349
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_5232f370_1:

    # mc "I'm not sure if we'll hang out together as a group again."
    mc "我不确定我们以后还会不会像以前那样一起出来玩了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4351
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_15da6779:

    # de "I see what you mean..."
    de "我明白你的意思..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4353
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_ae63bb0c_1:

    # mc "And what about you?"
    mc "那你怎么想？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4355
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_dfaf344f_1:

    # de "Hm?"
    de "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4359
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_cb70afb1:

    # mc "So..."
    mc "所以..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4360
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_9c933a0e:

    # mc "You and Ashley, huh?"
    mc "你和Ashley，是吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4362
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_abfba6cc:

    # de "I...think so."
    de "我...这么想的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4364
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_6cc0c268:

    # mc "You two made out. Trust me; she wants you."
    mc "你们俩亲过。相信我，她想要你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4366
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_7f500e57:

    # de "We've had sex before. A few kisses don't mean anything."
    de "我们之前做过爱。几个亲吻没什么大不了的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4367
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_b3a6c46c:

    # de "She was caught up in the moment."
    de "她当时就是被那阵子冲昏了头。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4369
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_9afad784:

    # mc "Do you want to be with her?"
    mc "你想和她在一起吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4371
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_7e5b2f45:

    # de "More than I want my fingertip back."
    de "比我想要我的手指头回来还要多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4373
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_1f546fec:

    # mc "Then go for it."
    mc "那就去吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4375
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_ad366c80:

    # de "I did. That's why we kissed."
    de "我确实吻过她。这就是为什么我们亲了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4376
translate schinese ep12_lclass_b_label_1e595d94:

    # de "But I've yet to see her break up with Anthony. Until that happens, I'm not going to assume anything."
    de "但我还没看到她和Anthony分手。在那之前，我可不会随便瞎猜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4391
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_4442d7fb:

    # de "Don't get any ideas now."
    de "别打什么歪主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4393
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_7c74d78a:

    # mc "Just because a girl smiles at me? You don't have to worry about that."
    mc "只要她对我笑一下？你就不用担心那个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4394
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_83f9f901:

    # mc "I'm gonna talk to Sally."
    mc "我要跟Sally谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4396
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_4f9c1fbd:

    # de "Normally, I'd recommend you get back on the horse, but I think you should wait a bit."
    de "通常我建议你赶紧再试一次，不过我觉得你还是等等比较好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4400
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_d89b3ceb:

    # mc "I know. I wasn't going to talk to her."
    mc "我知道。我本来是不想跟她说话的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4402
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_15f3ea52:

    # de "Good call. Nikita is hot, though."
    de "说的对。Nikita 是 性感，不过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4404
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_dd6d6b15:

    # mc "That's her name?"
    mc "这是她名字？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4406
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_825b47dd:

    # de "Yeah. She left a bag in my room on Halloween."
    de "嗯，她万圣节那天在我房间里留下了一个包。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4408
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "我明白了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4409
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_83f9f901_1:

    # mc "I'm gonna talk to Sally."
    mc "我要跟Sally谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4412
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_0a567ce6:

    # mc "Just because a girl smiles at me?"
    mc "只是因为一个女孩对我笑？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4413
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_74ac4f55:

    # mc "I need time, but talking to girls isn't getting back on any horse."
    mc "我需要点时间，但跟女孩聊天根本没法重新来过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4415
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_f0ad683b:

    # de "Well... Nikita is hot."
    de "嗯……Nikita确实很性感。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4417
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_dd6d6b15_1:

    # mc "That's her name?"
    mc "这是她的名字？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4419
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_825b47dd_1:

    # de "Yeah. She left a bag in my room on Halloween."
    de "对，她在万圣节那天把包忘在我房间了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4421
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_573fb1a4:

    # mc "Thanks for the info."
    mc "谢谢你的信息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4428
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_8ee11aca:

    # de "Go for it, dude."
    de "上吧，兄弟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4430
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_9e485664:

    # mc "Go for what?"
    mc "去追她啊？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4432
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_f61c3448:

    # de "For Nikita. She was smiling at you."
    de "给Nikita。她当时正冲着你笑呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4434
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_904c68de:

    # mc "Is that her name?"
    mc "这是她的名字吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4436
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_825b47dd_2:

    # de "Yeah. She left a bag in my room on Halloween."
    de "对，她在万圣节那天把一个包忘在我房间里了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4438
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_573fb1a4_1:

    # mc "Thanks for the info."
    mc "谢谢你的消息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4441
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_bf5f3a07:

    # mc "So... We-"
    mc "所以……我们——"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4444
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_960e31a3:

    # nik "Are you ok?"
    nik "你没事吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4446
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_2c381ad5:

    # mc "I tripped on my shoe. Let me try that again."
    mc "我踩到了自己的鞋。让我重新来一遍。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4448
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_56cc4dcc:

    # nik "Haha! Sure."
    nik "哈哈哈，当然。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4450
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_2411d4c6:

    # mc "*{i}Clears throat{/i}* So... We meet again."
    mc "*{i}清了清嗓子{/i}*所以……我们又见面了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4452
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_96cd654e:

    # nik "Hahaha!"
    nik "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4454
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_304cb4e8:

    # nik "*{i}Breathes out{/i}*"
    nik "*{i}呼出一口气{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4456
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_eebdb5fe:

    # nik "Hm? And you are?"
    nik "嗯？你是谁？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4457
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_ab58cee9:

    # nik "Oh, wait! It's you! Sorry, but I didn't recognize you in your clothes."
    nik "哦，等等！是你啊！抱歉，但我没认出你穿成这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4459
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_292f22ab:

    # mc "Good one."
    mc "好家伙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4461
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_b086e291:

    # nik "Haha! Hi, [name]."
    nik "哈哈！嗨，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4463
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_5764cb42:

    # mc "Hi, to you... Nikita."
    mc "嗨，你呢... Nikita。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4465
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_96a3d1c3:

    # nik "I'm impressed. You cared enough to find out my name."
    nik "这招挺管用的，你居然还费心查了我的名字。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4466
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_5d86c9c0:

    # nik "But it's also a tad concerning..."
    nik "但这也让人有点担心..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:4468
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_6dcca178:

    # mc "Trust me; I'm not a stalker. My friend Derek knew it."
    mc "相信我，我不是跟踪狂。我朋友Derek知道的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4470
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_be920c72:

    # nik "Aw... And the mystery is gone. I thought it was more enigmatic than that."
    nik "唉...看来谜团也没了。我本来还以为这事儿挺神秘的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4472
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_7fe749a4:

    # mc "I'm sorry to ruin the mystery, but I was going to find out your name somehow."
    mc "抱歉打破这层神秘感，但我本来就是打算想办法弄清楚你名字的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4473
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_cc1c79c1:

    # mc "It's not often someone keeps you from learning it. What other secrets are you hiding?"
    mc "这人能让你一直不知道，可不多见。你还有多少秘密藏着呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4475
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_1633793a:

    # nik "It's not a chase without a good bit of fun."
    nik "这可不是一场没有乐趣的追逐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4477
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_8122ff17:

    # mc "So, you were putting me up to it."
    mc "所以你是在引诱我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4479
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_f1143b18:

    # nik "Not intentionally, but you made me want to."
    nik "不是故意的，但你让我想说了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4481
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_0e9013c7:

    # mc "Why is that?"
    mc "为什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4483
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_b587e5e2:

    # nik "Imagine if I just told you."
    nik "想象一下如果我直接告诉你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4485
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_8de46e32:

    # mc "Well, the chase ends here."
    mc "好，追到这里为止。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4487
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_0e8461e0:

    # nik "It does? I mean, you were down on your knee a minute ago."
    nik "它真的有效？我是说，你刚才还跪着求我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:4489
translate schinese ep12_lclass_c_label_0a3fadbc:

    # mc "I think it's your turn to chase me for a change."
    mc "我觉得该换我来追你了。"

