    my "你让我信了。我就是第1498个追随者。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6094
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_da2d9118:

    # js "Oh! Look! 1500!"
    js "哦！看！1500！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6096
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_29dd9985:

    # my "Or something after that."
    my "或者那之后的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6098
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_2061b6ef:

    # my "That's a lot of unread messages and notifications. Don't you have to read all of those?"
    my "那堆未读消息和通知可真不少。你难道不用一个一个看吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6099
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_b301e0ab:

    # js "I did at first, but it was hard to keep up."
    js "我一开始是这么做的，但实在跟不上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6101
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_8ca5ab34:

    # js "Huh!? I've got a message."
    js "哈？我收到一条消息了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6103
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_3675a891:

    # my "Not just one. You have 99+ messages."
    my "不只是一个。你有99多条消息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6105
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_1cbb5007:

    # js "It's from TheDiane."
    js "这是TheDiane发的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6107
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_ee3813cc:

    # my "Who's that?"
    my "谁啊？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6109
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_3cb170b0:

    # js "Who's that!? TheDiane - or Diane Reed - is one of the most famous, independent fashion bloggers on CB."
    js "谁啊？！TheDiane，也就是黛安·里德，是CB上最有名的独立时尚博主之一。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6111
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_b7db2bde:

    # js "Look! This is her page."
    js "看！这就是她的主页。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6115
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_1b81c11a:

    # my "582,000 followers!? That's like a small country of fans."
    my "58.2万粉丝！？都快赶上一个小国家的人口了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6116
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_4935efbe:

    # js "I know! She's huge! Have you really never heard of her?"
    js "我知道！她可火了！你真的从来没听说过她？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6117
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_a613d345:

    # my "Nope. I never even saw her before."
    my "没看过。我以前连她是谁都不知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6118
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_f8440f71:

    # js "Then you're out of the loop. She's fearless and such an inspiration. Check this out!"
    js "那你可就落伍了。她可真是个敢想敢干的人，超级有启发性。你看看这个！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6122
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_d214a7ef:

    # js "She covers fashion, pop culture, and a fair deal of gossip."
    js "她还写时尚、流行文化和不少八卦新闻。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6123
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_37d5f9a8:

    # js "She also does some amateur modeling, as you can see in these pictures."
    js "她也偶尔做些业余模特工作，就像你看到的这些照片。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6127
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_367bddf2:

    # js "She's gorgeous!"
    js "她超好看的！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6128
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_d18dbee6:

    # my "Well, what does she want?"
    my "那她找你有什么事？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6130
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_c5da5f92:

    # js "She says she likes my blog! Oh my God! I can't believe it!"
    js "她说她喜欢我的博客！天啊！我简直不敢相信！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6131
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_abab395c:

    # js "She said she loved the winter fashion photo set I posted."
    js "她说她喜欢我发的冬季时尚照片系列。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6133
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_5221f0d0:

    # my "What's that?"
    my "那是什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6136
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_df52343c:

    # js "[name] and I went out to the lake with my camera and tripod to snap fashion pictures."
    js "[name]我和我的相机和三脚架去了湖边拍时尚照片。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6138
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_4026871c:

    # js "I went out to the lake with my camera and tripod to snap fashion pictures."
    js "我带着相机和三脚架去湖边拍时尚照。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6139
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_7f11b7c2:

    # js "Then I wrote a post about it and included some of the photos. "
    js "然后我写了一篇关于这件事的帖子，还放了一些照片进去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6141
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_447b30f1:

    # my "So, she reads your blog?"
    my "所以她看你的博客了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6143
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_48139011:

    # js "She probably noticed me liking and commenting on her posts."
    js "她可能注意到我喜欢并评论她的帖子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6145
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_1c457a5e:

    # js "She wants to use my photos in her upcoming post on the same topic."
    js "她想在她接下来的同主题帖子上用我的照片。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6147
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_6e083a30:

    # my "She wants to repost your content?"
    my "她想转载你的内容？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6149
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_e9bd7cfe:

    # js "She says she'll credit me and link my CB page to her followers as compensation."
    js "她说她会给我署名，并且把我的CB页面链接给她的粉丝作为补偿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6150
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_013cb4fa:

    # js "That is huge!"
    js "这可太棒了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6152
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_2767f74f:

    # my "582,000 people will see your pictures!?"
    my "会有58.2万人看到你的照片！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6154
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_374c22c9:

    # js "And maybe they'll join my page after! This is a huge opportunity, Maya!"
    js "说不定他们还会加我主页呢！这可是个大机会，Maya！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6155
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_a5c41b58:

    # js "I have to do it! Right?"
    js "我必须这么做！对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6157
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_c5315465:

    # my "I wouldn't want that many people to scrutinize what I wear. Are you sure about this?"
    my "我不想让这么多人盯着我穿什么。你确定要这么做吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6159
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_cb9beafa:

    # js "Don't you see the potential?"
    js "你没看到这背后的潜力吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6161
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_83ea9f5f:

    # my "I do. I'm just asking if this is what you want."
    my "我明白。我只是在确认这是否是你想要的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6162
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_e8e063ef:

    # my "I can't imagine having that many people read my thoughts and follow my advice."
    my "我根本想象不到有那么多人读我的想法，跟着我的建议走。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6163
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_72407493:

    # my "Who am I to give advice? And for what? Uh... No. Just no."
    my "我有什么资格给别人建议？而且是为了什么？呃……不，就是不行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6164
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_30d07a78:

    # my "Do you want that exposure? Is that the goal of your blog?"
    my "你想要这种曝光吗？这就是你博客的目标吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6166
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_bbe5ad28:

    # js "Maya... For the first time in my life, I feel like I've found something that I'm actually good at."
    js "Maya……这是我人生第一次觉得自己找到了真正擅长的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6167
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_fa3e08bd:

    # js "Can't you see how many people already like my blog?"
    js "你没看到现在已经有多少人喜欢我的博客吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6169
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_c41e3b32:

    # my "Which is it that you like? Being good at something or getting validation for it?"
    my "你是喜欢擅长某件事，还是喜欢得到别人的认可？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6171
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_2747cce6:

    # js "What is there not to like about either? I have found my creative outlet, and people enjoy my content."
    js "有什么不喜欢的？我找到了自己的创作出口，大家也喜欢我的内容。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6172
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_894384ae:

    # js "It's a win-win! And now with Diane's offer of publicity, it's a win-win-win! It's a triple win, Maya!"
    js "这简直是双赢！现在还有Diane的宣传支持，简直是三赢！三重胜利，Maya！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6174
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_be44d37f:

    # my "It sounds like you're sure about this."
    my "听起来你已经下定决心了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6177
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_5784ff6c:

    # js "I'm going for it."
    js "我要冲了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6178
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_3b356a9a:

    # js "Haha, wow! My fingers are trembling as I type. How unreal is this?"
    js "哈哈哈，哇！我打字的手都在发抖。这感觉太不真实了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6180
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_4c0f3553:

    # js "Question... Do you know how to use a camera?"
    js "你是在问什么？你知道怎么用相机吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6183
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_10687af9:

    # my "Pointing and pressing a button? I'm familiar with the concept."
    my "指着按钮按一下？我明白这个概念。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6185
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_e748ca57:

    # js "I have a job for you, if you want it."
    js "我有个任务给你，如果你想的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6186
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_d2f8596e:

    # js "How would you like to help me with my fashion photography?"
    js "你想帮我做些时尚摄影的活吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6188
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_c0b7287b:

    # my "As long as you don't make me famous for it, I can take a picture or two of you."
    my "只要你别让我因为这事出名，我拍几张你的照片也没问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6190
translate schinese ep12_jblog_label_5c734f9d:

    # js "Trust me; you'll enjoy it. It's something fun we can do together!"
    js "相信我，你会喜欢的。这是我们可以一起做的一件有趣的事！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6200
translate schinese ep12_than_label_314d9e2e:

    # than "Ah! There she is."
    than "啊！她来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6202
translate schinese ep12_than_label_29ce6319:

    # ji "I'm so sorry I'm late. Have you been waiting long?"
    ji "真抱歉我来晚了，你等很久了吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6204
translate schinese ep12_than_label_060f2f42:

    # than "For about ten minutes or so. It's fine."
    than "大概十分钟左右。没关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6208
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c5a62898:

    # ji "I've had a horrible day..."
    ji "我今天过得糟透了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6209
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c666d1e1:

    # ji "Of course, I should have expected the traffic to be this bad on top of it."
    ji "当然，我应该料到事情会这么糟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6211
translate schinese ep12_than_label_5c441f8f:

    # than "Oh? What happened?"
    than "哦？怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6215
translate schinese ep12_than_label_83cd56cd:

    # ji "My boyfriend broke up with me, and I'm a mess right now."
    ji "我跟男朋友分手了，我现在一团糟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6217
translate schinese ep12_than_label_900bc6dc:

    # ji "I broke up with my boyfriend today because I found out some nasty truths about him. I'm a big mess right now."
    ji "我今天和我男朋友分手了，因为我发现了他一些恶心的真相。我现在一团糟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6219
translate schinese ep12_than_label_a4602e14:

    # ji "I learned something terrible about someone close today, and it's weighing on my mind."
    ji "我今天知道了关于一个亲近的人的一些可怕事情，现在这件事一直压在我心里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6221
translate schinese ep12_than_label_78dc1068:

    # ji "But I'm here now. I'll try my best to be present."
    ji "但我现在在这里。我会尽力保持在场。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6222
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0c101162:

    # ji "I know how valuable your time is."
    ji "我知道你的时间有多宝贵。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6224
translate schinese ep12_than_label_4ae85b46:

    # than "It's not more valuable than yours. I'm sad to hear you're going through a rough time. If you feel like talking..."
    than "它不比你的珍贵。听到你正经历一段艰难时期，我很难过。如果你想聊聊……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6226
translate schinese ep12_than_label_3386c3e5:

    # ji "Thank you, but no. I don't want my problems to affect our meeting."
    ji "谢谢，但不用了。我不想让我的问题影响我们的见面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6227
translate schinese ep12_than_label_53268493:

    # ji "Believe me, he's not worth it."
    ji "相信我，他根本不值得。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6230
translate schinese ep12_than_label_b29e7482:

    # than "I hear you."
    than "我懂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6232
translate schinese ep12_than_label_4da76288:

    # than "Guy problems, huh? I hear you."
    than "哥们儿的问题啊？我懂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6237
translate schinese ep12_than_label_cc6d60ee:

    # ji "I didn't expect the traffic to be this bad already."
    ji "我没想到交通会这么糟糕。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6239
translate schinese ep12_than_label_4fa3e4a2:

    # than "Blame it on the holidays. I'm happy you arrived safe and sound."
    than "归咎于假期吧。很高兴你平安到达。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6241
translate schinese ep12_than_label_5c98803c:

    # ji "How have you been?"
    ji "你最近怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6243
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c2130fa8:

    # than "Lately, I've been good. I have traveled a lot around the country."
    than "最近过得不错，到处跑了不少地方。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6245
translate schinese ep12_than_label_bc94dc78:

    # ji "Giving lectures?"
    ji "给你上课？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6247
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0641baed:

    # than "And promoting my new book."
    than "并且在推广我的新书。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6249
translate schinese ep12_than_label_9fb06c62:

    # ji "Oh, of course! Is it out yet?"
    ji "当然啊！已经出版了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6251
translate schinese ep12_than_label_2f00768c:

    # than "Two weeks ago. Just in time for Christmas shopping."
    than "两周前。正好赶上圣诞购物。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6252
translate schinese ep12_than_label_e500b154:

    # than "Not that people will buy my book as a gift, but..."
    than "不过话说回来，人们可能不会把我的书当礼物买，但..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:6254
translate schinese ep12_than_label_7a782cb9:

    # ji "Don't sell yourself short like that. I'm sure many would consider it an excellent gift. I, for one, would!"
    ji "别把自己看得太低。我相信很多人会觉得这是一份很棒的礼物。我自己，就认为是这样！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6256
translate schinese ep12_than_label_a7f24b83:

    # than "I'm so happy you said that."
    than "我真高兴你这么说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6258
translate schinese ep12_than_label_7ae75386:

    # than "Merry Christmas."
    than "圣诞快乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6259
translate schinese ep12_than_label_2f2e2f7d:

    # than "It's the first print edition."
    than "这是第一版印刷版。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6260
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0cf2bfc0:

    # ji "I'm honored."
    ji "我感到很荣幸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6262
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c614c11d:

    # ji "And you signed it, too."
    ji "你也签了名。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6263
translate schinese ep12_than_label_6f7a49ad:

    # ji "\"To Jill. Thank you for being a beacon of light in a world of darkness. Without your forgiveness, I doubt this book would have seen the light of day. Jonathan.\""
    ji "“致Jill：谢谢你成为黑暗世界里的一束光。如果没有你的原谅，这本书恐怕永远无法问世。Jonathan。”"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6265
translate schinese ep12_than_label_e05b54e6:

    # ji "Jonathan... I'm touched."
    ji "Jonathan... 我很感动。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6268
translate schinese ep12_than_label_2cdb00d5:

    # than "No matter what that ex-boyfriend of yours did, he didn't deserve you."
    than "不管那个前任对你做了什么，他都不配拥有你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6273
translate schinese ep12_than_label_9eb36602:

    # than "I meant every word."
    than "我每句话都是认真的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6275
translate schinese ep12_than_label_3388836f:

    # bari "Hi! What can I get you?"
    bari "你好！要来点什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6277
translate schinese ep12_than_label_81e935c0:

    # ji "A latte, please."
    ji "美式拿铁。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6279
translate schinese ep12_than_label_f7959e6a:

    # bari "Coming right up."
    bari "马上就好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6281
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8b4d0bf8:

    # than "This extra copy is for Isabella. I take it you're still as close as ever."
    than "这份额外的副本是给Isabella的。我猜你俩还是像以前一样亲密吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6284
translate schinese ep12_than_label_170c970c:

    # ji "We've had some rough patches, but yes. I'd say we are closer than ever."
    ji "我们之间确实有过一些不顺的时候，但没错，我们现在比以往任何时候都更亲近了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6286
translate schinese ep12_than_label_706f74a4:

    # ji "Even closer, I'd say."
    ji "甚至更亲密了，我这么觉得。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6287
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8b022018:

    # ji "Bella has made a lot of progress over the last year. You'd be surprised."
    ji "贝拉这一年进步了不少，你可能会感到意外。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6289
translate schinese ep12_than_label_502af4cf:

    # than "Oh? Tell me more."
    than "哦？跟我说说看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6291
translate schinese ep12_than_label_5335aec7:

    # ji "She's opened up, and not just to me. She's let others into her life, too."
    ji "她不仅对我敞开了心扉，也向其他人敞开了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6293
translate schinese ep12_than_label_6701c9c9:

    # than "She was always tough to get close to. It's because of you she managed to open up in the first place."
    than "她一直很难靠近。要不是你，她根本不会第一次敞开心扉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6295
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0fb1d6e0:

    # ji "She has not had it easy."
    ji "她一路走来并不容易。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6297
translate schinese ep12_than_label_844543c4:

    # than "I'm happy that you're still there for her."
    than "我很高兴你还在她身边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6299
translate schinese ep12_than_label_36d8d694:

    # ji "She's here for me, too."
    ji "她也在我这边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6303
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8041bf92:

    # than "Now... About Lana and your campaign..."
    than "现在……关于Lana和你的竞选……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6305
translate schinese ep12_than_label_d12f1e6c:

    # ji "Yes?"
    ji "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6307
translate schinese ep12_than_label_6b3849c6:

    # than "Tell me what you've come up with. I'm dying to hear it."
    than "告诉我你有什么主意。我迫不及待想听听。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6309
translate schinese ep12_than_label_7e653f46:

    # ji "So, my idea right now is this..."
    ji "所以，我现在的想法是这样……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6310
translate schinese ep12_than_label_7aa73b61:

    # ji "I will start a foundation in memory of my sister, and any funds that I'd receive I'd use to help people in similar situations."
    ji "我会成立一个基金会，纪念我的妹妹，我得到的任何资金都会用来帮助和她处境相似的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6312
translate schinese ep12_than_label_a15cfd7e:

    # than "A foundation is great. It's a solid idea, but the funding is a huge problem."
    than "一个基金会挺不错的，是个靠谱的点子，但资金问题可太大了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6313
translate schinese ep12_than_label_f391bf14:

    # than "You'll need sponsors to make it work, and we're not talking small sponsors at that."
    than "你需要大赞助商才能运作，而且我说的可不是那种小打小闹的赞助。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6314
translate schinese ep12_than_label_f9a61f63:

    # than "If you're looking to make a difference, you'll need more than $1 million to set it up."
    than "如果你想真正做出改变，光靠一百万美元远远不够。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6316
translate schinese ep12_than_label_e2b861e0:

    # ji "I'm aware that I need funding for it..."
    ji "我知道这笔钱对我来说也是个问题..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:6317
translate schinese ep12_than_label_37a8e05e:

    # ji "I have money that I could use, but it would be smarter to contact potential sponsors early on to gauge interest."
    ji "我手头有些钱，但早点联系潜在赞助人了解一下他们的兴趣会更明智。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6319
translate schinese ep12_than_label_3fae2bd5:

    # than "And I assume that asking Amelia and Geoff is still out of the picture."
    than "而且我猜向Amelia和Geoff求助这件事还是没戏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6321
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c580c6be:

    # ji "I can see that going two ways, and I like neither."
    ji "我能看出来这事有两种可能，但两种我都挺不爽的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6322
translate schinese ep12_than_label_05b58b26:

    # ji "They will either be disappointed in me for getting your help and react poorly to the idea because of it..."
    ji "他们要么会因为我得到了你的帮助而对我失望，然后因为这个原因对这个想法反应不好……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6324
translate schinese ep12_than_label_99f0177c:

    # ji "...or they will love the idea and try to make it their own because Lana was their daughter."
    ji "或者他们会喜欢这个主意，然后试图把它据为己有，因为Lana是他们的女儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6325
translate schinese ep12_than_label_f3f4b3b0:

    # ji "And I don't want them to take this away from me."
    ji "而且我不想让他们从我这里抢走这个主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6327
translate schinese ep12_than_label_d367d0f7:

    # ji "I plan on telling them about it after it's been set up, but asking them to be sponsors at this stage..."
    ji "我打算在事情安排好之后再告诉他们，但在这个阶段让他们当赞助人……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6328
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0371811c:

    # ji "I don't want to risk it."
    ji "我不想冒这个险。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6330
translate schinese ep12_than_label_689b388c:

    # than "Geoff and Amelia may not like me, but I don't think they will dislike your idea at all."
    than "Geoff和Amelia可能不太喜欢我，但我觉得他们不会讨厌你的主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6331
translate schinese ep12_than_label_b2341c23:

    # than "And sure, they can be controlling, but I can't see them making your idea theirs."
    than "而且，他们确实可能有点控制欲，但我看不到他们会把你的想法据为己有。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6333
translate schinese ep12_than_label_efd4d66c:

    # ji "How can you be sure?"
    ji "你怎么能这么确定？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6335
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c54b8883:

    # than "They know how much your sister loved you."
    than "他们知道你妹妹有多爱你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6336
translate schinese ep12_than_label_e2f4884b:

    # than "Without you, Lana wouldn't have come back home as much as she did."
    than "没有你，Lana 不会像她那样经常回家。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6338
translate schinese ep12_than_label_73e74345:

    # than "If they saw that you started a foundation in her name, I think they would be proud of you."
    than "如果他们看到你以她的名义成立了基金会，我想他们会为你感到骄傲的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6339
translate schinese ep12_than_label_840d4b29:

    # than "For all these years, they didn't do anything like it. And they are smart people, your parents."
    than "这么多年了，他们都没做过这种事。而且你爸妈也是聪明人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6340
translate schinese ep12_than_label_07213e77:

    # than "I'm sure it must have crossed their minds sometime."
    than "我敢肯定，他们肯定在某个时候想过这件事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6342
translate schinese ep12_than_label_00b94626:

    # ji "I think Dad needs this."
    ji "我觉得我爸需要这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6344
translate schinese ep12_than_label_da42353a:

    # than "What do you mean?"
    than "你是什么意思？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6346
translate schinese ep12_than_label_1a45bd03:

    # ji "He's been more down than usual lately. It's always around Lana's birthday, but his drinking has gotten worse, and he's working way less, too."
    ji "他最近情绪比平时更低落了。总是到了Lana生日的时候，他的酗酒情况越来越严重，工作也变得越来越少。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6347
translate schinese ep12_than_label_9828a1ca:

    # ji "I think he needs to see that Lana's memory still lives on and that her time on this earth inspired something greater than herself."
    ji "我觉得他需要看到，Lana依然活在大家的记忆中，而且她短暂的一生催生了比她本人更宏大的事业。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6348
translate schinese ep12_than_label_ccc4818f:

    # ji "That's another reason why I think this foundation is the way to go."
    ji "这也是我为什么认为这个基金会是正确方向的另一个原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6350
translate schinese ep12_than_label_4565a13e:

    # than "See... The way you realize that doesn't align with Geoff or Amelia wanting to take over your foundation."
    than "看到吧……你意识到这一点的方式，和Geoff或者Amelia想接管你的基金会是不一致的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6351
translate schinese ep12_than_label_cb50d5fe:

    # than "And you know, if you think that me being a part of it will deter them, I have no problem staying out of it."
    than "而且，如果你觉得我参与进去会让他们退缩，我也没问题一直不掺和。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6352
translate schinese ep12_than_label_467d4c10:

    # than "My name doesn't have to be involved in any paperwork. And the donations I'd make could be anonymous."
    than "我的名字不需要出现在任何文件上。我捐的钱也可以匿名。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6354
translate schinese ep12_than_label_5bd96f6a:

    # ji "What donations?"
    ji "什么捐款？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6356
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c8f89817:

    # than "You didn't count me out as a sponsor, did you?"
    than "你没把我排除在赞助名单外吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6360
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8be7dbc4:

    # than "Let's hope that the book sales take off first. Haha."
    than "希望这本书能先卖出去。哈哈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6362
translate schinese ep12_than_label_3016167b:

    # ji "Jonathan... Thank you."
    ji "Jonathan... 谢谢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6364
translate schinese ep12_than_label_d6d01e56:

    # ji "Now I want to hear your thoughts and ideas."
    ji "现在我想要听听你的想法和主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6366
translate schinese ep12_than_label_2190d316:

    # than "Well, I've been thinking too. Most of the ideas I came up with, I thought of during my tour."
    than "嗯，我也在想一些事情。我想到的大部分主意，都是在那次巡演的时候想出来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6367
translate schinese ep12_than_label_1bb041b7:

    # than "Haha... Tour sounds so pretentious."
    than "哈哈……“巡演”听起来太装腔作势了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6369
translate schinese ep12_than_label_c0cc71b9:

    # ji "It was a tour."
    ji "这是一次巡演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6371
translate schinese ep12_than_label_323181bb:

    # than "Yeah, I'm quite the rockstar. I'm amazed we aren't swamped by fans just sitting here."
    than "嗯，我可是个摇滚明星。我们坐在这儿，居然还没被粉丝围得水泄不通，真是让人惊讶。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6373
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8ce1113b:

    # ji "Haha!"
    ji "哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6375
translate schinese ep12_than_label_8494f124:

    # than "Speaking at universities, hospitals, and clinics has done amazing things for me."
    than "在大学、医院和诊所演讲让我感觉棒极了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6376
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0d436c5a:

    # than "I've felt so...fulfilled. And I get the feeling that I have reached people in a way I couldn't before."
    than "我感觉……很满足。而且我觉得自己这次真的打动了某些人，以前是做不到的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6378
translate schinese ep12_than_label_29b93b62:

    # than "Sure, it's not a weekly group meeting where you get to know someone and dig into the problems, but I still feel like I'm out there doing well by people."
    than "当然，这可不是每周开个小组会，互相了解、深入探讨问题的那种，但我还是觉得，我正在为人们做点有意义的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6380
translate schinese ep12_than_label_e72d57f1:

    # than "What I thought about for you, if you're interested, is having your own seminars."
    than "我倒是想给你个建议，如果你感兴趣的话，可以办些自己的讲座。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6381
translate schinese ep12_than_label_7d54cdd7:

    # than "You could start with local high schools and share your experience, and reach out to young adults who might not feel so well."
    than "你可以从当地的高中开始，分享你的经历，接触那些可能还没找到方向的年轻人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6383
translate schinese ep12_than_label_5a61fc5a:

    # ji "That sounds like something that would be possible."
    ji "这听起来是件能实现的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6385
translate schinese ep12_than_label_ffae9d45:

    # than "But if you don't want to invest time in the hands-on approach, I'm sure the foundation would keep you busy enough."
    than "但如果你不想花时间亲自参与，基金会也足以让你忙得不可开交。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6387
translate schinese ep12_than_label_0aef8552:

    # ji "I'd like the foundation to have a meaning beyond a name and money being handed out."
    ji "我希望这个基金会的意义不仅仅停留在名字和发放金钱上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6388
translate schinese ep12_than_label_09fec7f4:

    # ji "I want it to help and inspire."
    ji "我想让它真正起到帮助和激励的作用。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6389
translate schinese ep12_than_label_9c24a8e0:

    # ji "Seminars would be a good start to do that. And what better way than to reach out to students at that age?"
    ji "研讨会是个不错的开始。而且还有什么比向这个年龄段的学生伸出援手更好的方式呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6391
translate schinese ep12_than_label_acc2e03a:

    # than "That's what I thought too."
    than "那我也这么想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6407
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_ee08b4ed:

    # mc "(I wonder where Bella went...)"
    mc "（不知道贝拉去哪儿了……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6410
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_59154de9:

    # mc "(How much space does she want me to give her? I wish I knew...)"
    mc "（她想要我给她多少空间？我真希望我知道...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6416
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_f3f698d4:

    # "+10%% score on your next Math test.\nYour total bonus for the next test is [bonusPercentageMath]%%."
    "+10%%下次数学考试分数。\n下次考试的总加成为[bonusPercentageMath]%%。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6419
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_7dc20311:

    # "+10%% score on your next English test.\nYour total bonus for the next test is [bonusPercentageEnglish]%%."
    "+10%%下次英语考试分数。\n下次考试的总加成为[bonusPercentageEnglish]%%。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6420
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_4c63876a:

    # mc "(Ugh... I can't wait until the finals are over and done with.)"
    mc "（啧...真希望期末考赶紧结束算了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6421
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_85a6815a:

    # mc "(The finals are weird...)"
    mc "（期中考试真是烦人……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6423
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_4986ef57:

    # mc "(They want us to know everything about the class at once.)"
    mc "（他们想让我们一下子掌握这门课的所有内容。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6424
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_76d56bd9:

    # mc "(Which forces us to study it all at once.)"
    mc "（这迫使我们必须一次性全部学完。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6426
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_8f8642c3:

    # mc "(But I can already tell you most of this won't stick in my head for another week.)"
    mc "（但我已经能肯定，这些东西再过一周也不会留在我脑子里。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6427
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_7c7385e1:

    # mc "(So, have I truly learned something? Or am I only displaying that I know how to retain information for a week?)"
    mc "（所以，我真的学到了什么？还是说我只是在装模作样，装作自己能记住一周？）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6430
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_29647579:

    # ly "Found you."
    ly "找到你了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6432
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_4d6b1509:

    # mc "Were you looking for me?"
    mc "你是在找我吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6434
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_550232f2:

    # ly "Check your phone."
    ly "看看你的手机。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6436
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_242fe5d0:

    # mc "Oh, I had it on silent mode. I've been trying to focus on my studies with minimal distractions."
    mc "我手机静音了，我一直在努力减少干扰，专注学习。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6437
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_604c8b97:

    # mc "Don't tell me you walked around campus looking for me."
    mc "别跟我说你绕着校园到处找我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6439
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_075ac24e:

    # ly "Jacob told me where you were. Can we talk or...?"
    ly "Jacob告诉我你在哪里了。要谈谈还是……？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6441
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_26fa60e8:

    # mc "I've earned myself a break. What's up?"
    mc "我终于可以喘口气了。怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6443
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_d3c0b1da:

    # ly "We need to talk about what happened at the party."
    ly "我们得谈谈昨晚派对上发生的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6445
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_d85919c2:

    # mc "Yeah, maybe we do."
    mc "嗯，也许我们该谈谈了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6447
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_6ffbade1:

    # ly "Yesterday at work was hard for me."
    ly "昨天上班对我来说挺难的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6448
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_9fcc51b7:

    # ly "I had to dance for strangers the entire night, but all I could think about was you."
    ly "我整个晚上都在为陌生人跳舞，但脑子里全是你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6452
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_a3ea3be3:

    # mc "That's sweet."
    mc "这可真够甜的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6454
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_b317c732:

    # ly "That's not sweet at all, [name]. It distracted me."
    ly "那可一点都不甜。[name]这让我分心了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6457
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_26ae27c7:

    # mc "I've thought about you, too."
    mc "我也一直想着你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6459
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_86341786:

    # ly "Not in that kind of way, [name]. It distracted me."
    ly "不是那个意思，[name]这让我分心了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6462
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_a6be913e:

    # mc "So?"
    mc "所以？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6464
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_14bcc716:

    # ly "What do you mean by \"So\"? It distracted me."
    ly "你这话啥意思？“所以？”我都被你搞懵了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6465
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_279e60b0:

    # ly "It stopped me from doing my job."
    ly "这让我没法好好工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6467
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_ea25eff8:

    # ly "It doesn't feel like we're rolling anymore. It feels like we're dating."
    ly "感觉我们不再像以前那样随意了，现在倒像是在约会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6470
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_ee1b763e:

    # mc "Lily, we're not dating."
    mc "Lily，我们不是在约会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6472
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_444e7e35:

    # ly "That's how it feels."
    ly "这就像是在谈恋爱的感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6474
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_d72c6889:

    # mc "I'm gonna stop you right there."
    mc "我可要拦着你了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6475
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_21d35ed7:

    # mc "Lily... We're not dating. We've been rolling."
    mc "Lily... 我们不是在约会。我们只是在滚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6476
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_888209bb:

    # mc "And while that's been fun... We need to stop doing that."
    mc "虽然这样挺好玩的……但我们得停下来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6478
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_62b7300b:

    # ly "Because it's affecting my job?"
    ly "因为这影响了我的工作？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6480
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_35673e32:

    # mc "That is a good reason to stop... But also, I'm getting back together with my ex."
    mc "这是个很好的理由停下……不过，我还要和我前任重新在一起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6482
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_7b649b32:

    # ly "What?"
    ly "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6484
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_621c4199:

    # mc "Zoey. I'm getting back together with her."
    mc "我跟Zoey要重新在一起了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6485
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_79886450:

    # mc "After you left the party... Things happened between us."
    mc "你离开派对后……我们之间发生了些事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6487
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_44d2b9a9:

    # ly "Huh?"
    ly "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6488
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_66cb8580:

    # ly "We have sex, I leave, and you get back together with your ex? All in one night?"
    ly "我们上床了，我走了，你却跟前女友复合了？全在一晚上？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6490
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_d1c766bf:

    # mc "It didn't happen all in one night. It's been happening since about Halloween."
    mc "这事儿不是一夜之间发生的。从万圣节左右就开始了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6492
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_ca8789a2:

    # ly "What the fuck?"
    ly "他妈的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6494
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_84132a66:

    # mc "You and I weren't dating, so..."
    mc "你跟我根本没谈过恋爱，所以……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6495
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_a92c5997:

    # mc "And, hey... That's good news for you, yeah?"
    mc "而且，嘿……这对你是好事，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6496
translate schinese ep12_libb_label_1faaa09a:

