    mc "为什么报复？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6734
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_8713aa4c:

    # ni "It sounded serious. They called it a vendetta."
    ni "听起来挺严重的。他们管这叫复仇。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6737
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_dbc646ca:

    # mc "That's it? What am I supposed to do with that?"
    mc "这样就完了？我该拿这个怎么办？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6739
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_d2c8a08f:

    # ni "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I don't know either."
    ni "*{i}叹气{/i}*我也不清楚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6741
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_c41db5d9:

    # mc "We haven't done anything to them. It's far-fetched that they would hold a grudge against us."
    mc "我们没对他们做过什么。他们对我们怀恨在心这事儿，实在有点牵强。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6743
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_f2c25e28:

    # ni "That's not entirely true. We've picked on them a lot during Hell Week, and they weren't happy when the DIKs were formed and moved into the mansion."
    ni "那倒不完全对。我们在地狱周的时候经常拿他们开玩笑，而且当DIKs成立搬进庄园的时候，他们也没那么高兴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6744
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_5087f29d:

    # ni "There's history between the frats, for sure."
    ni "兄弟会之间肯定有旧账。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6745
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_2502739f:

    # ni "And I'm thinking... What if they had something to do with everything that's going on, too?"
    ni "我是在想……他们说不定也跟现在发生的一切有关。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6747
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_5a5cd99c:

    # mc "With what?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6749
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_c436902f:

    # ni "With the laptop, maybe."
    ni "带着笔记本电脑，也许。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6751
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_ea55bf91:

    # mc "Wasn't that your doing?"
    mc "这不就是你干的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6753
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_23123c0e:

    # ni "No! Not the cluck or the pictures. I tried telling you guys that, but you wouldn't listen."
    ni "不！不是那些照片或者视频。我之前就告诉过你们，但你们就是不听。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6755
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_76746c68:

    # mc "So, you're saying the tri-betas somehow got hold of the laptop while you were using it and posted the cluck?"
    mc "所以你是说，那群三贝塔趁你用笔记本时，不知怎么弄到了电脑，还发了那条Cluck？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6757
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_cbf45fdf:

    # ni "I know how it sounds, but I wasn't with the laptop all the time."
    ni "我知道听起来很像我一直在用那台笔记本，但其实不是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6759
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_d47c82f2:

    # mc "What? You said you were."
    mc "什么？你刚才说你一直在用？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6761
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_b68e1f9f:

    # ni "No, not really. I was watching...porn on it, and I got caught doing that and left the laptop alone for a while."
    ni "不是，我没真的那样做。我当时在看色情片，被发现了，就暂时把笔记本电脑放在一边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6762
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_36910b5b:

    # ni "And when I realized what had happened, I panicked and tried to find the laptop."
    ni "当我意识到发生了什么，我慌了，赶紧想找笔记本电脑。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6763
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_e088f8c5:

    # ni "I think I left it unlocked... So, part of it was my fault."
    ni "我想我可能没锁屏……所以，部分责任在我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6766
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_5eb8565b:

    # mc "This story sounds like bullshit. I don't believe you."
    mc "这故事听起来像他妈的鬼话。我根本不信你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6768
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_040fdab2:

    # mc "Nick... I'm sorry, but this sounds like bullshit."
    mc "Nick... 我很抱歉，但听起来像是胡说八道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6770
translate schinese ep12_campus_label_545a9f50:

    # ni "I'm not a liar, [name]. And even if you don't believe anything else I've said, believe this..."
    ni "我不是骗子。[name]即使你不相信我之前说的任何话，也相信这一点……"

