    le "我们俩都背后说过一些自己后来后悔的话。算扯平了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6845
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_9111c0a5:

    # jm "What did Nick say?"
    jm "Nick说了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6847
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_54a4a585:

    # mc "He told me that he overheard the tri-betas plotting."
    mc "他告诉我他听到了tri-betas在密谋。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6848
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_afffe6a9:

    # mc "He said that they were looking for revenge on all frats and that the DIKs were their first target."
    mc "他说他们正在寻找对所有兄弟会的报复，而DIKs正是他们的第一个目标。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6850
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_6dd5a443:

