    jm "这是为了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6852
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_294f2d3a:

    # mc "Nick thought it had something to do with our Hell Week pranks."
    mc "Nick觉得这事可能和我们地狱周的恶作剧有关。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6853
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_5a19f068:

    # mc "And he said it might go back even further than that - back when the DIKs were formed."
    mc "而且他说这事可能还要追溯得更远——追溯到DIKs刚成立的时候。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6854
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_cc580aa1:

    # mc "Do you understand what he meant by that?"
    mc "你明白他这话是什么意思吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6856
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_2792984d:

    # le "We wedgied the hell out of them. I'm not surprised if they hate us for that."
    le "我们狠狠地把他们挤了一下。他们要是恨我们也不奇怪。"

