    mc "嗯，他本来想来查个究竟，不过我跟他说了会儿话，就把他打发走了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:6866
translate schinese ep12_pinkrose_label_8e09f186:

    # jm "See! I wouldn't worry about those nerds."
    jm "瞧啊，别担心那些书呆子。"

