    # le "Yeah, I would worry more about sharing the HOTs with the jocks at the New Year's Eve party. Like... What is up with that!?"
    le "嗯，我倒更担心跨年派对上还得和橄榄球队那帮人共享HOT们。这到底算怎么回事！？"

