    # rs "But if you want to get started before that, I checked the guest list last night. Between the jocks, the HOTs, and us, the guest list is bigger than usual."
    rs "但如果想在那之前就开始准备，我昨晚已经查看了宾客名单。加上橄榄球队的家伙、HOTs还有我们自己，这次的宾客名单比平时要大得多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7531
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_95a62ec3:

    # mc "How do you want to handle it?"
    mc "你想怎么安排？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7533
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_575472fe:

    # rs "We talked about splitting the dining rooms, and I think that will be the case. Sage managed to book a venue on campus that is perfect for it."
    rs "我们商量了一下，打算把餐厅分开用，我觉得应该会这样安排。Sage 早就搞定了一个校内场地，特别适合办这种事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7535
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_4bf4e5a0:

    # mc "Oh, awesome! That makes my job a lot easier. What's the venue?"
    mc "噢，太棒了！这让我省了不少事。场地确定了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7537
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_658ff52f:

    # rs "There's an old building on the north end of campus. It's not that far off from the examination hall."
    rs "校北边有个老建筑，离考试楼不远。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7538
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_d6a6bece:

    # rs "Sage also found a caterer for the event - if we want one, that is. We have to decide on the menu and how much we want to spend on food and drinks."
    rs "Sage 还找到了一个承办餐饮的供应商——如果我们需要的话。我们得先确定菜单和食物饮料的预算。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7539
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_21bfcb62:

    # rs "I can fix the alcohol."
    rs "我可以搞定酒水。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7541
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_c22fe017:

    # mc "What do you need me to do?"
    mc "你让我干啥？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7543
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_a7843ef0:

    # rs "Check the budget for our end of the party. Calculate the costs based on 100-150 guests."
    rs "检查我们这边派对的预算，根据100到150位客人来计算费用。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7545
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_6a1e0cf2:

    # mc "That many, huh?"
    mc "这么多啊？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7547
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_01a862cb:

    # rs "Yeah. Many are interested."
    rs "是啊。很多人都感兴趣。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7548
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_ab406c0e:

    # rs "Oh, and we'll need fireworks! The jocks will buy some, but we should chip in."
    rs "哦，对了，我们还需要烟花！橄榄球队会买一些，但我们应该也出点力。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7550
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_47615704:

    # mc "So, the party will pretty much be: dining, dancing, drinking, and topping it off with some fireworks."
    mc "所以，这场派对基本上就是：吃饭、跳舞、喝酒，最后再来点烟花收尾。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7552
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_a4ee1e86:

    # rs "Yeah. Sounds about right. If you can come up with something else, go for it. I bet the others have ideas too."
    rs "嗯，听起来差不多。如果你有别的主意，尽管提。我想其他人也肯定有不少想法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7553
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_a81932c9:

    # rs "Talk to you in a bit."
    rs "待会儿见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7555
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_2e7e9bf2:

    # mc "See you soon."
    mc "回头见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7557
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_4ffe06fb:

    # mc "(That was helpful. Let me do some math here...)"
    mc "（那句话挺有帮助的。让我算算看……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7574
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_a108ba72:

    # mc "For that many guests... It comes down to this... Hm... How much do we wanna spend on food?"
    mc "对于这么多人... 总结下来就是... 咱们打算在食物上花多少钱？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7581
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_999ff083:

    # mc "Probably a lot. New Year's Eve should have a feast to remember."
    mc "大概得花不少钱。新年夜应该办个让人难忘的盛宴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7587
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_54364087:

    # mc "A nice dinner. Nothing over the top. That will keep the entry fee down, too."
    mc "一顿不错的晚餐。不要太夸张。这样也能控制入场费。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7592
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_2decd749:

    # mc "Eh... We'll choose the cheapest options. Food isn't that important."
    mc "嗯……我们选最便宜的吧。食物不是那么重要。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7600
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_ad391b88:

    # mc "(Dancing and drinking are the way to go. I know we usually have games and such, but now that we're planning this together with the HOTs and the jocks...)"
    mc "（跳舞和喝酒才是正经事。我知道我们平时通常会搞些游戏什么的，但现在是和HOTs还有橄榄球队一起计划，所以得换个方式。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7601
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_732299c7:

    # mc "(Maybe I'll leave those decisions up to them. But if things get boring, we could have a cheap backup plan.)"
    mc "（也许我让那些家伙自己决定吧。但如果气氛无聊了，我们还有个便宜的备用方案。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7608
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_566d49c0:

    # mc "(Let's play some kind of party game. There are cheap card games that would be fun and easy to break out if needed.)"
    mc "（咱们玩个派对游戏吧。有那种便宜又好玩的纸牌游戏，要是情况无聊了随时都能拿出来玩。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7613
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_8abc9432:

    # mc "(Nah... I don't think we need any extra activities for this party. If the others disagree, then that's their problem to solve.)"
    mc "（算了...我觉得这聚会不需要额外的活动。如果其他人有异议，那也是他们的问题。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7621
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_d0280127:

    # mc "What about fireworks...?"
    mc "那烟花呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7628
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_4b15c16f:

    # mc "This is worth spending money on. Let's put on a spectacular show. I don't trust the jocks with this."
    mc "这钱花得值。我们搞个大场面。我不放心把这事交给那些家伙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7634
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_e8031248:

    # mc "Since the jocks will buy fireworks, we can contribute to the show with some of our own."
    mc "既然那些橄榄球社的人会买烟花，我们也可以用自己的东西来凑个热闹。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7639
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_6fbb4c70:

    # mc "We can save money here. We have the same venue as the jocks, and they will buy fireworks. We'll mooch off of them."
    mc "我们可以省点钱。我们和那些混混用的是同一个场地，他们买烟花，我们就可以蹭他们的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7644
translate schinese ep12_pre_diary_label_87b3e209:

    # mc "Alright... What's next?"
    mc "好啊……接下来干什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7665
translate schinese ep12_pp_cont_label_644b7445:

    # mc "(Let's go with this.)"
    mc "（就这么定了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7716
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_fefca8ce:

    # mc "All done."
    mc "搞定啦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7765
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_70d00816:

    # mc "(Looks good... I'll wait for Rusty to plan the rest.)"
    mc "（看起来不错……我等Rusty来安排剩下的部分。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7767
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_f8122388:

    # mc "(Now what...?)"
    mc "（现在怎么办...？）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7769
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_9413a160:

    # mc "(I'm not gonna study...)"
    mc "（我可不打算学习了）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7770
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_d74c02b2:

    # mc "(But I will read something while I wait for Rusty.)"
    mc "（不过我得看看书打发时间等Rusty安排剩下的部分。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7773
translate schinese ep12_lock_in_label_eb272a17:

    # mc "(Please, Mom... No more detailed sex escapades.)"
    mc "（妈，求你了...别再讲那些详细的情事了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7779
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_06042a2b:

    # ln "My first time with Neil was wonderful."
    ln "我第一次和Neil在一起的时候真的很棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7780
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_acced8ec:

    # mc "(Mom... I get it! Stop! Derek didn't flip the fucking page!)"
    mc "（妈妈……我懂了！别这样！Derek根本没翻那页！）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7782
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_29b82915:

    # ln "Dear diary. I'm sorry for not writing in you much lately. I've been rather busy..."
    ln "亲爱的日记。最近没怎么写你，真是抱歉。我最近挺忙的……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7784
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_ccbc811a:

    # ln "With Neil."
    ln "和Neil在一起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7786
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_2e4b153e:

    # ln "I don't intend to brag, but since that first time, we snuck away almost daily to do it again."
    ln "我可不是在炫耀，但从第一次之后，我们几乎每天都偷偷溜出去再来一次。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7788
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_3729d7a8:

    # ln "Before work..."
    ln "下班前..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:7792
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_132130b0:

    # ln "During his lunch breaks..."
    ln "午休时间他总爱来找我..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:7794
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_c5572098:

    # ln "After work..."
    ln "下班后..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:7795
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_c084f89b:

    # ln "And aside from the hot sex, he treats me so well..."
    ln "除了火热的性爱，他待我真的很不错……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7796
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_16fbdbfe:

    # ln "Maybe it's fast, but I believe I'm falling in love with him."
    ln "也许进展挺快，但我确信我正在爱上他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7798
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_8f9111c4:

    # ln "However... I have a huge dilemma!"
    ln "不过……我有个巨大的难题！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7799
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_a41b0fb0:

    # ln "Mom found out about it. And as we didn't tell her about us, you can probably guess in what way she found out."
    ln "我妈知道了。而且因为我们没告诉她我们在一起的事，你大概能猜到她是怎么知道的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7800
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_ac723f43:

    # ln "It was horrible."
    ln "这简直糟透了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7802
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_3d1ba05a:

    # ln "I confessed to her what I'd been doing with Neil, and she lectured me on why I'd done something wrong."
    ln "我向她坦白了我跟Neil的事情，她就开始教训我为什么我做错了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7803
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_4bc9f463:

    # ln "But to me, the only thing that I did wrong was getting caught by her."
    ln "但对我来说，我唯一做错的就是被她抓到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7805
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_53d53fb9:

    # ln "She still sees me as a little girl. But I'm an adult now, Mom."
    ln "她还是把我当个小孩子。可我现在已经是大人了，妈妈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7806
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_7ad44dc4:

    # ln "I'm allowed to make my own \"bad\" choices."
    ln "我有权做出自己的“坏”选择。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7807
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_106f5d60:

    # ln "Mom told me to break it off with Neil, or she would have to tell Dad."
    ln "妈妈让我和Neil断绝关系，否则她就得告诉爸爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7809
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_49b8c318:

    # ln "Dad will be furious if he learns about Neil."
    ln "爸爸如果知道这事，肯定会气疯的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7810
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_d0d11a19:

    # ln "But I don't want to break it off with Neil. Should I lie to Mom?"
    ln "但我可不想和Neil分手。我该瞒着妈妈吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7813
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_1791c476:

    # dad "You shouldn't have to lie to your mom. And I don't care if your dad finds out about us."
    dad "你不该对妈妈撒谎。而且就算你爸爸发现我们的事，我也不在乎。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7815
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_a73917c6:

    # ln "How can you say that?"
    ln "你怎么能这么说？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7817
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_5feab504:

    # dad "Because eventually he would. What we're doing together means more than sex and hanging out to me."
    dad "因为迟早他都会的。对我来说，和你在一起的意义远超过性爱和一起玩乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7818
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_121f02b1:

    # dad "We could last beyond the time I have left here."
    dad "我们能在一起的时间可能比我在这里的时间更长。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7820
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_f8faf297:

    # ln "Left here? Are you leaving?"
    ln "离开这里？你是要走吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7822
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_69774cb5:

    # dad "Not right now. But I'm only here to help finish building the hotel. After that, who knows where work takes me."
    dad "现在还不行。但我只是在这里帮忙完成酒店的建设。之后，谁知道工作会把我带到哪里去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7824
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_23aaeb08:

    # ln "I don't want you to leave. I want you to stay."
    ln "我不想你离开。我希望你能留下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7826
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_0672c42a:

    # dad "Do you feel it too? There's something special between us."
    dad "你也有这种感觉吗？我们之间有什么特别的东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7828
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_9faecbee:

    # ln "I do."
    ln "我确实这么觉得。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7829
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_53671782:

    # ln "But when Mom doesn't accept it, how can I expect Dad to?"
    ln "但妈妈都不接受，我凭什么指望爸爸会接受？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7831
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_e7397616:

    # ln "And I was right. Mom told Dad, and he didn't accept it."
    ln "我妈确实说了，我爸也不接受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7837
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_86fff5db:

    # dad3 "I am paying you to work here, not to defile my daughter!"
    dad3 "我请你来这里是干活的，不是来糟蹋我女儿的！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7841
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_114c4ed1:

    # dad3 "You've taken advantage of your position as a worker and of our generosity."
    dad3 "你利用了自己作为员工的身份，还有我们对你的善意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7842
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_fa154d19:

    # dad3 "You were never allowed to walk about our premises for any purpose other than what was necessary to do your job. You've been trespassing!"
    dad3 "你从来都不被允许为了任何目的随意在我们场所走动，除了完成工作所需。你这是在擅闯！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7844
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_1b044d47:

    # dad3 "This is a gross violation of your contract, and I will sue you for this. Not just your company; I will hold you personally liable for your transgressions."
    dad3 "这完全是对你合同的严重违反，我会起诉你。不只是你的公司，我还会追究你个人的责任。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7845
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_e7051bff:

    # dad3 "It does not matter that she's an adult! You have crossed lines that should not have been crossed."
    dad3 "这不关她是不是成年人的事！你已经越过了不该越过的界限。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7846
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_0d139a32:

    # dad3 "You're fired!"
    dad3 "你被解雇了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7849
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_d0e27238:

    # dad3 "OW!"
    dad3 "哦！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7852
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_ce865af0:

    # dad3 "STOP IT!"
    dad3 "停下！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7858
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_3c5cbe24:

    # dad3 "GET THE HELL OFF MY PROPERTY!"
    dad3 "滚出我的地盘！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7860
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_3c9e2ca2:

    # dad3 "GET THE HELL OUT!!!"
    dad3 "滚出去！！！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7861
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_cc61fb21:

    # ln "Dad! Please, don't... I love him."
    ln "爸爸！求你别这样……我爱他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7863
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_38b6b084:

    # dad3 "That boy is trash! Do you hear me?"
    dad3 "这小子是垃圾！你听见了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7864
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_fbfa4a12:

    # dad3 "He is trash. And no daughter of mine will be associated with the likes of him."
    dad3 "他就是个垃圾。我女儿绝对不可能和这种人有任何关联。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7868
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_cd026fb1:

    # mc "(Huh? What?)"
    mc "（啥？什么？）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7869
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_c49495e9:

    # mc "(Dad assaulted Grandpa? And he was fired for it? He never told me that.)"
    mc "（我爸打了我爷爷？还因为这事被开除了？他从来没跟我说过这些。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7871
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_079d2360:

    # mc "(I knew my grandpa didn't like him, but he never mentioned that he threatened him with a lawsuit...)"
    mc "（我知道我爷爷不喜欢他，但他从来没跟我说过他威胁要告他……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7872
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_d3413a93:

    # mc "(What the hell?)"
    mc "（他妈的）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7875
translate schinese ep12_diary_label_0b245e37:

    # mc "(What was that? It came from the bathroom.)"
    mc "（那是什么声音？好像是从浴室传来的。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7884
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_69166a65:

    # "*{i}Door knock{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7885
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_19f0ffd3:

    # mc "Everything alright in there? I heard a thud."
    mc "一切都好吗？我听到里面有动静。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7887
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_afacbc20:

    # tm "H-help."
    tm "救、救命。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7889
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c17ef8ec:

    # mc "What's that?"
    mc "什么情况？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7891
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_2acc2cb7:

    # tm "Help!"
    tm "帮忙！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7894
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_88519e0c:

    # mc "The door is locked. Hold on."
    mc "门锁着。等一下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7901
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_ab054def:

    # mc "Tommy!? Tommy!? Did you fall?"
    mc "Tommy!? Tommy!? 你摔着了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7903
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_dca8d0dc:

    # tm "Get me the bag from my fridge."
    tm "给我从冰箱拿袋子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7905
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c2cb355a:

    # mc "The bag!? What bag!?"
    mc "那包？什么包？！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7907
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_638d7384:

    # tm "Behind the bar."
    tm "吧台后面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7909
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_4befc36b:

    # rs "Hey? What's the rush?"
    rs "嘿？急什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7911
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_bba04b84:

    # mc "Something is wrong with Tommy! He needs some kind of a bag."
    mc "某事不对劲，Tommy！他需要一个袋子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7913
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7467e6d4:

    # rs "Oh, shit! It's in his fridge."
    rs "哦，见鬼！在他冰箱里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7915
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_6619b58f:

    # rs "Tommy? Do you need us to call for paramedics?"
    rs "Tommy？需要我们替你叫急救人员吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7917
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_faa885d3:

    # tm "Give it to me."
    tm "给我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7926
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_1fb84e72:

    # mc "What now?"
    mc "现在怎么办？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7929
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_e96c66ff:

    # rs "He'll be fine."
    rs "他没事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7931
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7d697ef0:

    # mc "How can you be sure?"
    mc "你怎么这么确定？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7933
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_0e091b57:

    # rs "It's not the first time this has happened. He needed a glucagon shot."
    rs "这也不是第一次了。他需要一针葡萄糖素。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7935
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_3a79256e:

    # mc "A glucagon shot?"
    mc "胰岛素针剂？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7939
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_11a694e2:

    # mc "Dad taught me everything I know. He knows all kinds of stuff."
    mc "我爸教了我所有我知道的东西。他什么都知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7941
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_13f5b402:

    # tm "That's fucking cool."
    tm "这他妈真酷。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7944
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_ea85900e:

    # mc "Why don't you like me?"
    mc "你为什么不喜欢我？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7946
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_5dd221e8:

    # tm "I do! We're bonding here, aren't we?"
    tm "我当然喜欢你了！我们正在建立联系，不是吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7948
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7da7b6b8:

    # mc "You're drunk! Where are the shots?"
    mc "你喝醉了！注射针在哪儿？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7951
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c8ff8473:

    # tm "Alright, since you're sharing, I'm gonna let you in on something personal, too."
    tm "好啊，既然你都说了，那我也得告诉你点私密的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7952
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_94e60a86:

    # tm "But don't fucking tell anyone, it's a DIK secret."
    tm "但别他妈到处说，这是个DIK的秘密。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7954
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_4cee55dd:

    # mc "Hand on my balls, I won't tell anyone."
    mc "手放在我的蛋上，我不会告诉任何人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7956
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_df72bf90:

    # tm "I've got diabetes. That's why I can't do too many of those shots with you."
    tm "我有糖尿病。这就是为什么我不能和你一起打太多针的原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7958
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_f58d91ef:

    # mc "Don't worry! I can handle them all by myself!"
    mc "别担心！我一个人就能搞定！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7962
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_91f18e30:

    # mc "He's got diabetes."
    mc "他有糖尿病。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7964
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_791b1b95:

    # mc "The needles..."
    mc "针头……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7966
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_b8552e92:

    # rs "He called the DIKs' secret code for this. That's how it became a thing."
    rs "他用了DIKs的暗号来叫这个。就是这么搞起来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7968
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_deacb298:

    # tm "My blood sugar levels were too low."
    tm "我的血糖太低了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7969
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_0055a98a:

    # tm "I had a stressful day yesterday and woke up without realizing it had affected me..."
    tm "我昨天压力很大，醒来的时候才发现自己已经低血糖了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7971
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_bb278319:

    # tm "Thanks for bursting in here. If you hadn't... I..."
    tm "谢谢你突然闯进来。如果你没来的话……我……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7978
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_449edecb:

    # mc "How do you feel now?"
    mc "你现在感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7980
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_db7f1033:

    # tm "Drained."
    tm "累坏了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7981
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_b5efc2d8:

    # tm "I usually take good care of myself, but some days it sneaks up on me. When that happens, I can't help it."
    tm "我平时都很照顾自己，但有些日子它会突然袭来。一旦这样，我也没法控制自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7983
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7b4c6f76:

    # tm "You might have noticed that I sometimes behave weirdly."
    tm "你可能已经注意到我有时候表现得有点奇怪。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7985
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_aa498aa9:

    # mc "I think you're gonna have to be more specific."
    mc "我觉得你得说得更具体点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7987
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_d812e234:

    # tm "It happens that I snap, get sweaty, or delirious."
    tm "有时候我会突然发火，出冷汗，或者神志不清。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7989
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_77d2bd98:

    # mc "I saw that happen, maybe once or twice. I didn't think much of it. I thought you were hungover or pissed off."
    mc "我见过一两次，当时也没太在意。我以为你是宿醉或者生气了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7991
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_4e8fd3d4:

    # tm "Nah. It happens when my blood sugar levels are off. I try to hide it as best as I can by eating alone and taking my shots when no one's around."
    tm "不，那是我的血糖水平不对劲的时候。我尽量躲着，一个人吃东西，没人的时候打针。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7992
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_e13873ff:

    # tm "Haven't you noticed that I don't always sit with you guys at dinner or show up late?"
    tm "你没注意到我有时候并不总和你们一起吃晚饭，或者总是迟到吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7994
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_ca56b54b:

    # mc "Yeah. But I figured that's how you are."
    mc "嗯，不过我猜那大概就是你一贯的作风。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7995
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_8622a30a:

    # mc "Honestly, I had forgotten that you told me about it once at the Pink Rose."
    mc "说实话，我早忘了你曾经在粉红派对上跟我说过这事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7997
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_1cc422c7:

    # tm "When I was young, I almost died from it. I was too young to remember, but in a short time I lost a lot of weight."
    tm "年轻的时候，我差点因为这个死掉。我太小了，不记得当时的事，但没过多久我就瘦了很多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:7999
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_126194cc:

    # tm "One day, I couldn't stop drinking soda. It was like my thirst couldn't be quenched."
    tm "有一天，我停不下来地喝苏打水，渴得根本喝不够。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8000
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_354ef32f:

    # tm "I downed a big-ass bottle in minutes but kept wanting more."
    tm "我几分钟就灌下一整瓶，但还是停不下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8002
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_2d3fd3af:

    # tm "I collapsed on the floor, and Mom got crazy scared. She took me to the hospital, and after some tests, they found out the problem."
    tm "我晕倒在地上，我妈当时吓坏了。她把我送去医院，做了一些检查，结果他们发现了问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8003
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_f96bce38:

    # tm "Type 1 diabetes. My body couldn't take up any nutrients from the food without the insulin."
    tm "一型糖尿病。我的身体在没有胰岛素的情况下，根本无法吸收食物里的营养。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8005
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_9282f039:

    # tm "I had to learn how to self-medicate, but I fucking hated the needles. I still do."
    tm "我得学会自己打针，但那玩意儿我他妈恨死啦。现在还是这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8006
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_8c64e8f9:

    # tm "I remember crying like a bitch daily when I had to do it myself."
    tm "我记得每天自己打针的时候都哭得像个傻逼。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8007
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_cecd6ea7:

    # tm "And back then, I had to do it with every meal. And that meant doing it at school."
    tm "那时候我每顿饭都得打针，而且得在学校里做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8009
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_f02fcc8e:

    # tm "I was bullied mercilessly for it. They'd take my bag of insulin and throw it to each other over my head."
    tm "我因为这个被欺负得惨。他们抢走我的胰岛素药瓶，然后你争我抢地往我头上扔。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8010
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_69cbb75a:

    # tm "One time, they broke the insulin vial, and Mom had to bring me a new one."
    tm "有一次，他们把胰岛素药瓶弄碎了，我妈只好给我带了个新的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8012
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_169ef883:

    # mc "Tommy... That's horrible."
    mc "Tommy...那真是太糟糕了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8014
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_42d57178:

    # tm "Those events stuck with me. I get so fucking mad thinking about it still."
    tm "那些事一直留在我心里。一想起来我就他妈的气得不行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8016
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_34038961:

    # tm "That fucking Evan!"
    tm "那个混蛋欧文！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8018
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_1ef706f6:

    # mc "Who?"
    mc "谁？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8020
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_a3a85f68:

    # tm "The asshole who kept calling me Tummy Tommy throughout junior high because he saw me stick the needle in my stomach for the insulin."
    tm "那个混蛋从初中起就一直叫我‘大肚Tommy’，因为他看到我往肚子上扎针注射胰岛素。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8021
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_3473c39c:

    # tm "Well, that short fuckface didn't grow up to be big, and I got to beat his ass in high school every time he even glanced in my direction."
    tm "那家伙根本没长开，我高中时候每次他朝我这边看一眼，我就得好好教训他一顿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8023
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c8a254f4:

    # tm "Still... I fucking hate him."
    tm "我还是他妈的恨他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8025
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_f9d465df:

    # mc "I was bullied in school too... I know how much it hurts."
    mc "我也在学校被欺负过……我知道那种痛是什么感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8027
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c01cd0e9:

    # tm "I don't medicate in front of people, and I don't want people to know about it."
    tm "我不在人前用药，也不想让人知道这事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8028
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_8762ab81:

    # tm "In the early days of the DIKs, Vinny started poking fun at it. I snapped as if it were Evan in front of me, and we got into a fight."
    tm "在兄弟会刚成立的时候，DIKs就开始拿它开玩笑。我气得跟看见Evan一样，直接跟他干了一架。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8029
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_07eceaf9:

    # tm "This disease already controls my life. I didn't want the bad shit I left in high school to follow me in college."
    tm "这种病已经控制了我的生活。我不想让高中时那些烂事跟着我来到大学。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8031
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_9e49c0eb:

    # tm "After the fight with Vinny, we came up with the DIKs' secret code, and I used mine for my diabetes."
    tm "和Vinny打架之后，我们制定了DIKs的秘密暗号，我用的是我自己的糖尿病暗号。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8032
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_8551b1b9:

    # tm "I don't like people talking about it."
    tm "我不喜欢人们谈论这件事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8034
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_4f8b1bac:

    # mc "It's good to have those closest to you know about it, though. In cases like today."
    mc "虽然有那些最亲近的人知道这件事也挺好的，至少在像今天这样的情况下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8036
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7fac6f48:

    # mc "I always thought your needles were heavy drugs or something."
    mc "我以前总以为你的针头是毒品什么的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8037
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_960cc50d:

    # mc "I saw one or two lying around."
    mc "我看到有一两支躺在那儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8039
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_4c040e68:

    # tm "It would have been a hell of a lot cooler if they were."
    tm "那玩意儿要是真被他们看到了，可就太他妈丢人了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8041
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_5e8259a5:

    # mc "Nah. It wouldn't."
    mc "不，那不会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8047
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_51ab3a5e:

    # mc "I know things haven't been great between us lately..."
    mc "我知道我们最近的关系没那么好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8048
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_0480e292:

    # mc "I want to apologize again for what I did to Heather."
    mc "我想再次为自己对Heather做的事向你道歉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8050
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_fc71c7af:

    # tm "I don't want to hear about it."
    tm "我不想听这些。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8052
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_411ce672:

    # mc "It was stupid."
    mc "那太蠢了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8054
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_82f1ddd4:

    # tm "I've done worse things than that. Let it go."
    tm "我干过比这更蠢的事。别再提了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8057
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_85f21b79:

    # tm "I'm gonna lie down for a while."
    tm "我要先躺一会儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8058
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_3e372df9:

    # tm "Help yourself to a beer if you want one."
    tm "你想喝就自己拿一瓶啤酒吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8060
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_c4c18f34:

    # mc "I'll check up on you later."
    mc "我之后会来查查看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8062
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_5399cb1b:

    # tm "What are you? My nurse? There's no need to check up on me; I'm all good now."
    tm "你干嘛？我当你的护士啊？没必要一直来查我，我现在好得很。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8064
translate schinese ep12_tommy_label_7125cad0:

    # mc "Yeah, there's the Tommy I know."
    mc "嗯，这才是我认识的Tommy。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8078
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_5c08c466:

    # js "Are you sure he didn't give you a reason?"
    js "你确定他没给你个理由吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8080
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b440dd57:

    # sa "I begged him for one, but he just wanted our relationship to end."
    sa "我求他给我来一瓶，但他就是想结束我们的关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8081
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_786fab54:

    # sa "It was so out of the blue."
    sa "这事儿来得太突然了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8083
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_209cedf0:

    # my "It does sound odd... Do you think he was lying?"
    my "这听起来有点奇怪……你认为他是在撒谎吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8085
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_63d75c76:

    # sa "I thought there was someone else, and I asked him about that. But he said there wasn't."
    sa "我想他有别人了，就问他这事。但他否认了，说没有。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8086
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_281c5061:

    # sa "I don't know what to think."
    sa "我不知道该想什么。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8088
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_254b82eb:

    # sa "Why would he break up with me without a reason?"
    sa "他为什么要毫无理由地和我分手？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8090
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_67f0ec7f:

    # isa "I can't speak for him, but maybe he didn't have deep enough feelings for you and wanted to spare you from heartbreak."
    isa "我不能替他说话，但也许他对你没那么深的感情，不想让你受伤。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8092
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b944122b:

    # sa "He said he didn't feel something, but I called him out on that, too. I don't believe him."
    sa "他说他没那种感觉，但我也戳破了他这点。我不相信他的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8094
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2a00c860:

    # isa "I know it must feel hard to accept that he doesn't feel the same about you, but if that's what he says... Maybe that was his reason."
    isa "我知道你可能很难接受他对你没那种感觉，但如果他说的是实话……也许这就是他的理由。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8096
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_0635ea65:

    # sa "But it doesn't line up with how it's been between us."
    sa "但这和我们之间的关系完全不搭。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8097
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_659308e8:

    # sa "There were no signs of a breakup. Sure, we had some stupid fights here and there, but we were on good terms."
    sa "这里根本没有分手的迹象。虽然我们偶尔会闹点傻乎乎的架，但总的来说关系还挺好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8099
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_542cbe9b:

    # sa "I don't get it."
    sa "我真搞不懂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8100
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_14ef03ba:

    # sa "And I feel like I have ruined him for you guys now, too."
    sa "而且我觉得我可能也把他也毁了，毁在你们手里了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8102
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_dfe0a061:

    # my "It's a hard situation for all of us - especially you."
    my "对所有人都挺难的——尤其是你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8104
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_715c18b6:

    # my "It's tough for us to be caught in the middle of it."
    my "这对我们来说挺难的，夹在中间真的很为难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8105
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_00cf0668:

    # my "I sympathize with you, but I'm also his friend. And trying to defend him makes me feel like I'm upsetting you."
    my "我理解你的感受，但我也是他的朋友。试着为他辩护，反而让我觉得是在打扰你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8107
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_064392d5:

    # isa "That goes for all of us. But we are adults, and we understand that this is complicated."
    isa "这适用于我们所有人。但我们都是成年人，明白这种情况很复杂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8108
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1983ace6:

    # isa "I don't think Sage expects us to choose sides. She needs our support, and she has it."
    isa "我觉得Sage不希望我们选边站。她需要我们的支持，而她也得到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8110
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9cb7c7fb:

    # sa "Yeah, I'm not stupid. I know you're his friend. If you still want to be that, don't let me stop you."
    sa "是的，我可不是傻子。我知道你是他的朋友。如果你想继续当他的朋友，别让我拦着你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8111
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_d7fcee98:

    # sa "But I don't think I can be around him when you are. *{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    sa "但你在场的时候，我觉得自己没法跟他待在一起。*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8118
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_99d66aa4:

    # js "No. I'm sorry, but that does not excuse her."
    js "不。我道歉，但这并不能为她开脱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8121
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_95513ac9:

    # js "I get that she felt hurt, but doing that with a student to retaliate..."
    js "我明白她当时是受伤了，但用和学生发生关系来报复……这太奇怪也太不对了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8123
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_74d89331:

    # js "I get that she felt hurt, but sleeping with a student just because your dad did it..."
    js "我理解她很受伤，但就因为你爸爸做了那种事，她就去和学生上床……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8124
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_34d0384e:

    # js "It's a plain weird and wrong response."
    js "这反应真是莫名其妙又不对劲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8126
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1880b385:

    # my "So, she used [name] to feel better? Did I get that right?"
    my "所以，她用了[name]让你感觉好点？我搞对了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8128
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b793a3b1:

    # sa "She tried to justify it, but in the same breath, she admitted she was wrong and blamed Dad for everything."
    sa "她试图为自己的行为找借口，但话没说完就承认自己错了，还把所有责任都推给了爸爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8129
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ebf24d48:

    # sa "I mean, fuck! Pick a lane, will you?"
    sa "我他妈的，选个立场行不行？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8132
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a86bfa4f:

    # my "It seems like it was more complex than just the act. And it validates what [name] said, too."
    my "这似乎不仅仅是行为本身那么简单。它验证了什么[name]也说了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8134
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_0d081900:

    # my "It seems like it was more complex than just sex. And it validates what [name] said, too."
    my "这似乎不仅仅是性那么简单。它验证了什么[name]也说了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8136
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c614be01:

    # sa "What?"
    sa "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8138
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b8c0c138:

    # my "They were both oblivious to how it would affect you."
    my "他们两个都没意识到这会对你造成什么影响。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8140
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_aa06c22e:

    # sa "Let's say that I buy into that [name] wouldn't have done it, if he knew that she was my mother."
    sa "就算我相信[name]如果知道她是我妈妈，就不会那么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8141
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ae2323f7:

    # sa "Does that make it any better?"
    sa "这会让事情好受些吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8143
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_626b7191:

    # js "Not by much, no."
    js "不多不少，差不多就是这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8145
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9aab8a55:

    # my "It's hard to say. I still want to believe that [name] is better than this."
    my "很难说。我仍然想相信那[name]这比这好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8147
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a8372ec8:

    # sa "What do you two think?"
    sa "你们俩怎么看？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8149
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6bd66f89:

    # ji "You know what I think. I haven't changed my mind since you first told me."
    ji "你知道我怎么想的。从你第一次跟我说起这件事起，我想法就没变过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8151
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e7e3eff0:

    # ji "There's no excuse for what either of them did. And I can't be with someone who would do something like that."
    ji "这种事两个人都没借口，我不能和一个会做这种事的人在一起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8153
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1ce29318:

    # js "What did he say when you broke up with him?"
    js "他 分手 时说了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8155
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_fb6662f5:

    # ji "He said it was a mistake and that it had nothing to do with me."
    ji "他说那是个错误，而且和我毫无关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8156
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c626ffe5:

    # ji "And since it didn't involve me, he didn't get why I would break up with him over it."
    ji "而且因为他觉得这事儿跟他没关系，所以他根本不懂我为什么因为这事跟他分手。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8157
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_5e1a755e:

    # ji "He doesn't understand that it speaks to his character. To me, it revealed everything I needed to know about him."
    ji "他不明白这反映的是他的性格。对我来说，这已经足够了解他了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8159
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2e878879:

    # ji "There's no excuse for what either of them did. Period."
    ji "没什么借口，他们两个都干了那种事。完事了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8162
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_26224851:

    # ji "But... How do you feel, Bella?"
    ji "但……你感觉怎么样，贝拉？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8164
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2226e27c:

    # isa "It was a rude awakening. How else can I put it?"
    isa "这真是个残酷的醒悟。我该怎么说呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8165
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e7d5bb06:

    # isa "After the initial shock subsided, I reflected on how [name] and I started our relationship."
    isa "在最初的震惊平息后，我回想起如何[name]并且我开始了我们的关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8166
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_64676edb:

    # isa "And with that in mind, I look at what he did with Jade with more understanding."
    isa "带着这个想法，我对他和Jade做的事有了更深的理解。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8168
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1f9cb56d:

    # sa "You understand him?"
    sa "你明白他的想法吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8170
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_96da4d18:

    # isa "I understand how it could have happened, but that doesn't mean that I accept it."
    isa "我明白事情是怎么发生的，但这不代表我接受它。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8172
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_7219553e:

    # isa "And I accept it much less, considering that he recorded the act to show his friends for Hell Week."
    isa "而且考虑到他是为了在地狱周炫耀而录下来，我更不可能接受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8174
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c0762f06:

    # isa "Hell Week or not, you don't do that to someone."
    isa "不管地狱周还是不是，你都不该对别人这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8176
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_f357cba3:

    # sa "Exactly... It's humiliating."
    sa "说的对……这太丢人了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8179
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_0a8cc8c9:

    # sa "Exactly... It's unacceptable behavior."
    sa "说白了……这种行为根本不可接受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8181
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_aed7c00f:

    # ji "Did you break up with him?"
    ji "你跟他分手了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8184
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_47612722:

    # isa "Yes, but for a different reason altogether. He wanted to get back together with his ex-girlfriend Zoey."
    isa "是的，但原因完全不同。他想重新和他前女友Zoey复合。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8186
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_4f6a383b:

    # ji "Are you kidding me?"
    ji "你在开玩笑吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8188
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_45fdd647:

    # isa "I'm not."
    isa "我不是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8189
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_65ee42d8:

    # isa "In one fell swoop, he managed to change the way I looked at him."
    isa "一下子，他就改变了我对他的看法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8192
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_84719aa9:

    # isa "I was on the verge of doing it, but I asked him for some time to think."
    isa "我几乎要答应了，但我说我要点时间想想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8193
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6a19f7ae:

    # isa "Does this one bad thing he did negate every other good thing he did?"
    isa "这么做一件坏事，就能抵消他之前做的一切好事吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8194
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_20fd675e:

    # isa "Is it unforgivable? Can I look past it?"
    isa "这事儿能原谅吗？我能放过去吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8196
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_0508c127:

    # isa "And after talking to you tonight..."
    isa "和今晚和你谈完之后……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8197
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_75283b19:

    # isa "I fear there's no going back to how it was."
    isa "我怕已经回不去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8200
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9538c159:

    # isa "I don't think you're out of line to have this reaction."
    isa "我觉得你这样反应很正常。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8201
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a1fc88de:

    # isa "If I put myself in your shoes, I'd feel hurt and betrayed too."
    isa "如果我站在你的角度，我也会觉得受伤和被背叛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8203
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6c6d920f:

    # isa "Regardless of intent, it doesn't change what they did together."
    isa "不管他们有没有恶意，事情已经发生了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8204
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_3e3cf6cf:

    # isa "Truthfully, I would have a hard time forgiving either of them."
    isa "说实话，我很难原谅他们中的任何一个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8206
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6cb21bc2:

    # isa "Looking around the room, I can see how divided you are. Will you be able to call him a friend after this?"
    isa "环顾四周，我能看到你们分成了两派。你还能在这件事之后还叫他朋友吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8208
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_06a89885:

    # sa "I know I won't."
    sa "我知道我不会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8210
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c22a5486:

    # sa "I feel disgusted with myself for having been his girlfriend. I'll never wash this dirty feeling off..."
    sa "一想到自己曾做过他的女朋友，我就觉得恶心。这种肮脏的感觉怎么洗也洗不掉……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8212
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_eacbffe3:

    # sa "He may have good sides, but there are things you don't do."
    sa "他可能有好的一面，但有些事你是绝对不能做的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8213
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_061d32e1:

    # sa "And I think that's why it hurts this much. It would have been so much easier if he were pure evil, but he's not."
    sa "而且我想这就是为什么痛得这么厉害。如果他是个纯粹的恶人就好了，但事实并非如此。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8221
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_46b560de:

    # sa "He told me she was his friend. And I expressed my concerns about that to him."
    sa "他跟我说她只是朋友，我也向他表达过自己对此的担忧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8222
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_8b075362:

    # sa "I was 100%% right about her. And [name] not caring about my feelings makes me think he knew he was still in love with her the moment she returned from San Diego."
    sa "事实证明，我对她的担心100%%正确。可[name]根本不在乎我的感受，这让我觉得，佐伊一从圣迭戈回来，他就知道自己还爱着她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8224
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_0c41d503:

    # js "I'm so sorry to hear that."
    js "真 遗憾 听到这个消息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8226
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_14a8f7f7:

    # my "So, he lied about his feelings to you?"
    my "所以，他对你隐瞒了他的感受？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8228
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ede53f20:

    # sa "That's what I think, yeah. I asked him if he cheated on me, but he didn't consider making out with Zoey cheating."
    sa "这就是我的看法，没错。我问他是不是出轨了，但他根本没觉得和Zoey亲吻是背叛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8230
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_391db7e5:

    # ji "That's not right. He can't justify that to make himself look better."
    ji "这不对。他不能这样为自己开脱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8232
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_f194def7:

    # js "Yeah. Kissing someone else while you're in a relationship is cheating. He should have owned that."
    js "对，跟别人接吻，你还在恋爱的话就是出轨。他应该承认这一点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8234
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_128c4a27:

    # sa "Why did he even want me to be his girlfriend while building something up with Zoey?"
    sa "他当初为什么要选我当女朋友，一边又在和Zoey搞暧昧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8235
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6b224c6a:

    # sa "I feel like I don't know him."
    sa "我觉得我根本不了解他了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8237
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_14ef03ba_1:

    # sa "And I feel like I have ruined him for you guys now, too."
    sa "而且我觉得现在连你们也对他失望了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8239
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ad53cb78:

    # my "It's a hard situation for us all - especially you."
    my "这对我们所有人来说都很棘手——尤其是你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8240
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_71f16ebc:

    # my "I don't like how [name] handled it. The moment he felt something for Zoey, he should have been up front with you."
    my "我不喜欢[name]处理这件事的方式。他一发现自己对Zoey有感觉，就该向你坦白。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8241
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a70114db:

    # my "The way he wasn't makes it hard for me to defend him."
    my "他这样不作为，让我很难为他辩护。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8243
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e8478175:

    # my "And it's also hard because we're caught in the middle of it."
    my "而且我们夹在中间也很难办。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8244
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_00cf0668_1:

    # my "I sympathize with you, but I'm also his friend. And trying to defend him makes me feel like I'm upsetting you."
    my "我理解你的感受，但我也是他的朋友。试着为他辩护，反而让我觉得是在惹你烦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8246
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_51777734:

    # isa "That goes for all of us. But we are adults and we understand that this is complicated."
    isa "这对我们所有人来说都一样。但我们都是成年人，明白这件事很复杂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8247
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1983ace6_1:

    # isa "I don't think Sage expects us to choose sides. She needs our support, and she has it."
    isa "我觉得Sage没指望我们选边站。她需要我们的支持，而我们也会支持她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8249
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_655af070:

    # isa "I think we all agree that [name] could have handled it better and that he hurt Sage by cheating on her. She didn't deserve that."
    isa "我想我们都同意，[name]原本可以处理得更好。他出轨伤害了Sage，而她不该承受这些。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8251
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c4887974:

    # sa "Yeah, I'm not stupid. I know you're his friend. If you still want to be that, do whatever you want."
    sa "嗯，我又不傻。我知道你是他的朋友。你要是还想跟他做朋友，随你便。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8252
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_276c7feb:

    # sa "But I won't be around him when you are. And I definitely won't be around Zoey."
    sa "但你们和他在一起时，我不会出现。我更不可能和Zoey待在一起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8254
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2ef74cfa:

    # ji "No one is asking you to do that."
    ji "没人逼你这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8256
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6d08f62f:

    # js "This is so sad. *{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    js "这太让人难过了。*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8260
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_f59d687e:

    # js "Everything we built together he was willing to throw away for Zoey. I feel so fooled."
    js "他为了Zoey连我们一起建立的一切都愿意扔掉。我感觉被他骗了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8262
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a856ff56:

    # js "In hindsight, I'm not surprised. We had some great times, but it was always going to be complicated between us."
    js "回头看，我一点都不意外。我们有过不少好时光，但我们在一块注定会很复杂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8264
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a3112b7f:

    # js "I can't fault him for getting together with Zoey, but I can't stay friends with him."
    js "我不能怪他和Zoey在一起，但我没办法继续做他的朋友了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8266
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_12e63c7e:

    # sa "I'm sorry it happened like that."
    sa "很抱歉事情会变成这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8267
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9a0417b9:

    # sa "It feels scummy for him to get into a relationship with her and to break up with you over it."
    sa "他为了跟她交往而和你分手，做法真的很卑鄙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8268
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_923667fd:

    # sa "It would have been easier to digest if he had broken it off because he wasn't into you."
    sa "如果他是因为不喜欢你才分手的话，可能更容易接受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8270
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a4647970:

    # js "I think he was into us at one point. But when Zoey returned to his life, he realized we weren't his true love."
    js "我觉得他一度是真心喜欢我们的。可Zoey重新回到他的生活后，他意识到我们并不是他的真爱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8272
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_7bcd97a5:

    # ji "How do you feel, Maya?"
    ji "你感觉怎么样，Maya？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8275
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2aa6c0b6:

    # my "It's been hard. I love him."
    my "很难。我爱他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8276
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_28878184:

    # my "And now, all of a sudden, I'm not supposed to do that anymore."
    my "现在，突然之间，我就不该再这么做下去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8278
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c013a7b1:

    # my "I'm having difficulties wrapping my head around that."
    my "我一时还转不过弯来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8279
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_4c71a0c3:

    # my "I'm glad that he's happy, but I wish he were happy with me."
    my "我很高兴他现在开心，但希望他能因为跟我在一起而开心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8281
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8284
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c98e7961:

    # my "[name] means a lot to me, but like I told him..."
    my "[name]这对我意义很大，但就像我跟他说过的一样..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8285
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9f9f7a0a:

    # my "It's not that kind of love."
    my "这可不是那种爱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8287
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_316f1ccc:

    # my "Maybe I would have felt that way at some point - I was attracted to him in many ways, after all..."
    my "也许我曾经也这么想过——毕竟我各方面都对他有好感，说实话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8288
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_27250c05:

    # my "But I can't know for sure."
    my "但我无法确定。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8290
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_dcc82896:

    # my "And he seemed sure about his love for Zoey."
    my "而且他看起来很确定自己爱Zoey。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8291
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1f20e3db:

    # my "So... In the big picture, it doesn't matter how I feel."
    my "所以……从大局来看，我感觉怎么样其实并不重要。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8293
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9505e6b4:

    # isa "Of course, it matters how you feel."
    isa "当然，你感觉怎么样很重要。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8294
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ddcdc486:

    # isa "Just because [name] feels different, it doesn't mean your feelings aren't worth something."
    isa "只是因为[name]感觉不一样，不代表你的感受不重要。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8296
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_874d1d30:

    # my "I feel some relief. I don't have to push myself to find out if I love him that way."
    my "我感觉松了一口气。我不用强迫自己去确认我是不是真的爱他那种方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8297
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_99483a54:

    # my "Maybe movies are wrong about it, but I want to believe that love is supposed to be easy. And this wasn't. So..."
    my "也许电影里说的不对，但我还是想相信爱情本该是简单的。可这次却不是。所以……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8299
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_3b87b2a5:

    # my "You probably feel awful about this situation, too."
    my "你 大概 也觉得这情况很糟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8300
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b76ed2db:

    # my "Bad parts aside, we've had some nice times together as a group lately."
    my "撇开那些糟心的部分，我们最近作为一伙人一起度过了不少愉快的时光。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8301
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b5c3ce77:

    # my "I'm unsure if that will happen again."
    my "我不确定这种情况还会不会重演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8303
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_bb7b9232:

    # sa "We're together now, aren't we?"
    sa "我们现在在一起了，不是吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8305
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_25accbe7:

    # my "Yeah, but [name] was a big part of it."
    my "嗯，但是[name]是其中很重要的一部分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8307
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1cc3c5c0:

    # ji "Even if it's different, we're still here for both of you."
    ji "即使情况不同了，我们还是都在你们这边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8308
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e2d53669:

    # ji "As for [name]... Time will tell."
    ji "至于[name]时间会证明一切。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8311
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_68047f3e:

    # js "He told you that there wasn't anything going on between him and Zoey?"
    js "他告诉你他和Zoey之间什么都没发生过吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8313
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_7d545d50:

    # ji "He reassured me of it. He lied to my face. *{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    ji "他向我保证过。他当着我的面撒谎。*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8315
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_37d64016:

    # my "Is there any chance he didn't know he felt that way?"
    my "他有没有可能根本不知道自己是那种感觉？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8317
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ee1b68c1:

    # ji "I don't see it. He spent time with her on several occasions and invited her to parties."
    ji "我没看到什么。他几次和她单独相处，还邀请她去参加聚会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8318
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_3a6fa874:

    # ji "What was his intention in doing that?"
    ji "他那样做的意图是什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8320
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_d46a2c7b:

    # ji "I feel naive for trusting his word after I felt a hunch that something was wrong."
    ji "我觉得自己太天真了，明明有种不对劲的感觉，还偏偏相信了他的说法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8322
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b8e856bc:

    # isa "Ask yourself what you could have done differently."
    isa "问问自己你当初能做些什么不一样的选择。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8324
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_8afd5291:

    # ji "Like how?"
    ji "像这样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8326
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b0eac735:

    # isa "Let's say you forbade him from spending time with Zoey. Would that have made it better?"
    isa "假设你禁止他和Zoey接触，情况就会变好吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8328
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e4ab71cf:

    # ji "I don't think posing an ultimatum is healthy for a relationship."
    ji "我觉得在关系里摆出最后通牒可不好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8330
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_377f7bda:

    # isa "You're right. It's not."
    isa "你没错。就是这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8331
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ae8b06e6:

    # isa "You did the right thing. You communicated with him and trusted his words."
    isa "你当时做得对，你跟他沟通了，也信任了他的承诺。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8333
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b4489b6c:

    # ji "I withheld how I truly felt. I didn't tell him how much it scared me."
    ji "我隐瞒了我真正的感觉。我没有告诉他有多害怕。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8335
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ad1d01ca:

    # sa "But that's not why it fell apart, Jill."
    sa "但那不是它破裂的原因，Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8336
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_ee11c6aa:

    # sa "In my opinion, nothing you could have said would have changed it."
    sa "在我看来，你当时说什么都没用。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8338
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_372af88d:

    # sa "He kept putting himself in a position where his feelings for her grew."
    sa "他一直把自己放在一个位置上，让对她的感情不断加深。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8339
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_be9df71c:

    # sa "And since she was his first girlfriend, it should have been obvious to him how he felt about her."
    sa "而且她是他第一个女朋友，他应该早就该明白自己对她是什么感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8341
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_24f3699c:

    # sa "I don't know if he cheated on you physically, but he sure as hell cheated on you emotionally."
    sa "我不知道他是不是在你身上动了手脚，但他在情感上绝对背叛了你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8342
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b5eab735:

    # sa "Feelings aren't just turned on and off in an instant."
    sa "感情不是说开个开关就能立刻开关的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8344
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_b6c353d3:

    # js "I don't buy that he wasn't aware of his feelings either."
    js "我不信他没意识到自己的感受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8345
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_6c09742f:

    # js "You trusted him and treated him in a way he didn't deserve. You're way too good for him."
    js "你信任他，还对他这么好，根本没把他当回事。你根本不该为他付出这么多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8347
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_d5ed1d22:

    # ji "I wish I could let it go. I hate that he makes me feel this way."
    ji "我希望我能放下这一切。我讨厌他让我有这种感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8349
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_9dea0eaf:

    # my "We're here for you."
    my "我们都在你这边。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8352
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_237e0376:

    # ji "It wasn't because of your past?"
    ji "这不都是因为你过去的事吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8354
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_161569a8:

    # isa "No. He felt guilty because the timing of the breakup was horrible."
    isa "不，他感到内疚，因为分手的时机实在太糟糕了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8355
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_349f545a:

    # isa "I believe he was worried about my mental health, but I assured him that I could handle it."
    isa "我相信他担心我的心理健康，但我向他保证我能够应付。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8357
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_4302e722:

    # sa "You are alright, aren't you?"
    sa "你没事吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8359
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1bb4c0f6:

    # isa "You don't have to worry about me either."
    isa "你也不用担心我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8361
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_565b1dc9:

    # my "Of course, we worry about you. That's what friends do."
    my "当然，我们担心你。这可是朋友该做的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8363
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_f63c9a13:

    # isa "I appreciate it, but really, I'll be fine."
    isa "我明白你的担心，但说实话，我没事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8364
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_99c0f6c0:

    # isa "I've been to hell and back. I'm determined to stay here now."
    isa "我经历过地狱又重生，现在下定决心要留在这里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8366
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c2c739d6:

    # js "So, he broke up with you because of Zoey? Was that the real reason?"
    js "所以，他是因为Zoey才和你分手的？那才是真正的原因吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8368
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_d1d09a75:

    # isa "Yes. Apparently, he is still in love with her."
    isa "是的。显然，他还是爱着她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8369
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_8e22cf7d:

    # isa "And honestly, our relationship has been difficult since the beginning."
    isa "而且说实话，我们从一开始的关系就挺难搞的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8370
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_322b2b9f:

    # isa "We couldn't even tell our friends about it. It jeopardized my friendship with Jill, and it was unethical in several ways."
    isa "我们甚至不能告诉朋友这件事。这毁掉了我和Jill的友谊，而且在很多方面都是不道德的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8372
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_c9c4ec8e:

    # isa "Maybe it was for the better that it ended."
    isa "也许这样结束反而更好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8374
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_7dfb1ef2:

    # sa "Does that make you feel better, that there's a convenient reason for it to end?"
    sa "这让你感觉好点了吗？至少有个方便的理由让它结束？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8375
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_eb573d2a:

    # sa "You and [name] seem to have connected since you first met. It doesn't seem like it was a shallow deal."
    sa "你和[name]你们似乎从第一次见面起就建立了联系。看起来不是肤浅的交往。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8377
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_e6a3ac6a:

    # isa "You're right. Convenience is the only positive side to it."
    isa "你说得对。便利性是唯一的好处。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8378
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_00e4be15:

    # isa "I did enjoy our relationship, and he made me feel loved again - a feeling I've missed dearly."
    isa "我确实享受过我们的关系，他让我重新感受到被爱的感觉——一种我很久都没有体会到的温暖。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8380
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_a52cbee9:

    # isa "*{i}Sigh{/i}* But this is how relationships go. Some last, some don't."
    isa "*{i}叹气{/i}*但这就是人际关系的常态。有些能持续，有些则不会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8381
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_d22338a4:

    # isa "For me, I think it was important to take this step with him. If anything, it has shown me that I am moving in the right direction."
    isa "对我而言，和他一起迈出这一步很重要。如果有什么的话，它让我意识到自己正走在正确的道路上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8383
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_2325ae05:

    # ji "I wish he had treated you better than this."
    ji "我希望他能对你好一点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8385
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_905ae32f:

    # isa "He treated me well, Jill."
    isa "他待我很好，Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8387
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_1857a585:

    # ji "It makes me mad that he risked our friendship for your relationship, and then threw it away to be with his ex-girlfriend."
    ji "他为了和你交往，连我们的友谊都敢拿来冒险，最后却又为了前女友抛弃这段感情，真让我生气。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8388
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_57825ed0:

    # ji "That's a bitter pill for me to swallow."
    ji "这对我来说真难咽下去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8390
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_da1afc39:

    # isa "It's ok to feel angry or sad about that. I'm sad too."
    isa "这事儿感到生气或难过很正常，我也是很难过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8392
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_33aa1263:

    # my "We'll be here for you if you need anything."
    my "我们会在这里，如果你需要什么。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8394
translate schinese ep12_mains_label_71dd4019:

    # isa "I can see that. Your friendship will help me get through this."
    isa "我能理解。你的友谊能帮我度过这段日子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8406
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_91b1122d:

    # "*{i}Phone rings{/i}*"
    "*{i}电话铃声响起{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8408
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_060c6a4f:

    # qu "Yeah?"
    qu "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8410
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_a4a4b6f2:

    # uk "They're coming for us."
    uk "他们要来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8412
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_b4110881:

    # qu "Who is this?"
    qu "谁？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8414
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_9866e4a0:

    # vi "It's over, Quinn. Buddy has it out for us."
    vi "结束了，Quinn。Buddy对我们有仇。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8416
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_e589b7ca:

    # qu "Vinny...? What do you mean?"
    qu "Vinny...？你是说啥？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8418
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_6a981e2b:

    # vi "He's not done with us. He's out to get us, and I'm not sticking around for it."
    vi "他还没完事，他要收拾我们，我可不想在这儿等着被收拾。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8420
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_745f1ae4:

    # qu "Slow down! What happened?"
    qu "放慢点说，到底发生了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8422
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_491f7830:

    # vi "I thought we had worked it out - Buddy and I..."
    vi "我以为我们已经解决了——Buddy和我..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8423
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_62f81022:

    # vi "But he sent Mick to snuff me. That's what I'm saying."
    vi "但他派Mick来结果我。这就是我想说的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8425
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_5ee88665:

    # qu "What the fuck? Are you serious?"
    qu "这他妈的怎么回事？你他妈是认真的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8427
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_677d37bd:

    # vi "I shot him."
    vi "我把他干掉了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8429
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_ec3df409:

    # qu "..."
    qu "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8431
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_9dd944b3:

    # qu "You shot Mick?"
    qu "你开枪打了Mick？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8433
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_1a2c2547:

    # vi "He had to go. It was either gonna be him or me."
    vi "他必须死。要么是他，要么是我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8435
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_0cdb6eaf:

    # qu "Is he dead?"
    qu "他死了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8437
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_b1d4b706:

    # vi "Yeah, he's gone."
    vi "嗯，他走了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8439
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_e21327fa:

    # vi "This is all because that fucking stripper cunt couldn't keep her mouth shut."
    vi "这一切都怪那个该死的脱衣舞娘贱货管不住嘴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8441
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_d1cf49f2:

    # qu "I'm not following."
    qu "我没跟上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8443
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_4bcd245a:

    # vi "Lily. She fucked me over by snitching to Mick."
    vi "Lily。她举报了我，害我被Mick抓了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8444
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_f1da833c:

    # vi "Take whatever cash you have left and get the fuck out while you can."
    vi "拿你剩下的钱赶紧滚蛋，趁还能走的时候。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8446
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_adee6332:

    # qu "Why would I trust you? You ratted me out and hurt my friend."
    qu "为什么我该相信你？你出卖了我，还害了我的朋友。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8448
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_983cfd45:

    # vi "No, no. That's not all true."
    vi "不，不。那不是全真的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8450
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_b119eea2:

    # qu "That's bullshit! I know you did. I heard Rio recognize you over the phone when you grabbed her."
    qu "放屁！我知道你碰她了。你抓住她时，我在电话里听见里奥娜认出了你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8452
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_3e68613e:

    # vi "Yeah, I did that with Mick, but I didn't touch her after. That was all them."
    vi "对，我和Mick一起干过那事，但之后我没碰她。后面的事全是他们干的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8453
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_ac18ecdc:

    # vi "I thought they'd threaten her, not beat her up."
    vi "我以为他们会威胁她，不会真的动手打她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8455
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_926712cd:

    # qu "Beat her up!? They ripped the piercings off her fucking face, Vinny!"
    qu "打她！？他们把她脸上的穿孔饰品都硬生生扯下来了，Vinny！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8457
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_fb3246b3:

    # vi "It's not my fault they went apeshit on her!"
    vi "这不关我的事，他们对她动手动脚！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8458
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_437d4e2e:

    # vi "Look! You fucking stole my customers, and it pissed me off. Something had to be done!"
    vi "看啊！你他妈偷了我的客户，我他妈气炸了。必须得做点什么！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8460
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_51f93612:

    # qu "What you did was way worse. You snitched on me."
    qu "你做的事严重多了。你出卖了我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8462
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_b993947d:

    # vi "And you snitched back. And Buddy cut my fucking face up!"
    vi "你他妈也告密了，而且Buddy还把我脸给撕烂了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8464
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_2c8cf197:

    # qu "So why would I trust you?"
    qu "那我为什么要相信你？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8466
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_a7380e2a:

    # vi "Because we're in the same boat and it's sinking. I'm jumping ship."
    vi "因为我们同船共渡，船正在下沉。我打算跳船了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8467
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_34ef2907:

    # vi "I'll only warn you once more. Stay away from Buddy's place. Don't go back there. He'll be waiting for you."
    vi "我只再警告你一次，别去Buddy那儿。别回去。他会在那儿等你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8469
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_4ffd156b:

    # qu "What? Buddy...will be waiting for me at his place?"
    qu "什么？Buddy...会在他那儿等我？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8471
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_d28608b5:

    # vi "Are you deaf? That's what I've been saying this whole time."
    vi "你聋了吗？这不就是我一直在说的事情。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8472
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_8361de4f:

    # vi "Buddy changed his mind. He wanted me gone for what I did."
    vi "Buddy改变主意了。因为我做过的事，他想要我的命。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8473
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_1da71f9c:

    # vi "And I think you're next. Especially now that Mick's dead..."
    vi "而且我觉得你接下来也逃不掉。尤其是现在Mick死了之后……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8475
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_3bc6a7dd:

    # qu "(He doesn't know Buddy is in jail...)"
    qu "（他不知道Buddy在监狱里……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8477
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_d0bf1a85:

    # vi "Consider us even. Don't go back there."
    vi "算扯平了。别回去那儿了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8479
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_211bebcc:

    # qu "Is that what this is about? You want to make things right?"
    qu "这是为了弥补你一直以来的所作所为吗？你想把事情弄清楚？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8481
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_5d50d254:

    # vi "Somewhere along the road, we drifted apart, you and I."
    vi "我们不知从什么时候起渐行渐远了，你和我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8482
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_2f417e2b:

    # vi "I never wanted us to be enemies, but the competition got to me, and lines were blurred. Consider this as my parting gift to you for the trouble I got both of us into."
    vi "我从没想过我们会变成敌人，但那场竞争让我迷失了方向，界限也变得模糊了。这算是我送你的告别礼物，为了一路上我们俩都惹上的麻烦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8484
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_d945664a:

    # qu "Where are you going?"
    qu "你去哪儿？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8486
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_83282fa5:

    # vi "Far from here. I'm already gone."
    vi "远在天边，我早就走了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8487
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_57ff78ed:

    # vi "I never called you."
    vi "我从来没叫过你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8493
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_24cebd00:

    # vi "Hi. I have an anonymous tip. Who do I talk to?"
    vi "嗨，我有个匿名消息，我该跟谁说？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8495
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_5efebc74:

    # vi "There's this strip club in the city..."
    vi "城里的有个脱衣舞俱乐部……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8496
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_14bb5c52:

    # vi "Well, they say it's a strip club, but it's also a brothel."
    vi "好吧，他们说那是个脱衣舞俱乐部，但其实也是妓院。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8498
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_7c0a607b:

    # vi "Yeah, yeah. Some of the girls there sell sex in the back rooms, and I've seen them use drugs."
    vi "嗯，有些女孩在后头房间卖身，我见过她们吸毒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8499
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_7ee94634:

    # vi "Yeah, most of the girls working there use it. And lots of it."
    vi "对，那里的大多数女孩都用。而且用得不少。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8500
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_ad966c7c:

    # vi "And I heard from a buddy of mine that they let in underage guys, too."
    vi "我还听一个朋友说，他们连未成年男生也接待。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8502
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_34e6725f:

    # vi "The Pink Rose."
    vi "粉红玫瑰。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8503
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_7baa5a68:

    # vi "That's what I know. Yeah."
    vi "这就是我所知道的。嗯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8504
translate schinese ep12_qv_label_ea600937:

    # vi "Yeah... That's the one."
    vi "嗯……就是那个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8515
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_125fe58d:

    # mc "Hey, Arieth. What are you doing here?"
    mc "嘿，Arieth，你在这儿干嘛？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8517
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_036def51:

    # ar "I'm here for the math test, dummy."
    ar "我来这里是为了数学考试，白痴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8518
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_7d94b45d:

    # ar "The Professor said if I passed the finals, I'd get a passing grade."
    ar "教授说如果我通过期末考试，就能拿到及格成绩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8520
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_8367c091:

    # mc "Oh. Are you retaking it? You weren't in our class this semester."
    mc "哦。你重考了？你这学期根本没在我们班。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8522
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_c96afbd6:

    # ar "Well, I missed the exam last spring because I mixed up the dates..."
    ar "嗯，我上学期那次考试搞混了日期，就错过了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8523
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_11a1a205:

    # ar "...and the time before that, my score wasn't the best."
    ar "……之前那次的成绩也不太理想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8525
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_e770c941:

    # mc "Good luck to you today, then."
    mc "祝你今天好运。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8527
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_47377d13:

    # ar "No luck needed. It's just math."
    ar "没那么复杂，就是数学题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8528
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_24bd27dc:

    # ar "And that's what I like about it. There are no wrong answers."
    ar "这就是我喜欢它的地方。这里没有对错之分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8533
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_5149573c:

    # de "One more math test, then we're free from this class..."
    de "再考一次数学就不用上这门课了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8535
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_48bc527a:

    # mc "There's a math class next semester, too, dude. And I doubt it will be easier."
    mc "还有下学期的数学课，伙计。我怀疑它也不会容易点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8537
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_8b90c68d:

    # de "Son of a bitch! I forgot about that."
    de "他妈的！我忘了这门课！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8538
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_bb0ce1a4:

    # de "Hey, what classes did you register for?"
    de "嘿，你报了哪些课？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8540
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_a1d43181:

    # mc "Well, we still have the Applied Chemistry class..."
    mc "那我们还有应用化学课呢..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8541
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_5ad08320:

    # mc "Then, I registered for Introduction to College Research, Mathematical Statistics, and Engineering Economics."
    mc "然后我报了《大学研究导论》、《数理统计》和《工程经济学》。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8543
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_775371d0:

    # de "Economics? Why did you choose that?"
    de "经济学？你为啥选这个？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8545
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_3012450c:

    # mc "I figured it would be useful. What about you?"
    mc "我觉得选这门课挺有用的。你呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8547
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_62df34d7:

    # de "I just clicked on the recommended classes. So, we should be the same."
    de "我就是点了推荐的课程。所以，我们应该选的都一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8549
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_bf92f569:

    # mc "The econ class isn't mandatory. You had to choose one class as an extra."
    mc "经济课不是必修的，你得选一门额外的课。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8551
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_edacc4cd:

    # de "But... I clicked the recommended ones..."
    de "但...我就是点了推荐的那些课..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8553
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_877803f4:

    # mc "Uh... They base that list on what you've already studied, along with suggested follow-up courses and such."
    mc "嗯……那个列表是根据你已经学过的课程，还有建议的后续课程之类的来推荐的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8555
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_82f1aa89:

    # de "Dear God... No..."
    de "天啊... 不..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8557
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_cc41c110:

    # de "*{i}Phew{/i}* Oh, thank you! I went with something cool."
    de "*{i}呼——{/i}*哦，谢谢！我选了件酷炫的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8558
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_960ea55a:

    # de "I clicked on Masculinity Studies. You got me worried there."
    de "我点了男性研究课。你差点让我担心死。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8560
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_c17ef8ec:

    # mc "What's that?"
    mc "这是什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8562
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_4d33f51d:

    # de "Let me see..."
    de "让我看看..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8563
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_3f4c25eb:

    # de "The class focuses on a critical examination of manhood..."
    de "这门课主要从女性主义视角批判性地审视男性气质……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8565
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_899e2504:

    # de "...from a feminist perspective-"
    de "……从女性主义视角出发——"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8567
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_ae6da388:

    # de "NO!!! FUCK!"
    de "不！！！见鬼的！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8569
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_74378e8d:

    # de "[mc_de_up]! It's a social studies class!"
    de "[mc_de_up]这是一堂社会研究课！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8571
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_de9203c9:

    # mc "You should read before you click on things..."
    mc "你该先读完再点东西..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8573
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_54b9b9be:

    # de "The class will deconstruct manhood and focus on the damaging effects men's ideals have on men and social life."
    de "这门课会解构男性气质，重点分析男性理想对男性自身和社会生活造成的伤害。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8574
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_596d9331:

    # de "What's wrong with being manly!? Is there anything they won't pick a fight with?"
    de "有啥毛病啊，当男人有什么不对劲？他们到底啥都敢挑起事来？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8575
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_fe9505ae:

    # de "Why don't they make a class about womanhood and how to lose weight and dress sexier instead?"
    de "为什么他们不搞个关于女性气质的课，教怎么减肥、穿得更性感一点呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8577
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_7f370616:

    # de "I'm going to kill myself!"
    de "我真想自杀！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8578
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_55fa223e:

    # de "Why would they give a feminist class a cool name like that!?"
    de "他们怎么会给这种女权主义课程起这么酷的名字！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8579
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_2821687b:

    # de "They fooled me!"
    de "他们骗了我！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8581
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_fcb04a75:

    # mc "Stop it. You didn't even know what you signed up for."
    mc "别说了。你连自己报了什么都没搞清楚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8583
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_d978ebed:

    # de "I'm not going! I'm not."
    de "我就不去！我就不去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8585
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_261ac54d:

    # mc "Registration ended in November. It's too late to change it."
    mc "报名截止是在11月，现在已经来不及改了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8587
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_dd04f937:

    # de "The class is held by Dr. Jade Burke..."
    de "这门课由Jade·布克博士授课……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8589
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_8cc2bc6c:

    # mc "At least you don't have to kill yourself. She'll do it for you."
    mc "至少你不用自己拼命。她会替你干的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8591
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_f5e221ee:

    # de "Can this day get any worse?"
    de "这天还能更糟吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8593
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_652fbba3:

    # ph "Hehe. Hold on to that thought; the test hasn't begun yet."
    ph "嘿嘿，别急着下结论，考试还没开始呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8594
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_dfa62c9b:

    # ph "Your phone, please."
    ph "请把手机交出来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8597
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_da541173:

    # ph "Good morning, everyone."
    ph "早上好，大家。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8598
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_dccd3252:

    # ph "Well, this is it. The day you've all been studying hard for."
    ph "好了，这就是了。你们所有人苦读一天的日子终于到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8600
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_eee5be6b:

    # ph "You have four hours at your disposal. The test covers the entire curriculum, and it consists of 12 in-depth problems for you to solve."
    ph "你们有四小时的时间。这次考试涵盖整个课程内容，共有12道深入的问题需要解决。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8601
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_56db96a5:

    # ph "A word of advice: make sure that you provide every step needed to reach your solution."
    ph "记住，要写出到达答案的每一步。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8602
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_805a87b7:

    # ph "You will not gain full points for incomplete solutions."
    ph "你不会因为不完整的解答而获得满分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8604
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_7d688718:

    # ph "That said, you may also earn points for partial solutions."
    ph "也就是说，你也可以因为部分解答而获得分数。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8605
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_e9404ffa:

    # ph "So, even if you feel the question is too hard and you can't quite solve it..."
    ph "所以，就算你觉得题目太难，根本解不出来……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8606
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_d73fec75:

    # ph "Do your best, and maybe you'll get some extra points for your effort."
    ph "尽力而为，说不定还能因为努力获得一些额外分数。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8608
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_df904207:

    # ph "Remember... It's always better to try than not to write anything at all."
    ph "记住……什么都不写比瞎写要糟糕。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8610
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_bd5d3e1f:

    # ph "Before you begin, make sure that you write your student ID at the top of each paper along with the other information."
    ph "开始前，请确保在每张试卷的顶部写下你的学生ID和其他相关信息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8611
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_70df3ece:

    # ph "Papers with incomplete information at the top won't be graded."
    ph "顶部信息不完整的试卷将不会被评分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8613
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_c2af828e:

    # ph "Please, respect your neighbors during the test."
    ph "请在考试期间尊重周围的同学。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8614
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_f9aa5b6d:

    # ph "Good luck! You may begin when you receive the test."
    ph "祝你好运！现在可以开始考试了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8616
translate schinese ep12_finals_label_cb103b0e:

    # mc "(Here we go... This is what I have studied for.)"
    mc "（终于开始了……这就是我学习的成果。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8655
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_2c3c5acd:

    # mc "(That's it... I can't come up with better solutions than these.)"
    mc "（这就行了……我想不到比这更好的办法了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8657
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_34b42bb6:

    # mc "(Many have already left... I guess it's my turn.)"
    mc "（很多人都已经走了……我想该轮到我了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8660
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_ddcf8de6:

    # mc "(Hoff watched me with eagle eyes...)"
    mc "（霍夫用鹰隼般锐利的目光盯着我……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8661
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_3c47dd69:

    # mc "(But I'm happy I sat in the front rows. That way I could prove that I wasn't up to something.)"
    mc "（但我在前排坐得很开心。这样我就能证明我没什么坏主意。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8667
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_37b201ea:

    # ph "How did it go?"
    ph "怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8669
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_ada6c72a:

    # mc "I tried my best."
    mc "我尽力了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8671
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_a0984e54:

    # ph "You looked focused. That's good. Keep it up."
    ph "你看起来很专注。这很好。继续加油。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8675
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_24b18187:

    # ph "Well done, [name]."
    ph "做得不错，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:8677
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_596b4c4a:

    # mc "We'll see."
    mc "我们走着瞧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8683
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_91b1122d:

    # "*{i}Phone rings{/i}*"
    "*{i}电话铃声响起{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8685
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_4556e6d4:

    # mc "Hey, Nicole. What's up?"
    mc "嘿，Nicole。怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8689
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_49785d26:

    # nic "I talked to Sandy, and she told me what you said."
    nic "我跟Sandy说了你刚才说的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8691
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_2ca096cc:

    # mc "Whoa... What's wrong? What did I say?"
    mc "哇……怎么了？我哪说错了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8693
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_9cab75df:

    # nic "What's wrong? Really?"
    nic "怎么了？真的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8696
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_16b61cde:

    # nic "You told her we were just fucking...not dating."
    nic "你跟她说我们只是在搞点那事……根本没谈过恋爱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8698
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_d82f2110:

    # nic "But you know that's not the truth. You know how we talked about calling and seeing each other more."
    nic "但你清楚这不是事实。你知道我们之前聊过要多打电话、多见面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8700
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_a1ee0929:

    # mc "I didn't feel like it was her business to know about what you and I do."
    mc "我没觉得那事该让她知道你和我的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8702
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_a828811b:

    # nic "Oh, stop it! You went into a private room and had sex with her and Tania."
    nic "哦，别这样！你进了一个私人房间跟她还有Tania发生了关系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8706
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_b2b2ecfc:

    # mc "It was just sex. It didn't mean anything."
    mc "只是性行为。没什么意义。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8708
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_ffb973a7:

    # nic "I think that's the problem. Nothing seems to mean anything to you."
    nic "我觉得问题就在这里。对你来说，什么都毫无意义。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8710
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_004e7dd9:

    # mc "That's harsh."
    mc "这话可真狠。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8712
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_611bbd57:

    # nic "No, it's not. Honestly, I'm going too easy on you."
    nic "不，不是这样的。说实话，我对你太宽容了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8715
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_7e2b8582:

    # mc "So? I'm single."
    mc "所以？我单身。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8717
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_eabcb21f:

    # nic "You are, and I get the feeling that's how you like it."
    nic "你就是这样，而且我觉得你就是喜欢这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8720
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_cbd65701:

    # nic "You told her we were dating but still wanted to do dirty things to her."
    nic "你跟她说我们是在交往，但你还是想对她干那些下流的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8724
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_53c1af28:

    # mc "We didn't do anything."
    mc "我们什么都没做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:8726
translate schinese after_math_result_ep12_label_6ff8cd79:

