    qu "我得先低调一段时间，但我也得把带来的毒品卖了。我带得太多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9913
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_fbe0ae62:

    # mc "Maybe you shouldn't have taken it all with you."
    mc "也许你该把那些东西都留着。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9915
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_9f70b517:

    # qu "I got greedy when I saw what was inside the safe."
    qu "我看到保险箱里的东西，就贪心了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9916
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_00b320f2:

    # qu "[name], there was so much money in it. It will solve all my problems."
    qu "[name]里面有很多钱。它能解决我所有的问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9917
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_a18e6539:

    # qu "I've secured my future! I'm set for life."
    qu "我这辈子算是有保障了，这辈子都吃不完花不完。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9919
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_6a254911:

    # mc "Still... I'm worried. You've involved the cops and pissed off some dangerous people."
    mc "不过……我还是担心。你已经牵扯上了警察，还惹恼了一些危险的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9921
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_7900a1e8:

    # qu "That's why I'm being extra careful right now."
    qu "这就是我现在格外小心的原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9923
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_4ac8dcba:

    # mc "Hoarding money and drugs is careful?"
    mc "囤钱和毒品真的那么谨慎吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9925
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_89c6f973:

    # qu "Don't worry. I've got a good hiding spot."
    qu "别担心。我有个不错的藏身之处。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9927
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_f672ab01:

    # mc "I'm happy that you're safe, but I don't know how I feel about the rest."
    mc "我很高兴你没事，但我不确定自己对接下来的事情有什么感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9929
translate schinese ep12_quinn_lewd_loop3_label_afad12a5:

    # qu "Let me worry about that. I don't want to make my problems yours."
    qu "这事让我来操心。我不想把自己的麻烦推给你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9944
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_628a451f:

    # rs "Alright, guys! I know you're all excited about the holidays and heading home, but I'm excited about tonight."
    rs "好了，伙计们！我知道你们都兴奋得不行，假期快到了，也该回家了，但我今晚可兴奋了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9945
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_6deed52e:

    # rs "No more tests, a somewhat empty calendar, and a night with the boys."
    rs "没考试了，日程表也空了不少，今晚还能和兄弟们好好过个夜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9947
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_919c5b35:

    # jm "I don't know about you guys, but I'm not having a kinky sleepover with Rusty."
    jm "我不知道你们怎么想，但我可不想和Rusty来个 重口 的睡过夜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9949
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7183ca4f:

    # "*{i}Laughter{/i}*"
    "*{i}笑声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9950
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_10365e5b:

    # rs "Hilarious."
    rs "好笑。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9952
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_b573f22c:

    # rs "I wanted to take this opportunity to wish you guys Merry Christmas."
    rs "我想借这个机会祝大家圣诞快乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9953
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3169fe31:

    # rs "We'll see each other again around New Year's Eve. But hopefully a few days earlier than that, so we can finish the preparations for the epic party."
    rs "我们会在新年之夜再见面。不过希望提前几天，这样我们就能把这场派对的准备工作做完。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9955
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_47535888:

    # le "How epic can it get with the jocks being there?"
    le "有橄榄球队的家伙在那儿，这派对能有多炸？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9956
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a2c90f15:

    # le "And are we just gonna forget that Anthony punched Derek?"
    le "我们是不是就忘了Anthony打过Derek？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9958
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_dc90e164:

    # rs "I know. It's not the best outlook for a party, but many others will be there too. We'll make it work, ok?"
    rs "我知道。这可不是办派对的最佳氛围，但还有很多人会来。我们想办法搞定，行不？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9960
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_1dab15ef:

    # rs "Anyway, this speech is losing its momentum. Merry DIKmas, everyone!"
    rs "算了，这番话也说不下去了。祝大家圣诞快乐！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9961
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_4069af95:

    # "*{i}Cheers{/i}*"
    "*{i}干杯{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9963
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7c3355e7:

    # jac "Hey. I got you something for Christmas."
    jac "嘿，我给你带了圣诞礼物。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9965
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_523a9958:

    # jb "I thought we all agreed on not getting each other gifts."
    jb "我以为我们之前已经说好不互相送礼物了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9967
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_994a4eee:

    # jac "I know. But I had this one planned for quite some time, and it wasn't ready for your birthday."
    jac "我知道。不过这件礼物我计划很久了，你生日时它还没准备好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9969
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_201a92a6:

    # jb "Oh my God! You're joking... You made this for me?"
    jb "天啊！你是在开玩笑吧……你这是给我做的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9971
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_32b21ff1:

    # jac "Merry Christmas. Don't let it hang on the wall all year, though."
    jac "圣诞快乐。不过别把它挂墙上一年到头都看着。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9972
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a4efe12e:

    # jb "I love it! Dude, thank you so much."
    jb "我超喜欢的！老兄，谢谢你那么多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9975
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_6d92932a:

    # "*{i}Camera shutter{/i}*"
    "*{i}相机快门{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9976
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_8efcf4c6:

    # le "Wow! That's an awesome gift. Good job, Jacob."
    le "哇！这礼物太棒了。干得不错，Jacob。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9986
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_6a7a9f9a:

    # jac "I'm sorry, I didn't get you a gift."
    jac "真抱歉，我没给你准备礼物。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9988
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_eba99741:

    # le "Don't be; I didn't get you anything either. And besides, after what Tommy got me, I don't want any more gifts."
    le "别傻了；我也没给你准备什么。而且，想想上次Tommy给我的东西，我可不想再收礼物了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9992
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_d1214f79:

    # tm "Merry Christmas."
    tm "圣诞快乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9994
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_19e54328:

    # mc "For me? Why?"
    mc "给我？为什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9996
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_fea66705:

    # tm "You deserve this one."
    tm "你配得上这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:9998
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_847bde61:

    # mc "Oh boy... If it's anything like what Leon got..."
    mc "哦天啊……如果这玩意儿跟Leon给的差不多的话……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10000
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_c7d859dc:

    # tm "Haha! It's not."
    tm "哈！不是这意思。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10002
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_afaf94b1:

    # mc "A shirt?"
    mc "一件衬衫？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10004
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3892f362:

    # tm "For the New Year's Eve party, or whatever. I remember you don't have a lot of good clothes."
    tm "为了新年晚会，或者 随便什么。我记得你没什么好衣服。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10006
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_45407f23:

    # mc "That's both thoughtful and insulting. Even so, I like it!"
    mc "这话说得既体贴又带刺。不过，我喜欢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10007
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_fef1c735:

    # mc "I hope you're not doing this because you feel like you owe me something."
    mc "我希望你不是因为觉得欠我什么才这么做的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10009
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_c54c5cd7:

    # tm "Eh... It's a way of saying thanks, but also sorry for coming across as a bitch with you at times this semester."
    tm "呃……这是表达感谢的一种方式，也顺便为这学期有时候对你态度不好说声抱歉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10010
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_8f6868b6:

    # tm "I know I'm not the easiest guy to deal with... And I'll only say this once..."
    tm "我知道我待人不太容易...而且我只说一次..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10012
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_b03242b5:

    # tm "I appreciate you."
    tm "我谢了你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10015
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_2045d0dd:

    # mc "Tommy..."
    mc "Tommy..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10017
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_96586c95:

    # tm "Now, let's never talk about this again. Ok, fuckhead?"
    tm "现在，咱们永远别提这事了。好啊，混蛋？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10019
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_bb036691:

    # mc "Haha! Got it."
    mc "哈哈！我懂了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10021
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7946f78d:

    # tm "Tell me how you ruined the New Year's Eve party. Rusty mentioned something about it."
    tm "告诉我你是怎么搞砸了跨年派对的。Rusty提到过这件事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10023
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_d424abab:

    # mc "That I ruined it?"
    mc "我搞砸了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10025
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_420f3909:

    # tm "Nah. It was ruined from the start. That's why I haven't cared much about it so far."
    tm "不，从一开始它就毁了。这就是为什么到目前为止我都没太在意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10027
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_c5ab5a1a:

    # mc "There's still time to fix it if you don't like what we did."
    mc "还有时间可以改，如果你不喜欢我们干的那些事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10029
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_bbc6ca65:

    # mc "We're getting a bunch of fireworks to outshine the jocks..."
    mc "我们弄到了一堆烟花，要超过那些橄榄球队的家伙们。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10031
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_f198ad21:

    # mc "The jocks and DIKs are both getting some fireworks for a joint show..."
    mc "拳击社和DIKs都在搞烟花秀，搞个联合表演..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10033
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_721aab47:

    # mc "We're saving money by mooching off the jocks' fireworks..."
    mc "我们正靠蹭橄榄球队的烟花来省点钱……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10035
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_1f22af65:

    # mc "...and we're spending a lot of money on a fancy buffet."
    mc "…而且我们还花了不少钱在一顿高档的自助餐上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10037
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_fdb124bd:

    # mc "...and we're spending some money on a decent buffet."
    mc "……而且我们还会花点钱请个像样的自助餐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10039
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3fc1ac59:

    # mc "...and we're not spending a lot of money on the decent buffet. We're keeping it simple."
    mc "……而且我们对那顿体面的自助餐也没花太多钱。我们打算简单点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10040
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_167c2653:

    # mc "The biggest expense will be alcohol..."
    mc "最大的开销就是酒精了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10042
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7a992264:

    # mc "...and while we probably won't need it, I'm bringing some party games people can play if they get bored."
    mc "……虽然我们可能用不上，但我还是会带些派对游戏，如果大家无聊了可以玩玩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10044
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_5b229946:

    # mc "...and we're not doing any activities for this one."
    mc "而且这次我们什么活动都不安排。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10047
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a485b23f:

    # tm "It sounds like you didn't need me at all. I couldn't have planned it better."
    tm "听起来你根本不需要我。我都没办法把这事安排得更糟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10049
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7ba9e854:

    # tm "It works. The party was doomed from the start anyway."
    tm "这安排挺合理的。聚会从一开始注定就是个烂摊子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10050
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_be5bddeb:

    # tm "People will dance, drink, and talk for this one. And with the jocks there, I think it's fair that we don't treat them to any of our special games that night."
    tm "人们会跳舞、喝酒、聊天，就这一次。而且有橄榄球队的家伙在场，我觉得我们那天晚上不用特意招待他们玩我们的特别游戏也挺公平的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10052
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_2acdde43:

    # mc "So, you agree with me?"
    mc "所以，你同意我的想法？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10054
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_badcf5fe:

    # tm "I think you got it covered, but I'll help you out after Christmas."
    tm "我觉得你已经安排得差不多了，不过圣诞节之后我再帮你一把。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10056
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a8daba0a:

    # mc "Cool."
    mc "凉快。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10063
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_e28ba007:

    # "*{i}Doorbell{/i}*"
    "*{i}门铃声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10064
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a362fe68:

    # mc "I'll get it."
    mc "我来拿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10066
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_19efd721:

    # mc "Josy? What a nice surprise."
    mc "Josy？真是个意外惊喜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10068
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_31a3ebda:

    # js "Hi! I hope I'm not interrupting your night with the boys."
    js "嗨！希望我没打扰你们和男生们的夜晚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10070
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_80a169ae:

    # mc "Nah, don't worry about it. It's laid back."
    mc "不，别担心。挺放松的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10072
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a709ef00:

    # js "That sounds nice! I hope you're having a wonderful night."
    js "这听起来不错！希望你今晚玩得开心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10073
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_e81a9741:

    # js "I stopped by to tell you that I'm going home tomorrow morning."
    js "我顺路来告诉你，我明天早上就要回家了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10075
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_b9721b49:

    # mc "Maybe I'll see you at home, then."
    mc "也许我能在家里见到你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10077
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_761b647f:

    # js "Not that home. I'm going to Mom's place for Christmas."
    js "不是那个家，我圣诞节要去我妈妈那儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10080
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_d22ca03a:

    # mc "Oh, that's right."
    mc "哦，对了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10082
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "我明白了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10084
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_76c35357:

    # js "But I wanted to ask if you'd like to visit and meet Mom."
    js "但我想问问你，要不要来家里看看，见见我妈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10086
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_215ae245:

    # js "You know how hard it is for us to meet family..."
    js "你知道我们见家人有多难……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10088
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_727584f9:

    # mc "I'd love to... But..."
    mc "我真想答应……但……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10090
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_29fea066:

    # js "Maya. I know."
    js "Maya，我知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10091
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_ad572395:

    # js "[name], I don't know how to deal with this. So, I've decided to look at it in another way."
    js "[name]我不知道该怎么处理这件事。所以我决定换个角度来看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10093
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_1844b25f:

    # js "Instead of focusing on the negatives, I'm trying to see the positives."
    js "与其纠结于负面的事，我试着看看正面的方面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10094
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_5856592b:

    # js "And the positive thing, right now, is that there's an opportunity for you to meet Mom. That is, if you're up for it."
    js "而且现在的好处就是，你有机会见见妈妈。当然，如果你愿意的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10097
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_feef9498:

    # mc "Hm... Meeting parents... I don't know."
    mc "嗯……见家长啊……我还不知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10099
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_39bb0ac4:

    # js "She's not that scary. Come on... I want you to meet her."
    js "她没那么可怕。来吧……我想让你见见她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10101
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_52b71b9a:

    # mc "Ok, then..."
    mc "好的，那我们就这么定吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10103
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_282d5985:

    # mc "I'd love to meet her. I am up for it."
    mc "我很想见她。我愿意去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10105
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_f0992fdb:

    # js "Then how about you visit on the 26th? And then we'll return home together on the 27th?"
    js "那你要不要26号来拜访我？然后我们27号一起回家？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10106
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a9090550:

    # js "I'm celebrating with Dad and Monica that night."
    js "那天晚上我要和爸爸、Monica一起庆祝。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10109
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_11aef3e5:

    # mc "I'll likely return to campus on the 27th. I have that competition on the 29th, remember?"
    mc "我会在27号回校园。29号有比赛，记得吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10111
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3d6a2d2d:

    # mc "I'll likely return to campus on the 27th. I have that performance on the 29th, remember?"
    mc "我大概27号会回学校。29号有演出，记得吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10113
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_08e2a80e:

    # mc "I'll likely return to campus on the 27th. I want to help out with the New Year's Eve party preparations."
    mc "我大概27号就能回学校了。我想帮忙准备一下跨年派对的事情。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10115
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_109453e2:

    # js "Of course. That's fine too."
    js "当然，这样也行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10116
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_ec36832c:

    # js "I'll book a bus ticket for you. It's the same bus I always take when I'm at Dad's."
    js "我会帮你订一张大巴车票。我每次去我爸爸那都是坐这趟车。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10119
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3b906d89:

    # mc "Thanks, but I can book it myself."
    mc "谢谢，但我自己可以订票。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10121
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_e7ee6daa:

    # mc "Thanks, but I can book it myself. And I can't wait to meet your mom."
    mc "谢谢，但我自己可以订票。而且我迫不及待想见你妈了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10122
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_f94c0d34:

    # mc "Have a great Christmas."
    mc "圣诞快乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10124
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_ff781b70:

    # js "Merry Christmas, [name]."
    js "圣诞快乐，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10126
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_05133258:

    # js "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    js "*{i}一巴掌{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10132
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_54b76192:

    # rs "Hey, everyone! To simplify for us when the spring semester starts..."
    rs "嘿，大家！等春天学期开始的时候，咱们简化一下流程……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10133
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_1f412341:

    # rs "I'd like to hear you guys make the case for any new initiates. Are we recruiting next semester or not?"
    rs "我想听听你们为新成员辩护的理由。我们下学期要招人吗，还是说不招了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10138
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_0309757b:

    # jac "Cool! Are we talking Hell Week tonight?"
    jac "爽！今晚要搞地狱周吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10143
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_ce69377d:

    # rs "If you guys don't mind. There's a dilemma we need to solve next year."
    rs "如果你们不介意的话，明年我们得解决一个难题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10147
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_6b4e8220:

    # jm "What's been bothering you?"
    jm "你最近怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10149
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_47ebc878:

    # rs "Well, aside from the loss of Vinny and Nick... We're still a growing fraternity."
    rs "嗯，除了Vinny和Nick的离开之外，我们兄弟会还在持续壮大。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10150
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_16ed8605:

    # rs "And while this mansion is big, it's getting crowded."
    rs "虽然这栋宅子挺大，但现在人越来越多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10151
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_6427b1c0:

    # rs "Tommy and I still have one and a half years left until graduation."
    rs "我和Tommy还有一年多就要毕业了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10153
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_467080c0:

    # tm "Ugh... At least."
    tm "唉...至少这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10155
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_f6a8ce26:

    # rs "Yeah, depending on how things pan out, of course."
    rs "当然，这得看事情最后怎么发展。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10156
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_3d820570:

    # rs "But the problem remains. How many can we accept come spring, and where would they stay?"
    rs "但问题依旧。春天能接收多少人，他们又能住哪儿？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10158
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_14739dee:

    # tm "Nick is gone. That's one room."
    tm "Nick走了。那间房就空出来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10160
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_ff87c436:

    # de "[name] has space for at least another DIK in his room."
    de "[name]他房间里还有空间能放下至少一个DIK。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10162
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_4e252b6d:

    # mc "Whoa! Where the hell did that come from?"
    mc "哇！那东西是从哪儿来的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10164
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_fe926bc6:

    # de "It wasn't a slam on you, but hey... [mc_de_up], I live in a closet."
    de "这可不是针对你，不过嘿……[mc_de_up]我住在衣柜里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10165
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_5c42f745:

    # de "With the square feet you've got going for you, you could fit at least one more brother in there."
    de "你那点地方，至少还能塞进一个兄弟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10167
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_d6528298:

    # rs "And Tommy's room is even bigger. We're not splitting rooms until we absolutely have to."
    rs "而且Tommy的房间还更大。我们还没到非得分房的地步。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10169
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_b9cd8e1d:

    # tm "Damn straight."
    tm "说得对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10171
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_108a8c65:

    # jm "What does that leave us with? The home theater and Nick's room?"
    jm "那我们还剩下什么？家庭影院和Nick的房间？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10173
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_51d777e0:

    # le "We can't get rid of the home theater, guys... That's like my favorite room here."
    le "我们可不能把家庭影院给扔了，伙计们……那可是我在这里最喜欢的一个房间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10175
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a3c46601:

    # jac "Yeah, and we host some DIK nights in there - like the evaluation for one."
    jac "对，我们在那儿还办过一些DIK之夜——比如一次评估之类的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10176
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_af5ec174:

    # jac "Crazy idea, but what about the attic?"
    jac "疯狂的主意，但阁楼怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10178
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_dfea101b:

    # jb "Oh, yeah! We could fit at least four more DIKs up there, can't we?"
    jb "哦，对啊！我们上面还能再挤进至少四个DIKs，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10180
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_b1e21bfb:

    # rs "We would have to put up some walls, but the attic is a possibility."
    rs "我们得先搭些墙，但阁楼也是一个可能的选择。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10182
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_7a10402d:

    # mc "Do they have to live here with us?"
    mc "他们必须和我们住在一起吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10183
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_031245b2:

    # mc "I mean, if we want to accept lots of DIKs, maybe they could live in dorms and join us for parties and such."
    mc "我的意思是，如果我们想收留很多DIKs，也许他们可以住在宿舍，然后来参加我们的聚会之类的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10185
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_70add90c:

    # tm "Nah. We're not the tri-betas. We take care of our own."
    tm "不。我们又不是三贝塔，我们会照顾自己人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10187
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_4850d7ba:

    # jm "I'd offer to remove my pots and plants from the porch, but it gets cold out there during winter."
    jm "我可以主动把门口的花盆和植物搬走，不过冬天那边挺冷的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10189
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_2ce0d39d:

    # rs "I think Jacob had the right idea. Let's do some work on the attic and fit the guys up there."
    rs "我觉得Jacob说得对，咱们先收拾一下阁楼，把那些家伙安排上去住。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10190
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_0971ec40:

    # rs "So, we have capacity for roughly five more DIKs before we need to talk about our living arrangements."
    rs "所以我们还能再收容大概五个DIKs，之后就得谈谈我们的住处安排了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10192
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_a583e74a:

    # tm "It shouldn't be all five this semester. Six months fly by, and before we know it, we have a fall batch of freshies knocking on our door."
    tm "这学期不一定要收满五个。六个月一晃就过去了，等我们反应过来，就已经有新来的家伙在敲我们门了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10194
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_1bfc635c:

    # jb "There are more ways to fix that. I'm not against putting another bed in my room."
    jb "还有别的办法。我不介意在自己房间里加一张床。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10196
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_308cdd21:

    # jm "Yeah, fuck it. I can do a bunk bed, too. Don't let it stop us from accepting new guys into the frat."
    jm "行啊，操，我也可以搞上下铺。别让这点小事拦着我们收新成员。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10197
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_74db5de0:

    # jm "What good is a dick if it doesn't grow?"
    jm "有什么玩意儿是不长大的鸡鸡？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10200
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_aa63728a:

    # rs "Hm... It would be nice if we grew to be the biggest frat on campus. If you guys are up to sharing rooms and whatnot, let's explore that option more."
    rs "嗯……要是我们能成为校园里最大的兄弟会那就太好了。如果你们愿意一起合住，咱们可以多考虑一下这个选项。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10201
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_label_5dc8e163:

    # rs "Also, it could take us a while to make the attic inhabitable."
    rs "另外，我们可能需要花点时间才能让阁楼变得住得进去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10210
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_dik_choice_label_7af40861:

    # mc "I'm sorry, guys, but I'm not gonna offer my room like that."
    mc "抱歉各位，但我不会这么轻易就把我的房间让出来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10212
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_dik_choice_label_a56fa919:

    # mc "I worked my ass off making it inhabitable. I don't want to share it now."
    mc "我可是拼了老命才把那地方弄得能住人，现在可不想跟人挤。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10214
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_dik_choice_label_4e417a09:

    # rs "Again, sharing rooms is not our first solution. But it's good that some of us are volunteering."
    rs "再说一次，合租并不是我们第一个想到的方案。不过至少有些人愿意主动出力。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10215
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_dik_choice_label_6c62d372:

    # rs "If we want the frat to grow even bigger, we will need room for beds and personal space."
    rs "如果我们想让兄弟会变得更大，我们就需要更多的床位和个人空间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10220
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_neutral_choice_label_6fdb7359:

    # mc "(I'm not that happy about this idea... But if I speak up, I'll look like a selfish ass.)"
    mc "（我不太喜欢这个主意……但要是我反对，我就显得太自私了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10222
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_neutral_choice_label_4b95005a:

    # mc "(Let's hope it doesn't come to this, but I might have to give up a part of my room eventually.)"
    mc "（希望这事别真到了那一步，但最终我可能还是得放弃房间的一部分。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10224
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_neutral_choice_label_a43fe1ff:

    # mc "(Let's hope it doesn't come to this, and I'll fight this fight when I have to.)"
    mc "（希望这事别真到了那一步，等到了我再拼命反抗。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10230
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_chick_choice_label_9bc1f5fa:

    # mc "Fine. If it comes to it, I'll think about sharing my room with someone."
    mc "行吧。如果真到了那一步，我会考虑和别人合住一间房。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10232
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_chick_choice_label_9b4cfec2:

    # mc "We could install another door and extend the wall to create two rooms."
    mc "我们可以装一扇门，把墙砌长一点，分成两个房间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10234
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_chick_choice_label_72979449:

    # mc "I love my room so much, but family comes first."
    mc "我超级爱我的房间，但家人最重要。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10239
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_after_choice_label_ed61be5c:

    # tm "I hope we don't get some total losers for this next batch."
    tm "希望我们这次不会招来一帮彻头彻尾的废物。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10241
translate schinese ep12_dikmas_after_choice_label_e962d860:

    # de "Hey! [name] and I fucking slayed, and you know it!"
    de "嘿！[name]我他妈彻底赢了，你懂的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10264
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5f116536:

    # dad "I'm sad to hear that. Breakups are hard."
    dad "听到这个我很难过。分手真的很难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10266
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1b5d9a1a:

    # dad "I'm sad to hear that. Losing friends can be difficult."
    dad "听到这个我很难过。失去朋友确实很难受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10268
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_31acd8b0:

    # dad "I'm sorry I wasn't more supportive of your relationship. It was a situation I couldn't relate to."
    dad "真抱歉我之前没更支持你们的关系，那情况我完全没法感同身受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10270
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_be2d0023:

    # mc "Yeah... I'll try my best to get over it, but it's wearing me down."
    mc "嗯……我会尽力让自己好起来的，但真的把我累坏了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10273
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6e4ef145:

    # dad "How come you broke up?"
    dad "为什么你分手了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10275
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2b689d41:

    # dad "What was the reason for it?"
    dad "为什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10280
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f8af1b4b:

    # mc "I was going to break up with her because of Zoey."
    mc "我是打算因为Zoey跟她分手的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10282
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a76d008c:

    # dad "Was it about Zoey?"
    dad "是因为Zoey吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10284
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_da3870ca:

    # mc "Part of it was, but I did a horrible thing with Sage's mom."
    mc "其中一部分原因是因为我跟Sage的妈妈做了一件极其糟糕的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10286
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7314514f:

    # mc "I did a horrible thing with Sage's mom."
    mc "我跟Sage的妈妈干了一件极其糟糕的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10289
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a3234acd:

    # dad "With...her mom?"
    dad "和……她妈妈？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10291
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f86efaf1:

    # dad "With...Sage's mom?"
    dad "和……Sage的妈妈？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10293
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c89acc21:

    # mc "You probably don't want to hear it. But yeah, I did something bad, and that led to this. So..."
    mc "你可能不想听这些。但说实话，我做了一件很糟糕的事，这才导致了现在的情况。所以……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10295
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_41d38afe:

    # dad "Do you regret it?"
    dad "你后悔吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10297
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2f068911:

    # mc "I do."
    mc "我做了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10299
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6460c017:

    # dad "Then use that as a life lesson."
    dad "那就把它当作人生一课吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10301
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_737d43b9:

    # mc "Yeah... I learned my lesson, but I wish I hadn't had to."
    mc "嗯……我吸取教训了，但真希望不用以这种方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10303
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ee4bd80e:

    # mc "And about Zoey... We love each other, and we just got back together."
    mc "关于Zoey……我们彼此相爱，而且刚刚重新在一起了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10305
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1e206f48:

    # dad "It might not help you feel better about your breakup, but I'm happy for you and Zoey."
    dad "这可能不会让你 分手 的事好受些，但我真心为你和Zoey感到高兴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10307
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6fec9b2b:

    # mc "Thanks. It's not the perfect way to get back together, but it's what we both want."
    mc "谢谢。这可能不是最完美的复合方式，但这是我们两个人都想要的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10310
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_82fafb32:

    # mc "But there's some good news too regarding Zoey... We love each other, and we just got back together."
    mc "但关于Zoey也有好消息……我们彼此相爱，而且刚刚重新在一起了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10312
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0cf39f33:

    # dad "It might not help you feel better about Sage, but I'm happy for you and Zoey."
    dad "这可能对你缓解对Sage的伤痛没什么帮助，但我真心为你和Zoey感到高兴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10313
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ef0f8ce9:

    # dad "I can't say I'm surprised. I know how hard it was for you to get over her. It appears you never did."
    dad "我一点都不意外。我知道你摆脱她有多难。看起来你根本就没真正放下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10315
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e50cf77b:

    # mc "Yeah. I was fooling myself..."
    mc "嗯. 我一直在骗自己..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10317
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_77686beb:

    # mc "It was because of Zoey."
    mc "是因为Zoey。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10319
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_efe2e418:

    # dad "It was about Zoey?"
    dad "这是关于Zoey的事吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10321
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3c25ab1a:

    # mc "Yeah, but it's also good. We love each other, and we just got back together."
    mc "嗯，但这也挺好的。我们彼此相爱，而且刚刚重新在一起了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10323
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1e206f48_1:

    # dad "It might not help you feel better about your breakup, but I'm happy for you and Zoey."
    dad "这可能不会让你 分手 的事好受些，但我还是为你和Zoey感到高兴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10325
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6fec9b2b_1:

    # mc "Thanks. It's not the perfect way to get back together, but it's what we both want."
    mc "谢谢。这也不是最好的复合方式，但这是我们两个人都想要的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10327
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ef0f8ce9_1:

    # dad "I can't say I'm surprised. I know how hard it was for you to get over her. It appears you never did."
    dad "我一点都不意外。我知道你摆脱她有多难。看起来你根本就没真正放下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10329
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e50cf77b_1:

    # mc "Yeah. I was fooling myself..."
    mc "嗯，我一直在骗自己……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10331
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7314514f_1:

    # mc "I did a horrible thing with Sage's mom."
    mc "我跟Sage的妈妈干了件见不得人的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10334
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a3234acd_1:

    # dad "With...her mom?"
    dad "和……她妈妈？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10336
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f86efaf1_1:

    # dad "With...Sage's mom?"
    dad "和……Sage的妈妈？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10338
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_74f7b38c:

    # mc "You probably don't want to hear it. But yeah, I did something bad and that led to this. So..."
    mc "你可能不想听这些。但说实话，我做了一件很糟糕的事，才导致了这一切。所以……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10340
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_41d38afe_1:

    # dad "Do you regret it?"
    dad "你后悔吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10342
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2f068911_1:

    # mc "I do."
    mc "我做了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10344
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_8fae353b:

    # dad "Then use it as a life lesson."
    dad "然后把它当作一次人生教训。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10346
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_d6d2d51e:

    # mc "Yeah... I learned my lesson, but I wish I didn't have to learn it."
    mc "嗯... 我学到了教训，但真希望当初不用学。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10348
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_64c020b8:

    # mc "It was my fault. I wasn't ready for a relationship. I wanted to stay single."
    mc "是我的错。我当时还没准备好进入一段关系，我想要保持单身。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10349
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_9060c916:

    # mc "It's either that or the relationship didn't make me feel like it was enough for me. It's hard to put a finger on it."
    mc "要么就是这段关系没让我觉得它足够，对我来说。很难说清楚到底是怎么回事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10351
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0f823585:

    # dad "You'll likely experience more heartbreaks in your life."
    dad "你这一生大概还会经历更多心碎。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10353
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3d3e4deb:

    # mc "Thanks, Dad..."
    mc "谢谢，老爸..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10355
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_90759d81:

    # dad "It's not what I wish, of course. But that's life for you."
    dad "当然不是我想要的。但这就是生活。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10357
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10360
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_d9a2686e:

    # dad "That makes me happy to hear!"
    dad "这让我听了很高兴！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10362
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_fa375fcf:

    # mc "It does?"
    mc "这有什么不好的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10364
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4b0b3be2:

    # dad "Why wouldn't it?"
    dad "为什么不会呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10366
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_dd5c06fd:

    # mc "Well, I was worried you'd think it was a bad idea."
    mc "那我担心你可能会觉得这是个馊主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10368
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_428d1bc1:

    # dad "She may have broken your heart, but you two finding a way back together confirms my suspicions."
    dad "她可能伤了你的心，但你们能重新走到一起，这印证了我的猜测。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10370
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_12764c41:

    # mc "What suspicions?"
    mc "什么怀疑？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10372
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2d099ef9:

    # dad "That it wasn't because she didn't love you that she left. It was because of personal reasons."
    dad "那她离开不是因为不爱了，而是有她自己的原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10374
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_40532ea5:

    # mc "It didn't feel that way when she stopped caring about me, and we lost touch."
    mc "她不再在乎我的时候，感觉就不一样了，我们也没了联系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10375
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0895f36e:

    # mc "I don't think she realized what her feelings were for me back then, but she does now."
    mc "我觉得她以前可能没意识到自己对我的感觉，但现在她明白了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10377
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_78fe3e58:

    # dad "Whatever the reason is, I'm overjoyed. You two share a special bond."
    dad "不管是什么原因，我都很高兴。你们两个之间有种特别的联系。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10379
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f1d9695b:

    # mc "Thank you, Dad."
    mc "谢谢，老爸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10382
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_9bb34e81:

    # dad "When will she get here?"
    dad "她什么时候到？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10384
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ad229d64:

    # mc "Tomorrow. If that's ok with you."
    mc "明天。如果你没问题的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10386
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_22984229:

    # dad "Tomorrow? Doesn't she have family to celebrate with?"
    dad "明天？她难道没有家人一起庆祝吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10388
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4d0b3bc3:

    # mc "She doesn't."
    mc "她没那个意思。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10390
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f9dd3f32:

    # dad "Oh my... Well, why didn't you tell me earlier? She could have come here today."
    dad "天啊……那你为什么不早点告诉我？她今天本来可以一起来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10392
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7d480f8b:

    # mc "I needed this alone time with you. You see, there's something I left out about her."
    mc "我需要和你独处的时间。你明白，我漏掉了一件事关于她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10393
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_285c0896:

    # mc "She's older than me."
    mc "她比我大。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10395
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1d7cc512:

    # dad "There's nothing wrong with an age gap, son. It's just a number, and the older you get, the less the gap matters."
    dad "这年龄差没什么大不了，儿子。不过是个数字，你年纪越大，这差距就越不值一提。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10397
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ef9b2a3f:

    # mc "She's 36 years old."
    mc "她36岁。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10399
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_d696b68b:

    # dad "Well, there you have it. She's thirty..."
    dad "好吧，就是这样。她三十二岁……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10401
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_11f12fe6:

    # dad "36?"
    dad "三十六？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10403
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "嗯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10405
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_38ddc69d:

    # dad "Didn't you say she was in your class?"
    dad "你不是说她是你班上的老师吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10407
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_bb291d21:

    # mc "About that... I wasn't technically lying, but..."
    mc "关于那个……我并没有说谎，但也不完全是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10408
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_d516d145:

    # mc "She's been my teacher in one of my classes."
    mc "她是我上过的一门课的老师。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10410
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3858e600:

    # dad "Oh no..."
    dad "哦不..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10412
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e43d2438:

    # mc "But it's nothing like that, Dad. Trust me."
    mc "但这和那事完全不一样，老爸。相信我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10413
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c865b822:

    # mc "We met in the library where she works as a librarian."
    mc "我们在图书馆认识的，她在那里当图书管理员。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10414
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ee156a68:

    # mc "And after we got together, she became my teacher because my first teacher, Cathy, quit."
    mc "然后我们在一起之后，她成了我的老师，因为我的第一个老师Cathy辞职了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10416
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_d6c7d49e:

    # mc "It wasn't a teacher-student kind of relationship at first. But then it became one..."
    mc "起初我们之间并不是那种师生关系。但后来，它变成了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10417
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_63fbc673:

    # mc "And, as you've already figured out, it's a problem for us."
    mc "而且，正如你已经猜到的，这对我们来说是个问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10419
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e5dba1d1:

    # dad "Are you going to be on the news for this?"
    dad "你这是要上新闻了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10421
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2440d016:

    # mc "I hope not... We've kept it a secret all semester."
    mc "我希望不会被曝光……这整个学期我们一直都在瞒着。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10423
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_173efb64:

    # dad "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I'm worried about this."
    dad "*{i}叹气{/i}*我担心这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10425
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_12f82ee8:

    # mc "Yeah, I'm worried too. But I love her."
    mc "嗯，我也担心。但我爱她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10427
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3dd9edc7:

    # dad "You love her?"
    dad "你爱她？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10429
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_44d5cd64:

    # mc "Yeah... I know you know what that's like."
    mc "嗯……我知道你明白那是什么滋味。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10430
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_57b97647:

    # mc "To be into someone you shouldn't be."
    mc "对不该喜欢的人动心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10432
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_66850edf:

    # dad "Yes... I remember that feeling."
    dad "是的……我记得那种感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10433
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_84abeecd:

    # dad "I'm happy you found love. But I will always be a parent first when it comes to you."
    dad "我很高兴你找到了爱情。但在我眼里，你永远是我的孩子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10435
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e73399c1:

    # mc "I know. And I'm happy that you are looking out for me."
    mc "我知道。我很高兴你还在关心我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10436
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_80a7eda2:

    # mc "Do you still want to meet her?"
    mc "你还是想见她吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10438
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_eb3e7033:

    # dad "I do."
    dad "我确实想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10440
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_12987717:

    # mc "Tomorrow then."
    mc "那明天吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10442
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_21ad61ab:

    # dad "Tomorrow."
    dad "明天。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10445
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6c19e725:

    # dad "How was the food?"
    dad "饭怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10447
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4c7abd49:

    # mc "Delicious, Dad. I've missed your cooking."
    mc "美味，老爸。我好想你做的饭。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10449
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f0f0bd5e:

    # dad "It feels great to have you home. Even though I know it's just for a little while."
    dad "有你回家感觉真好。虽然我知道只是暂时的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10451
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c20713b6:

    # mc "Yeah, I wish I could stay for the duration of the break, but I have plans."
    mc "不过我真希望能一直待到假期结束，但我有安排。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10453
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_bcc2c839:

    # mc "I've been meaning to tell you, I've entered into a fighting competition."
    mc "我一直在想告诉你，我参加了一个格斗比赛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10455
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_89665c7c:

    # dad "A competition? Wow! With your fighting club?"
    dad "比赛？哇！你那家搏击俱乐部？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10457
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e78728bf:

    # mc "Yes. I'm fighting at my gym on the 29th. My trainer wanted me to join, and so I did."
    mc "是的，我是在29号在我们健身房比赛。我的教练让我参加，我就参加了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10458
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_b4fdbbe5:

    # mc "I'm nervous about it."
    mc "我有点紧张。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10460
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a30d29cf:

    # dad "I would be too. It's a big step. Can I watch?"
    dad "我也会紧张。这是一次很大的挑战。我能看看吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10462
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5670e2af:

    # mc "Dad... With you there, I'd get even more nervous."
    mc "老爸...你在我身边的话，我只会更紧张。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10463
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c2a61004:

    # mc "Would it be ok if you don't show up for this one? If it's something I want to continue doing, I'll let you come for the next one."
    mc "要不你这次比赛别来了？如果我之后还想继续做这个，下次再让你看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10465
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_b5741cca:

    # dad "Hehe. Are you ashamed of me?"
    dad "嘿嘿，你是不是觉得我丢脸？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10467
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_dda456d3:

    # mc "No, it's not that."
    mc "不是，我没那个意思。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10469
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e330e4e4:

    # mc "I've been meaning to tell you, I've been asked to perform at the faculty's Christmas party."
    mc "我一直在想告诉你，我被邀请去参加教职员工的圣诞晚会演出。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10471
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5a14f9ef:

    # dad "Wow! You have?"
    dad "哇！你真的有？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10473
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f6d6eff6:

    # mc "Yeah. Professor Hoff liked my performance at the recital, and he asked me to play at the party."
    mc "嗯。霍夫教授喜欢我在独奏会上的表演，所以他邀请我参加派对演出。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10474
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_26e4ec28:

    # mc "He says it's a way to network with people, but I also get paid some."
    mc "他说这是个认识人的方法，但我也能拿点报酬。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10476
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3e0ae589:

    # dad "And you get to share your music."
    dad "你还能分享你的音乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10478
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6d61e835:

    # mc "Yeah, I will play 20 minutes worth of Christmas songs."
    mc "嗯，是的，我打算演奏二十分钟的圣诞歌曲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10480
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_25f742ec:

    # dad "Then I understand you'll need some time to practice before that."
    dad "那我得找个时间好好练练了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10482
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4f471c7e:

    # mc "I haven't had too many opportunities to practice because of my finals."
    mc "因为我期末考试一直忙，没怎么机会练习。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10484
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2e5175b3:

    # mc "There's this big New Year's Eve party we're hosting, and I need to help out."
    mc "我们这有个大型的跨年派对，我得帮忙准备一下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10487
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_865e8a66:

    # dad "Well, if you're leaving for campus again soon, I won't hold back on being sappy this Christmas."
    dad "那如果你除了回家过圣诞，还打算很快回校园的话，我这次可不会客气地表达我的感伤了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10488
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_920fe885:

    # dad "You'll have to endure listening to my stories from your childhood."
    dad "你得忍受听我讲你小时候的故事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10490
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2b653575:

    # mc "You'll hear no complaints from me. I love being home, but I also love to be independent."
    mc "你别指望我会抱怨。我爱待在家里，但也爱独立生活。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10491
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ada9bd17:

    # mc "Do you remember that feeling? Of moving out?"
    mc "你记得那种感觉吗？搬出去的感觉？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10493
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0c5f7b9f:

    # dad "Back then, life was different."
    dad "那时候的生活可不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10494
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_b8fe0c20:

    # dad "I ran away from home when I was 15. And I didn't do it because of college or anything fancy..."
    dad "我15岁就离家出走了。而且我这么做不是因为大学或者什么高大上的理由……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10495
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_63d876b3:

    # dad "I did it because I had to get away from Mom."
    dad "我是因为必须离开妈妈才跑掉的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10497
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_11cf6207:

    # mc "Right... It's not the same."
    mc "对了……这感觉不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10499
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_307e0840:

    # dad "The first few months were the hardest. But my uncle took me under his wing as an apprentice, and it's because of him that I ended up working in construction."
    dad "前几个月最难熬。但我的叔叔收留了我，当了他的学徒，要不是他，我根本不会在建筑行业工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10501
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c20b770b:

    # mc "Did you ever return home?"
    mc "你后来回过家吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10503
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_190649d5:

    # dad "I came to visit. And I know that Mom talked to Uncle Hank behind my back - well, because Hank told me."
    dad "我来拜访了。我知道我妈背着我跟汉克叔叔说了话——嗯，因为汉克告诉我的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10504
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_909b1ce0:

    # dad "That's what I always liked about him. He didn't keep any secrets, but I was lying left and right."
    dad "这就是我最欣赏他的地方。他从不藏着掖着，但我却总在撒谎。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10506
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_28f2e6b2:

    # dad "That's how it was growing up. I often had to lie to Mom to avoid beatings."
    dad "就是这样长大的。我经常得骗妈妈，才能躲过一顿打。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10507
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c04198ee:

    # dad "But Hank treated me well. He had a twisted sense of humor, too."
    dad "但汉克对我很好，他也有个扭曲的幽默感。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10508
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_84149ffe:

    # dad "He once sent me to the depot to purchase a list of materials for a contract we were working on."
    dad "他曾经让我去仓库买一份我们正在执行的合同所需的材料清单。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10510
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a2006495:

    # dad "And I had to ask the clerk where to find the wooden BU-tt plugs."
    dad "我还得问店员，木制‘屁眼塞’该去哪里找。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10511
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1b960ca7:

    # dad "And the clerk laughed at me, said someone was joking with me, and that they didn't sell any butt plugs."
    dad "那个店员还笑我，说有人跟我开玩笑，他们根本不卖这种东西。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10513
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_880e8c8a:

    # dad "I didn't fully understand the joke at the time, but that was Uncle Hank for you."
    dad "当时我还没完全听懂这个笑话，但汉克叔叔就是这种人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10515
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2b8671fc:

    # mc "Hahaha! That's a good one!"
    mc "哈哈哈！这笑话真不错！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10517
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_83fa23c2:

    # dad "Ahh... Uncle Hank. May God rest his soul."
    dad "啊……霍恩克叔叔。愿主安息他的灵魂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10519
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_92625de8:

    # mc "Was it because of Hank that you got work with Kovak's Carpentry?"
    mc "是不是因为汉克才让你进的科瓦克木工那工作？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10521
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0242bb77:

    # dad "It was. After I finished my apprenticeship, Hank recommended me for the job."
    dad "就是这么回事。我完成学徒期后，汉克推荐我去了那份工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10522
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_bba52e7b:

    # dad "Hank was getting old, and he couldn't afford to keep me on. He thought it was the best move for me."
    dad "韩克年纪大了，付不起养我这个徒弟的薪水。他认为这是对我最好的安排。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10523
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_b7419768:

    # dad "He always looked out for me. He was like the parent I never had."
    dad "他一直都照顾我，就像我从未拥有过的父亲一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10525
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_614ccd4f:

    # mc "I've read more of Mom's diary, Dad. And...uh..."
    mc "我读了更多妈妈的日记，爸爸。呃……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10526
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_014bd71b:

    # mc "There's something I need to talk to you about."
    mc "有件事我想和你谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10528
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7a98407a:

    # dad "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I've been expecting it."
    dad "*{i}叹气{/i}*我早料到了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10530
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_076b577d:

    # mc "It's been great to learn about Mom, and I got to read her stories about how you two met."
    mc "了解妈妈的经历真不错，还读到了你和爸爸是怎么认识的故事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10531
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2d489ae4:

    # mc "It's been graphic at times. Um... I didn't need to read the details about her sex life."
    mc "有时候还挺露骨的。嗯……我本来不想看她性生活那些细节的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10533
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_aa74dbc6:

    # mc "But then I came across this entry she wrote that left me stunned."
    mc "但后来我看到她写的一段，让我震惊不已。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10535
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_fe9e3b77:

    # dad "..."
    dad "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10537
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_09d8d160:

    # mc "She wrote that her mom told her dad about the two of you. And that they didn't want you to be together."
    mc "她写她妈妈告诉了她爸爸你俩的事，而且他们不希望你们在一起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10539
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3a789668:

    # dad "It's true."
    dad "是真的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10541
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e2ae7357:

    # mc "I know. You've told me that, but you never told me he fired you and threatened to sue you. And that you assaulted him..."
    mc "我知道。你跟我说过这些，但你从来没跟我说过他开除了你，还威胁要起诉你。还有你打了他……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10542
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_71f69236:

    # mc "Mom loved you, but the way she described it shocked me."
    mc "我妈是爱你的，但她是用那种让我震惊的方式说出来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10544
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3a99aae3:

    # mc "I felt like I didn't recognize you through her words."
    mc "我听着她的话，感觉你完全变了个人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10545
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_ac4c5072:

    # mc "Did you really hit Grandpa?"
    mc "你真的打了爷爷？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10547
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_793f0b3c:

    # dad "He fired me for what I had done. And it's true, I didn't react well to hearing that."
    dad "他因为我的所作所为把我开除了。而且确实，听到那个消息时我反应很不好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10548
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_20c8a8c9:

    # dad "And I hit him repeatedly."
    dad "我狠狠打了他一顿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10550
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_cdf79c56:

    # mc "Because you loved Mom?"
    mc "因为你是爱妈妈的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10552
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5e9b6f5a:

    # dad "That, and he wanted to take away what I had worked hard for - my job."
    dad "那，他还想夺走我努力争取来的东西——我的工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10553
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f0166cc5:

    # dad "It was all I had. And in that moment, he took it away from me."
    dad "这便是我一切的依靠。就在那一刻，他把它从我手中夺走了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10554
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_43e9dcf0:

    # dad "It was a knee-jerk reaction, and I even scared myself for letting it happen."
    dad "这完全是下意识的反应，我甚至自己都吓了一跳，居然会做出这种事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10556
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5b6a486e:

    # dad "Later, he sued me for assault."
    dad "后来他起诉我诽谤。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10558
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_59dc0c75:

    # mc "He sued you for the assault? Not because you trespassed?"
    mc "他起诉你是因为你袭击了他？不是因为你擅闯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10560
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4546b80d:

    # dad "He couldn't hold me liable for that. Kovak's Carpentry had insurance to cover such disputes."
    dad "他不能因为我这么做就起诉我。科瓦克木工有保险，可以覆盖这类纠纷。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10561
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f9450df5:

    # dad "But he pressed charges against me because I broke his nose, and I ended up settling in court to avoid prison."
    dad "但他对我提起了诉讼，因为我打坏了他的鼻子，最后我只能在法庭上和解，以免坐牢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10563
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_160e4630:

    # dad "*{i}Sniffles{/i}*"
    dad "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10564
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_0126e082:

    # mc "Dad..."
    mc "爸爸..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:10566
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_9506152f:

    # dad "But Mr. Kovak understood my side of the story and didn't fire me, despite the lawsuit."
    dad "但科瓦克先生理解了我的处境，尽管有诉讼，他并没有开除我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10567
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_5e82d4cb:

    # dad "He let me work on minor contracts while they finished the work on the hotel."
    dad "他让我负责一些小规模的合同项目，而他们则继续完成酒店的工程。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10569
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_71235a73:

    # dad "There's so much I've wanted to tell you, but I couldn't."
    dad "我有太多想对你说的，但一直没能说出口。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10570
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_70f1980d:

    # dad "That's why I let the diary do it for me."
    dad "这就是为什么我让日记替我来说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10572
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_fb415255:

    # mc "What? The diary didn't come from Mom? I thought it was my inheritance."
    mc "什么？这本日记不是从我妈那儿来的？我还以为这是我的遗产。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10574
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_1454dcad:

    # dad "It's her diary, but I'm the one who gave it to you."
    dad "这是她的日记，但却是我把它交到你手上的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10576
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_9337f45a:

    # mc "Do you know what's in it?"
    mc "你知道里面有什么吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10578
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2ce9a4d2:

    # dad "Yes. Life with Lynette has been the hardest journey I've made."
    dad "是的。和Lynette一起生活的这段日子，是我经历过的最难熬的旅程。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10579
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7941a0dd:

    # dad "I have protected you in the way I thought was best. But I've realized I didn't do you any favors in doing so."
    dad "我一直在用我认为最好的方式保护你。但后来我意识到，这么做其实对你并没有好处。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10581
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_e9a33b2e:

    # dad "Now, I wanted the diary to tell you the truth."
    dad "现在，我想用这本日记告诉你真相。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10582
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_42369e0b:

    # dad "It's because I love you, and don't have the capacity to tell you myself."
    dad "因为我爱你，而我没办法亲自告诉你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10584
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10586
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_12e3f119:

    # dad "Because I'm scared you won't forgive me."
    dad "因为我怕你不会原谅我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10588
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_55e4fe1c:

    # mc "Forgive you for what?"
    mc "原谅你什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10590
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_2a227256:

    # dad "For lying and sheltering you from the harsh reality in a way that I shouldn't have."
    dad "因为我撒谎，还把你从残酷现实中保护起来，而我本不该这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10592
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_efa37424:

    # mc "Dad... Stop."
    mc "爸爸……别说了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10593
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_af0026e2:

    # mc "You've been the best dad all my life. If you're worried that I will look at you in another way because you did bad things when you were young, guess what...?"
    mc "你这辈子一直都是个好爸爸。如果你担心因为年轻时做过一些不好的事，我会对你另眼相看，那我告诉你……？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10594
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7d3e1140:

    # mc "It's not gonna happen."
    mc "这不会发生的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10596
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_f0373b2a:

    # mc "I'm not perfect either. I've made many mistakes and bad calls."
    mc "我也不完美。我犯过很多错，做过很多蠢事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10597
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_4c4556da:

    # mc "And I refuse to let anyone, or anything, change the way I look at you."
    mc "我绝不会让任何人或任何事改变我对你的看法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10599
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_6d491903:

    # mc "If this diary is going to tell me that you're anything but great..."
    mc "如果这本日记要告诉我你根本不是个好人……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10600
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_a8aa94b2:

    # mc "To hell with it! I won't read another word from it."
    mc "该见鬼的！我再也不想看它一个字了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10601
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_987a122e:

    # mc "I already know who you are. I don't need to hear about your sins and mistakes. I only need you."
    mc "我已经知道你是谁了。我不需要听你那些罪孽和错误。我只需要你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10603
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_7c5ed869:

    # dad "I love you, son."
    dad "我爱你，伙计。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10605
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_794a9f99:

    # mc "I know you do. And I love you."
    mc "我知道你也是。我爱你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10607
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c6ed5552:

    # dad "I'm so proud of who you have become. Never forget that."
    dad "我为你成为的那个人感到无比骄傲。永远别忘记这一点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10612
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_3a30e758:

    # mc "{i}Dad...{/i}"
    mc "{i}爸爸...{/i}"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10614
translate schinese ep12_holidays_label_c034a3d8:

    # mc "{i}What have you done?{/i}"
    mc "{i}你干了什么？{/i}"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10628
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_738e9326:

    # zmom "Zoey. I thought I heard footsteps out in the garden, and there was a man out there looking for you."
    zmom "Zoey。我好像听见花园里有脚步声，外面有个男人在找你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10632
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e7ba7960:

    # zo "I stopped believing in Santa when I was five, Mom."
    zo "我五岁的时候就不再相信圣诞老人了，妈妈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10634
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_2d6b886b:

    # zmom "Haha! I wasn't talking about Santa."
    zmom "哈哈！我可没说圣诞老人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10639
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e3cbf3d5:

    # mc "Merry Christmas, everyone."
    mc "圣诞快乐，大家。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10644
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e8dbcbde:

    # zo "[name]? You're here."
    zo "[name]你在这里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10649
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_438442f6:

    # mc "I'm celebrating with Dad as always. I thought I'd drop by."
    mc "我照常和爸爸一起庆祝。我本来想过来打个招呼。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10650
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_3bc5d268:

    # mc "I hope I'm not interrupting any tradition."
    mc "希望我没打扰到什么传统。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10652
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_50ffaa39:

    # zmom "You're always welcome here, [name]. Merry Christmas to you, too."
    zmom "你随时都可以来这里[name]你也圣诞快乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10654
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_8efe6703:

    # flo "Merry Christmas, [name]. It's been a while."
    flo "圣诞快乐，[name]已经有一段时间了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10656
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_6567ff5f:

    # mc "Yeah. How have you been?"
    mc "嗯，最近怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10658
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_c19914d2:

    # flo "Can't complain."
    flo "没啥可抱怨的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10659
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d37b062e:

    # flo "Come. Have a drink with us."
    flo "来吧，和我们喝一杯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10664
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_0918307f:

    # zo "I want to talk to him before you guys do that."
    zo "我想在他你们之前跟他谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10669
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_f8f686a5:

    # mc "Your room?"
    mc "你的房间？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10671
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_b9f01cd8:

    # flo "The drink will wait for you."
    flo "这杯酒等你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10674
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_64eabe75:

    # mc "How has your Christmas been so far?"
    mc "你圣诞节过得怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10676
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_c53e5217:

    # zo "It's been nice. Everyone has been getting along. It's weird."
    zo "挺不错的。大家相处得都挺好。挺奇怪的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10678
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_ff844390:

    # mc "Even you and Floyd?"
    mc "就算你和Floyd也这样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10680
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_296d3f9b:

    # zo "Yeah. It's hella weird... Maybe Mom told him to behave, but that never worked before."
    zo "对，怪得要命……也许是妈妈让他规矩点，可她以前说什么也没用。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10682
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_b2e5c296:

    # mc "That must be a nice feeling for Alison - to see you two get along."
    mc "这对你来说一定感觉不错，Alison——看到你俩能处得来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10684
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_7a2dd8cb:

    # zo "Maybe it was his Christmas gift to her or something. Or maybe it was because he thinks I'm going away again soon."
    zo "也许是他给她的圣诞礼物，或者只是他以为我很快又要离开了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10686
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_30d6c1cb:

    # mc "To B&R? Did you get in?"
    mc "给B&R？你进去了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10688
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_9e65dc4d:

    # zo "I'm on the waiting list."
    zo "我在候补名单上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10690
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_4cbccb61:

    # mc "At what spot?"
    mc "在哪个位置？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10692
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_38463ef9:

    # zo "8. It sucks..."
    zo "8分。感觉糟透了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10694
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5b216271:

    # mc "No, no. 8 isn't bad. 8 is good."
    mc "不，不。8号位置挺好的，8号其实不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10696
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_cb46c41a:

    # zo "Really? Do you think it's doable?"
    zo "真的吗？你觉得有希望吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10698
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d0a669d4:

    # mc "Someone I know was 14th in line, and she got in."
    mc "我认识的人排在第14位，结果进去了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10700
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_f934ce55:

    # zo "That makes me feel better."
    zo "这让我感觉好点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10702
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_a4528926:

    # mc "Just stay positive. It's not over because you're on that list."
    mc "保持积极。你还在名单上，事情还没结束。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10704
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_0fabdba6:

    # zo "What about you? How have you been?"
    zo "你呢？最近怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10706
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_ebe1e8c8:

    # mc "I had my finals week. It was stressful."
    mc "我刚经历了期末周，挺紧张的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10708
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_1a22fdab:

    # zo "How did it go?"
    zo "怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10712
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_7b9fb183:

    # mc "I had a good feeling from it, but we'll see after Christmas."
    mc "我感觉还不错，不过圣诞节之后再看结果吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10714
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5ca2c0ad:

    # mc "I don't think I did very well. I'll need a Christmas miracle to pass my tests."
    mc "我觉得我考得不太行。我得靠圣诞奇迹才能通过考试。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10716
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_7b9fb183_1:

    # mc "I had a good feeling from it, but we'll see after Christmas."
    mc "我感觉还不错，但圣诞假期后才能知道结果。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10717
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e5138603:

    # mc "I try to put it out of my mind until I know for sure."
    mc "我尽量不去想这些，直到有确切结果为止。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10719
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_8c985b08:

    # zo "Here's hoping."
    zo "但愿如此。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10721
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_19ee950c:

    # mc "Aside from the tests, I've been celebrating with my friends and such..."
    mc "除了考试，我最近一直在和朋友们一起庆祝，各种玩乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10722
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d42f0cb2:

    # mc "Things are going on that weigh on my mind, but it's been ok."
    mc "事情有些让我烦心，但还算过得去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10723
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_acd4b878:

    # mc "I've been thinking a lot about you."
    mc "我一直在想你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10725
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_99f3b985:

    # zo "Same. Like...fucking daily."
    zo "一样啊。就像……每天都在发生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10729
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_92f9d9d0:

    # mc "I broke up with my girlfriends."
    mc "我跟女朋友分手了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10731
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_cac904e4:

    # mc "I broke up with my girlfriend."
    mc "我跟我的女朋友分手了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10733
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_3aaee54d:

    # zo "You did?"
    zo "你真的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10736
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_156e00d0:

    # mc "Well, she broke up with me. And it wasn't even because of you."
    mc "好吧，她跟我分手了。而且还不是因为你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10738
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e9dccffd:

    # mc "Yeah... It was horrible. I felt like a piece of shit doing it."
    mc "嗯……太痛苦了。做这件事时，我觉得自己就是个人渣。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10739
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_75a97d6c:

    # mc "But I had to do it."
    mc "但我不得不这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10741
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_f67c4ba6:

    # zo "I don't want to read too much into that, but does that mean...?"
    zo "我不太想把这事想得太复杂，但这是什么意思？"

