    # mc "That's why Sage broke up with me, if you hadn't guessed."
    mc "这就是为什么Sage和我分手了，如果你还没猜到的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10790
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_b8bbe3ae:

    # mc "That's why my girlfriend broke up with me, if you hadn't guessed."
    mc "这就是为什么我的女朋友和我分手了，如果你还没猜到的话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10794
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_9d095389:

    # mc "I got a handjob from my girlfriend's mom in class, when she was my teacher. I didn't know she was my girlfriend's mom, but I did it."
    mc "我在课堂上被我女友的母亲摸了手，当时她还是我的老师。我不知道她是她妈妈，但我确实这么做了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10796
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_a695a601:

    # mc "I got a handjob from my friend's mom in class, when she was my teacher. I didn't know she was my friend's mom, but I did it."
    mc "我在课堂上被我朋友的妈妈摸了手，那时候她还是我的老师。我不知道她是她妈妈，但我做了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10799
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d14a271e:

    # mc "And about the fights... It wasn't just self-defense. I could have avoided fighting, but I did it."
    mc "关于打架的事……那可不是单纯的自卫。我完全可以避开打架，但我还是做了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10800
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_b3e3d158:

    # mc "I broke the code that Dad taught me."
    mc "我打破了爸爸教我的那套规矩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10802
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5288dd77:

