    mc "我还故意挑起了一场架。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10804
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_38e8d35d:

    # mc "During Hell Week, I broke into the preps' mansion. I streaked at the mall and got chased by a cop."
    mc "地狱周期间，我闯进了预科生的豪宅。我在商场光着身子跑，结果被警察追了一路。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10807
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_15a5674a:

    # mc "I cheated on my midterm by looking at the answers I found in the bathroom."
    mc "我在期中考试时作弊了，偷看了在洗手间找到的答案。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10809
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_ac4edf23:

    # mc "All of this is a result of what happened between us and what happened to me after you left."
    mc "这一切都是因为我们在那段时间发生的事，还有你离开后我经历的一切。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10810
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_3a699dd0:

    # mc "I don't blame you for my actions. I made those choices, and I stand by them - mistakes or not."
    mc "我不怪你我的所作所为。那些选择是我自己做的，我站在我的决定这边——无论对错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10812
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_4b575a59:

    # mc "I could go on and tell you in detail about everything I did. But I think you can hear it from these words..."
    mc "我本可以详细告诉你我做了什么。但我觉得，你从这些话里就能听出来了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10813
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_10177946:

    # mc "I'm not the same guy that you used to know."
    mc "我不是你以前认识的那个家伙了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10814
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_729a707a:

    # mc "Can you still say that you love me after hearing all this?"
    mc "你能在我听完这些之后，还说你爱我吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10818
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5aac13a9:

    # zo "[name]. I know you're not the same person anymore."
    zo "[name]我知道你已经不是从前的你了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10819
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_75e38ed5:

