    zo "我也不再是以前那个女孩了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10821
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_f60dab10:

    # zo "But I know that underneath all of this... There's still the guy I grew up with."
    zo "但我知道，这一切之下……还有那个我一起长大的家伙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10822
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5a485e6d:

    # zo "And there's still the guy I fell in love with."
    zo "还有我爱上的那个男孩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10824
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_cfb22efe:

    # zo "You can tell me about everything you did. Every girl you fucked. Every guy you punched."
    zo "你可以跟我说你干了什么。你睡过的每个女孩，打过的每个家伙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10825
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_f8e9ed99:

    # zo "But don't focus on the negatives because I know you've done great things too. Your brothers have told me all about it."
    zo "但别只盯着那些负面的事，我知道你也有做过很棒的事情。你的兄弟们已经跟我讲过了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10827
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_b0adde12:

    # zo "You're focusing on the negatives because you think they will scare me away."
    zo "你只盯着那些负面的事，因为你以为这样能把我吓跑。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10828
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d6df6b0e:

    # zo "But they won't. We all do bad shit."
    zo "但他们会的。我们所有人都做过些见不得人的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10830
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_231879e5:

    # zo "I want to slam the big fat reset button with us, and that goes for whatever you did, too."
    zo "我想把我们之间的关系重置一下，不管你做过什么，我都想重新开始。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10831
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_e2330d78:

    # zo "To me, the real question isn't if I'm ok with what you did. The question is, can you forgive me for what I have done?"
    zo "对我而言，真正的问题不是我能不能接受你做过的事。问题是，你能不能原谅我做过的事？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10833
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_112c3f64:

    # mc "I want to. And I think that I can forgive you in time."
    mc "我想这么做。而且我相信，总有一天我能原谅你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10835
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_da76b17b:

    # mc "It only hurt so much because you meant the world to me."
    mc "它只让我痛了这么久，是因为你对我来说意义非凡。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10836
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_5b5ff057:

    # mc "And what's that if not love?"
    mc "那又是什么，如果这不是爱呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10840
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_d1eddac5:

    # mc "I love you, Zoey. I fucking love you."
    mc "我爱你，Zoey。我他妈的爱你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10846
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_98df5579:

    # zo "Then let's do this. Together."
    zo "那我们就一起做吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10847
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_c159b97b:

