    mc "这是其中一个原因，对的。但还有个原因是我已经不再对你有那种感觉了。我现在已经处在一段幸福的关系里了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10912
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_6b3763da:

    # mc "It's one of the reasons, yeah. But also, I'm past feeling that way about you."
    mc "其中一个原因就是这个，没错。但还有个更重要的事，我现在已经不再对你有那种感觉了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10914
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_6b3763da_1:

    # mc "It's one of the reasons, yeah. But also, I'm past feeling that way about you."
    mc "这算是其中一个原因，没错。但还有个更重要的事，我早就不再对你有那种感觉了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10916
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_6b3763da_2:

    # mc "It's one of the reasons, yeah. But also, I'm past feeling that way about you."
    mc "这算是其中一个原因，没错。但还有个更重要的事，我现在已经不想再对你抱有那种感觉了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10918
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_6b4f55d1:

    # mc "I have moved on, Zoey. And you should, too."
    mc "我早就放下了，Zoey。你也该放下了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:10920
translate schinese ep12_zoey_label_0bc7b0d3:

    # zo "But... If we both move on, can we even stay friends?"
    zo "但……如果我们都能放下，我们还能当朋友吗？"

