    sa "别太自责了。这是你第一次打斗。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12768
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f3bcdb18:

    # mc "I know, but I wanted to win... Damn... I'm so disappointed in myself."
    mc "我知道，但我真的想赢……该死……我对自己太失望了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12770
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_adea2b91:

    # js "You shouldn't be. It takes courage to do what you did."
    js "你没必要这样。你做到这些已经很勇敢了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12771
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_525edf1d:

    # js "And someone has to lose."
    js "而且总得有人输。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12773
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_8e75ed6b:

    # my "You fought against someone with more experience than you."
    my "你面对的是一个比你更有经验的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12774
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_6fececa6:

    # my "You were at a disadvantage. But next fight, you'll be even better at it!"
    my "你当时处于下风。但下一场战斗，你会变得更强！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12776
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_c3e0bb78:

    # mc "Thanks for the support... I can't accept what you're saying, but I still appreciate it."
    mc "谢谢你们的支持……我不能接受你们说的话，但还是很感激。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12779
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_dd836c0d:

    # sa "I'm so sorry, [name]..."
    sa "我真的很抱歉，[name]..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12781
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_78194566:

    # mc "It's not your fault I suck."
    mc "这不怪我烂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12783
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3f39332c:

    # sa "Don't talk about yourself like that. You didn't suck."
    sa "别这么说话，你没那么差。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12784
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d4c55769:

    # sa "You went three rounds against him. That's hardcore."
    sa "你跟他打了三轮，这很硬核。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12786
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_81a70fca:

    # my "Yeah! You did so well."
    my "嗯！你表现得真棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12788
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_85257e74:

    # mc "I ran out of energy in the third round. I wanted it, but I couldn't give more than that..."
    mc "我在第三回合就耗尽了力气。我想要赢，但已经给不出更多了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12790
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d0bce50c:

    # sa "I think you did great. You put on a great show."
    sa "我觉得你表现得不错，你演得很精彩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12791
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e44f5ef0:

    # sa "The audience loved the fight."
    sa "观众们爱死了这场战斗。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12793
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2b1679ef:

    # mc "If I had only won..."
    mc "如果我赢了就好了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12795
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fb8dcac9:

    # sa "You'll win at some point. Don't stop believing in yourself."
    sa "你终会赢的。别停止相信自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12796
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_25c113b7:

    # sa "We believe in you."
    sa "我们相信你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12798
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fa45f281:

    # mc "Thanks..."
    mc "谢谢..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12800
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_a6a4a0f7:

    # sa "I have to leave. There's this party I'm heading to later and I need to get ready for it."
    sa "我得先走了。后面还有个聚会，得赶紧准备一下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12802
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_74b22a32_1:

    # mc "A party? What party?"
    mc "派对？什么派对？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12804
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_87ba2329:

    # sa "It's a party for the faculty. Jill invited me. She's playing the piano and my brother will be there playing the cello."
    sa "这是个给教职员工的聚会。Jill邀请了我，她会弹钢琴，我哥哥也会在那里拉大提琴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12805
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_efd458cd_1:

    # sa "Basically, I wanna support Jill and mock Tybalt. That's what I'm doing tonight."
    sa "基本上，我想支持Jill，同时嘲讽Tybalt。这就是我今晚要做的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12807
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_408a882b:

    # mc "I see. Support Jill from me, too. I will stay here and watch the rest of the fights and help out afterward."
    mc "我明白了。我也支持你，Jill。我会留下来继续看剩下的打斗，之后也会帮忙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12809
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_db2ffca3_1:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}一巴掌{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12812
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ccfc4804:

    # zo "You did well, [name]."
    zo "你做得不错，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12814
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_5aef0203:

    # mc "Not good enough..."
    mc "还不够好..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12816
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e5367a7d:

    # zo "That dude was a pro. Cut yourself some slack."
    zo "那家伙真专业。别太苛责自己了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12817
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f6ede87c:

    # zo "He was boring to watch, too. He just kept blocking and dodging while you tried to land shots."
    zo "他看起来也挺无聊的，一直只会挡啊闪啊，你却一直在试图打中他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12819
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_00a5f258:

    # mc "Well, his strategy worked. I was gassed out in the third..."
    mc "好吧，他的战术奏效了。我第三回合就累趴下了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12820
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_9857198a:

    # mc "I suck."
    mc "我真烂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12822
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_a8ebd80d:

    # zo "Stop that. It doesn't mean you're a bad fighter."
    zo "别这样。这不代表你是个差劲的战士。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12823
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_575978f9:

    # zo "You'll fight again and keep improving. This was your first fight, dude."
    zo "你会继续战斗，不断进步。这可是你第一次打斗，伙计。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12825
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_687ae60f:

    # mc "Fuck... I wanted to win."
    mc "操...我真想赢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12827
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_42bf6f1c:

    # zo "I know."
    zo "我知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12832
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_752228a2:

    # nic "You were so close... I thought you had him."
    nic "你当时离赢真的只差一点……我差点以为你把他搞定了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12834
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_253b953b:

    # mc "Nah, I wasn't close. He was the better fighter."
    mc "没，我根本没接近过。他才是更厉害的那个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12836
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_09d7d83f:

    # nic "Don't put too much weight into winning or losing."
    nic "别太在意输赢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12837
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_22037fcc:

    # nic "You entertained everyone. I enjoyed the fight even though you lost."
    nic "你让所有人都看得很开心。即使你输了，那场战斗我也觉得挺有意思的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12839
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fb12d83a:

    # mc "If I don't fight to win, why do I fight at all?"
    mc "如果我不为赢而战，那我为什么要战斗呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12841
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_9a5cc236:

    # nic "Didn't you have fun? It looked like you did."
    nic "你不是玩得挺开心吗？看起来是挺享受的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12843
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_19fadd78:

    # mc "Yeah, it was fun. But I wanted to win..."
    mc "嗯，挺好玩的。但我想赢……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12845
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_925fd596:

    # nic "You're a winner in my book."
    nic "你是我的赢家。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12849
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3f6289ef:

    # le "That was so close, [name]."
    le "那太接近了，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12851
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fa40599d:

    # mc "Hey... I didn't know you guys were coming. I didn't even see you."
    mc "嘿...我都没想到你们会来，我甚至都没看到你们。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12853
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b4df0545:

    # tm "Derek told us about it, and we had to see you fight."
    tm "Derek跟我们说过，我们非得看看你打比赛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12855
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1021efe4:

    # de "Who put you up against someone with a record like that for your first fight? That's fucked up, [mc_de]."
    de "谁让你第一次打斗就对付一个有这种记录的人？这他妈真他妈的糟糕。[mc_de]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12857
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_22611f6a:

    # mc "Yeah, he was better than me."
    mc "他确实比我强。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12859
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d49c11d2:

    # le "I was still impressed."
    le "我倒是挺佩服你的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12861
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ac92cb28:

    # tm "Get some ice on that face. You should be proud."
    tm "擦点冰在脸上。你该为自己感到骄傲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12863
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ab8cea44:

    # mc "Thanks. I need to talk to some of my buddies over there. I'll catch up with you for the other fights."
    mc "谢谢。我得去那边和几个兄弟聊聊天，之后再和你碰面，继续其他比赛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12865
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fdcd6c05:

    # chao "Welcome to the club, [name]."
    chao "欢迎来到俱乐部[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12867
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_a219879a:

    # mc "Was it five consecutive matches you lost before winning one?"
    mc "你之前是不是连着输了五场才赢了一场？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12869
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_628cfa69:

    # chao "Yeah. Losing is part of the journey, [name]. You've just started it."
    chao "没错。输掉是旅程的一部分，[name]你刚刚挑起事端。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12871
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f20ab6e6:

    # mc "Yeah... I'm so sorry I missed your fight. I was busy freaking out and throwing up in the locker room."
    mc "嗯……真对不起，我错过了你的比赛。我当时在更衣室里慌得要命，还吐了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12873
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b31adc79_1:

    # chao "Haha! That's good. I usually throw up after."
    chao "哈哈！那挺好。我通常打完比赛也会吐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12875
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0365f798_1:

    # mc "Dad? You came!?"
    mc "爸？你来了？！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12877
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_c5ef325c_1:

    # dad "I know you didn't want me to, but I had to see this."
    dad "我知道你不想让我看，但我还是忍不住看了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12879
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f712801c_1:

    # mc "You're missing work for this..."
    mc "你为了这个连工作都耽误了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:12881
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d8ee7431_1:

    # dad "Don't worry about it."
    dad "别担心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12883
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d06573c4:

    # mc "I'm sorry I didn't win."
    mc "真抱歉我没赢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12885
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_024f70e2:

    # dad "I'm proud of you, son. You looked great up there."
    dad "我为你感到骄傲，儿子。你表现得真棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12896
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0f543386:

    # dwy "It happens, bro."
    dwy "这就叫人生啊，兄弟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12898
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f8aa2ab9:

    # tate "It shouldn't have happened."
    tate "这不应该发生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12900
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_9ecf9c5b:

    # dwy "You'll get him next time."
    dwy "你下次会赢的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12902
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0976abd1:

    # tate "Easy for you to say. When was the last time you lost a fight?"
    tate "说起来容易。上次你输过架是什么时候？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12907
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1207fa6e:

    # mc "Let him be. I don't think there's anything we can say right now to make him feel better."
    mc "让他去吧。现在我们说什么都别想让他好受点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12909
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3b6b8406:

    # dwy "But he fought like a champion. He just got caught. All it takes is one bad decision, and a good fight is lost."
    dwy "但他打得很像样，只是被抓住了。只要一个糟糕的决定，再好的战斗也会输掉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12911
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_482bdda8:

    # jen "Excuse me. [name] [lname]?"
    jen "打扰一下。[name] [lname]?"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12913
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_7c927b78:

    # mc "Yes?"
    mc "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12915
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3a4e8002:

    # jen "I'm Jen Byson. My job is to keep an eye out for new talent, and I'd like a word with you."
    jen "我是Jen·拜森。我的工作是留意新秀人才，我想和你谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12917
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2dc1575d:

    # dwy "My man."
    dwy "我兄弟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12919
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3d105754:

    # jen "Congratulations on your win. I found it hard to believe that it was your first fight."
    jen "恭喜你赢了。我很难相信那竟然是你第一次打架。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12921
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_8661eed6:

    # mc "Heh... Thanks! But it was."
    mc "嘿嘿...谢谢！但那是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12923
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_6b6bd112:

    # jen "Have you been practicing for long?"
    jen "你练了多久？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12925
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ac0f29b8:

    # mc "It depends on how you look at it. I'm fairly new to the club, but I've practiced fighting for many years."
    mc "这得看你怎么看。我刚加入俱乐部不久，但打斗这事儿我练了很多年。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12927
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_378ed6a5:

    # jen "It's not often I see someone with raw talent for the sport, and when I do, my interest is instantly piqued."
    jen "我很少见到对这项运动有天生天赋的人，一旦遇到，我的兴趣立刻就被勾起来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12928
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_af550397:

    # jen "I came here today to scout Johnny Stevens of the City Fighters club. Rumor had it that he showed promise for the next step of his career..."
    jen "我今天来这儿是想观察一下城战俱乐部的约翰尼·史蒂文斯。听说他有潜力迈向职业生涯的下一步……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12930
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_97e9b0f5:

    # jen "But I have to say, with the display you put up today, my eyes weren't on Johnny at all. They were on you."
    jen "但我要说，今天你表现得这么出色，我的目光根本没在约翰尼身上，全都在你身上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12931
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_cc71afd0:

    # jen "And it wasn't because Johnny didn't try to win. I could tell that he wanted the win."
    jen "而且并不是因为Johnny没努力去赢。我能看出来他真的很想赢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12932
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_079f8fbd:

    # jen "But you were confident, talented, and - most of all - entertaining to watch."
    jen "但你很自信，有天赋，而且——最重要的是——看得很过瘾。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12934
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e6e2b166:

    # mc "I'm honored... Thanks so much."
    mc "我受宠若惊……谢谢你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12936
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0ffda1f0:

    # jen "It would be highly unusual to promote someone with one fight on their record."
    jen "在战绩只有一场的情况下提拔一个人，这可真是少见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12937
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_4e1b4dc5:

    # jen "But I'm in this business because I have a talent of my own."
    jen "但我进入这个圈子，是因为我也有自己的天赋。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12938
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_93a3f1a7:

    # jen "I have a sixth sense for spotting promising athletes."
    jen "我有种第六感，能看穿有潜力的运动员。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12940
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_851c07f6:

    # jen "If you're serious about martial arts, I can sense a long-term professional career for you. And I'd like to get on that train early."
    jen "如果你真的对武术感兴趣，我能感觉到你有长期职业发展的潜力。我想早点搭上这趟顺风车。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12941
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f311f5eb:

    # jen "So, are you serious about it?"
    jen "所以，你是认真的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12943
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ed9c0313:

    # mc "I loved being in the ring today. I enjoyed every moment of it. I wanna do it again, for sure."
    mc "我今天在擂台上的感觉太棒了，每一刻都让我着迷。我肯定还想再来一次。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12944
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2327c9f2:

    # mc "But I'm in college. This is more of a hobby for me and a way to stay in shape."
    mc "但我现在在上大学，这更像是我的爱好，也是保持身材的一种方式。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12946
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2319bc91:

    # jen "That's not a problem. Most athletes need a profession while they are up and coming."
    jen "这不算问题。大多数运动员在起步阶段都需要一份正经工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12947
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e37e2523:

    # jen "It takes hard work to make it in this business, and most don't get paid enough to make it their living."
    jen "打职业这条路需要拼命努力，而且大多数人赚的钱根本不够养活自己。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12948
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_fd935ef9:

    # jen "What I can offer you is my representation, should you wish."
    jen "我能给你的，是如果你愿意的话，我可以代表你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12950
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_8a340642:

    # mc "What does that mean?"
    mc "那是什么意思？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12952
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1ba43714:

    # jen "It means I'll manage your fights and everything related to your fighting career. I'll set you up with a trainer and a dedicated club."
    jen "这意味着我会管理你的比赛，以及和你的格斗事业相关的所有事情。我会给你安排一个教练和一个专门的训练俱乐部。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12953
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1652ed7f:

    # jen "I'll sign you up for fights and take care of the details."
    jen "我会安排你参加比赛，并处理所有相关细节。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12955
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_352a4cf8:

    # jen "I'll also help you look for sponsorship deals by introducing you to sponsors."
    jen "我还会帮你找赞助商，介绍你认识一些可能愿意支持你的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12956
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_58f708f9:

    # jen "Until you get paid for fights, you'll earn income through sponsors."
    jen "直到你靠打斗拿到报酬之前，你得靠赞助商赚取收入。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12958
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1b4a37c0:

    # mc "It all sounds good, but... it also sounds expensive, and I don't have a lot of money."
    mc "听起来不错，但……这听起来也挺贵的，我手头也没多少钱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12959
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_81906e1c:

    # mc "I can't pay for a trainer or your services. I could barely afford to fight today."
    mc "我付不起教练费，也请不起你。光是参加今天的比赛，我都差点负担不起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12961
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_db3b01aa:

    # jen "I know it takes funding to get started. This is an investment on my end, and it would all be part of our agreement."
    jen "我知道开始需要资金支持，这对我来说是一笔投资，所有这些都会成为我们之间的协议一部分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12962
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_cebd6590:

    # jen "In return, my fee is 40%% of what you'd make from any fights or deals while I represent you."
    jen "作为回报，我的费用是40%%你从任何打斗或交易中能捞到什么。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12964
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_293eb61c:

    # jen "What I require from you is your commitment and dedication to the sport. And it would help if you'd put yourself out there on social media, showcasing your fights and training."
    jen "我需要的是你对这项事业的承诺和投入。如果你能在社交媒体上多露脸，展示你的比赛和训练，那就更好了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12965
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0be5c4bc:

    # jen "You need to build yourself a fan base and make a name for yourself."
    jen "你需要为自己打造一个粉丝群，树立自己的名声。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12966
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_77c4feb6:

    # jen "I will help you with that as well."
    jen "我也会帮你处理这些事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12968
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ee87e6f3:

    # mc "Oh?"
    mc "哦？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12970
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_bdd5a21d:

    # jen "We can talk numbers and details if it comes to it."
    jen "我们可以再详细谈谈具体细节和条件。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12972
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_cd20dd85:

    # jen "Here's my card. Take your time to consider my offer."
    jen "这是我的名片，你慢慢考虑我的提议。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12973
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_4f8f7958:

    # jen "If you're up for it, give me a call, and I'll put it in writing."
    jen "如果你想的话，给我打个电话，我写个正式的给你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12975
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_21fd2b4a:

    # mc "I will think about it... Thanks for this opportunity."
    mc "我会考虑一下……谢谢这个机会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12977
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_5dc8a2ce:

    # jen "I'm sure it sounds intimidating to you right now, but don't worry. We could accomplish something great together."
    jen "这听起来现在可能有点吓人，但别担心。我们能一起做成大事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12978
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3489e24c:

    # jen "If your fighting today is the standard of intensity and entertainment you'd bring to the sport, you will make it far."
    jen "如果你今天打比赛的强度和娱乐性就是你对这项运动的全部，那你一定会走得很远。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12980
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_f7f28f31:

    # jen "Again, congratulations on your win. You were spectacular."
    jen "再次恭喜你赢得比赛，你表现得非常出色。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12984
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_cc79cb0e:

    # dwy "Bro... What the hell? That was the scout! What did she say?"
    dwy "兄弟……搞什么？那可是星探！她跟你说了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12986
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_67dbf888:

    # mc "She offered me her representation."
    mc "她给了我她的经纪合同。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12988
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ee6d625d:

    # dwy "Did she miss me? I was standing right next to you."
    dwy "她没看到我？我可是一直站在你旁边啊。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12990
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3dd2eb1a:

    # mc "She said she was scouting Johnny, but that I stole the show."
    mc "她说是来观察约翰尼的，但说我是全场最抢眼的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12992
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ed279c0b:

    # dwy "She noticed you during your first fight. Do you have any clue how lucky you are?"
    dwy "她第一次打斗时就注意到你了。你有意识到自己有多幸运吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12993
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_12d270b6:

    # dwy "We've been scrapping for years and never got scouted."
    dwy "我们打了这么多年架，从来没被选中过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12995
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_998fc42e:

    # chao "Someone got scouted?"
    chao "有人被招募了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12997
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_4c90ffa3:

    # dwy "[name] got scouted!"
    dwy "[name]被招募了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:12999
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1b29f837:

    # chao "Congrats... Man, I'm jealous."
    chao "恭喜啊……我真羡慕你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13001
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ddd9f059:

    # mc "Relax... I haven't signed a deal or something. It was just an offer."
    mc "放松点...我还没签合同什么的，只是个提议。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13003
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_999b9306:

    # chao "What was the offer?"
    chao "她开了什么条件？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13005
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_7eb78d4b:

    # mc "She said she could set me up with a trainer and club and manage my fighting career."
    mc "她说她能帮我安排一个教练和俱乐部，管理我的搏击生涯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13006
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1bd07833:

    # mc "She'd help me find sponsors and make a name for myself on social media and such."
    mc "她会帮我找赞助商，帮我在网上打造名气，搞些名堂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13007
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_477d89eb:

    # mc "But she wants 40%% of the money I make as a fighter. That's a lot, isn't it?"
    mc "但她想要40%%我作为斗士赚的钱。那可不少，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13009
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b0ffada5:

    # dwy "That's what those agencies do. They discover talent and profit from them."
    dwy "这就是那些经纪公司干的事。他们发掘人才，然后从中牟利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13010
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_9f6fe62a:

    # dwy "Sure, you could say they are predatory by doing that. 40%% is a high price to pay for not doing the dirty work..."
    dwy "当然，你可以说他们这么做是捕食性的。40%%这是付出的代价太高了，为了不做脏活..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13012
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_43a4669d:

    # dwy "But bro... Without a manager, it will take a hell of a lot more luck to get somewhere. These people know the business better than anybody."
    dwy "但兄弟……没有经纪人的话，你得靠运气才能走到那一步，而且得靠很多运气。这些人比谁都懂这行当。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13014
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2f8f56a8:

    # chao "I'm with Dwyane. This is a great opportunity for you. She must be sitting on all kinds of contacts."
    chao "我跟Dwyane在一块儿。这对你来说是个好机会，她肯定有不少人脉资源。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13015
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_cc509c62:

    # chao "Make sure that you can exit the deal scot-free somehow."
    chao "确保你有办法干净利落地退出这个交易。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13016
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_4c4f0c4d:

    # chao "If you make it, you won't need her anymore."
    chao "如果你能行，就不用再靠她了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13018
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b98f7416:

    # mc "I'm not gonna make it, guys. I've had one fight."
    mc "我撑不下去了，伙计们。我只打过一场。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13019
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_7ebcda11:

    # mc "And now it's a lot of pressure being put on my shoulders."
    mc "现在压力全压在我身上了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13020
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_63a0ec91:

    # mc "I'm not sure if I should do this... Maybe I'll keep fighting for fun, and that's it."
    mc "我不确定该不该这么做……也许我继续打下去只是为了好玩，然后就结束了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13022
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_5d86e553:

    # dwy "I can't believe what I'm hearing..."
    dwy "我真不敢相信我刚听到什么……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13023
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_424eef6f:

    # dwy "Don't throw away this opportunity... She's right about you."
    dwy "别放弃这个机会……她是对的，你确实有这个能力。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13025
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_d3ea6a07:

    # dwy "I was in your corner the entire fight, yeah?"
    dwy "我整个比赛都在你身边，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13026
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_c89e9720:

    # dwy "All I could think about when I saw you fight was how shitty the other guy must feel going up against you."
    dwy "我一看到你打比赛，脑子里就想着那个家伙肯定他妈的恨死自己了，跟个傻逼一样去挑战你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13028
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_4bfb6ce8:

    # dwy "The dude had a flawless record, but in his eighth fight, he was dominated by a newcomer."
    dwy "那个家伙以前战绩全胜，但第八次比赛被一个新人给压制了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13029
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_69837ff5:

    # dwy "And he put up a hell of a fight, too."
    dwy "他也是拼了老命在拼。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13031
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3f936d6a:

    # mc "Man... I don't know..."
    mc "男人... 我真不知道该说什么了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13033
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_eec0e877:

    # dwy "Can you at least think about it?"
    dwy "你至少得考虑一下吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13034
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_62c26bcf:

    # dwy "I'm not one for begging. But if you feel like you owe me something, this is it."
    dwy "我不是那种会乞求的人。但如果你觉得你欠我什么，那现在就是了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13036
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_eac82d14:

    # mc "Oh, I will think about it. I'm sure it will keep me up at night."
    mc "哦，我会好好想想的。这事儿肯定让我睡不着觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13042
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e64f9a33:

    # mc "Just let us feel like shit."
    mc "就让我们感觉一下什么叫糟透了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13044
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_12f748a9:

    # dwy "Learning how to take a loss is part of the sport."
    dwy "学会如何接受失败是这项运动的一部分。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13046
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_6a0fa7df:

    # mc "Yeah, but this soon after the loss... It hurts even more."
    mc "而且这还发生在输球之后……痛得更厉害了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13050
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_8104ec6e:

    # tate "Thanks, [name]."
    tate "谢谢[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13051
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_37737cc2:

    # tate "How are you feeling?"
    tate "你感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13053
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_e4afb8fd:

    # mc "Probably the same as you."
    mc "大概和你一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13055
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_91e68fb1:

    # tate "Yeah? I'm going over the fight in my head... Over and over."
    tate "嗯？我一直在脑子里回放那场打斗……一遍又一遍。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13056
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_87b169a6:

    # tate "I dodged into his fist... Why did I choose to go right instead of left?"
    tate "我闪开了他的拳头……我为什么选了右边而不是左边？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13058
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_6452f016:

    # mc "You made a guess. It was wrong, and you got punished for it."
    mc "你做了个猜测。猜错了，还被惩罚了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13060
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_39d5163e:

    # tate "Yeah... I suppose."
    tate "嗯……我这么想吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13062
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_63de2d8b:

    # mc "I'd take a bad guess over not being in good enough shape."
    mc "我宁愿猜错，也不愿状态不够好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13064
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_50ee99ee:

    # tate "It's not about you being in bad shape, because you're not."
    tate "这不关你身体状态的事，你根本就没差。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13065
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_45134add:

    # tate "You didn't conserve the energy when you needed to."
    tate "你当时该省的力没省。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13067
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b7dbb8e8:

    # tate "I saw it... You ended up playing his game, not yours."
    tate "我看到了……你最后是按他的节奏在打，不是按你的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13069
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你是什么意思？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13071
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_5e64b629:

    # tate "Every time you threw a punch, he backed away, and you kept chasing."
    tate "每次你出拳，他都往后退，你却一直追着打。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13072
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_532c605e:

    # tate "He didn't lose as much energy from that as you did, throwing all those punches."
    tate "他没像你这样消耗那么多能量，你扔了那么多拳头。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13074
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_892dc501:

    # mc "Well, what should I have done? Waited for him to attack me?"
    mc "那我该怎么办？等着他来攻击我？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13076
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_1976823b:

    # tate "You could have waited for him to take a step forward before you went at him again - small things like that."
    tate "你完全可以等他先往前走一步，再冲上去——这种小细节你都没注意到。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13078
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_01db0b7c:

    # mc "I wanted it too much..."
    mc "我太想要了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13080
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_3924ec33:

    # tate "You fought against someone with more experience than you."
    tate "你面对的是一个比你更有经验的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13081
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_365e93d9:

    # tate "If you're not scared of catching a punch, you can keep your calm in the ring and develop a strategy."
    tate "如果你不怕挨拳，那你就能在擂台上保持冷静，制定策略。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13083
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_2dacde31:

    # tate "You'll win at some point. It might not be your next fight, or the one after that, but you're a good fighter."
    tate "你总有一天会赢的。可能不是下一场比赛，或者再下一場，但你是个不错的战士。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13084
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_ac7fae01:

    # tate "I'm not just saying that."
    tate "我不是这么说的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13086
translate schinese ep12_fcomp_round3_end_label_0e554226:

    # mc "Thanks, Tate."
    mc "谢谢你，Tate。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13107
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_d4b12112:

    # de "This party blows."
    de "这个派对真烂。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13109
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_29107dcb:

    # mc "I told you there would be mostly faculty and non-students."
    mc "我之前就说了，这里 基本上 都是老师和非学生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13110
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_4e0a929c:

    # mc "Why did you insist on coming?"
    mc "你为什么非得来？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13112
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_cf50cf4b:

    # de "What do you mean by \"Why\"? I wanna hear you play."
    de "你问‘为什么’是什么意思？我想听你演奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13113
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e840d9cb:

    # de "And also, it's a party. I'm not passing up on a party if I'm invited."
    de "再说这可是派对。只要有人邀请，我就不会错过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13115
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c68ee7c1:

    # mc "But you weren't invited. You tagged along anyway."
    mc "但你根本没被邀请，你硬跟着来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13117
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e3004b1f:

    # de "Semantics."
    de "语义。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13118
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_24a52f6c:

    # de "When do you get the show going?"
    de "什么时候开始表演？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13120
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_bc80d83b:

    # mc "It will be a while. Right now, there's a flutist playing."
    mc "还要等一会儿。现在有个吹长笛的在表演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13121
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_7414c592:

    # mc "Then there's some dude named Muriel playing the trumpet."
    mc "然后还有个叫Muriel的家伙吹小号。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13123
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e004e024:

    # de "Muriel? What the hell kinda name is Muriel?"
    de "Muriel？这算什么鬼名字？Muriel？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13125
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6d2c73b4:

    # mc "Haha, I know. It's odd. I think it was Muriel Storch."
    mc "哈哈，我知道，很奇怪。我记得他叫Muriel·斯托奇。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13127
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6fff9195:

    # de "Man, that dude's parents must have hated him. Sheesh. Who names a kid that?"
    de "这哥们儿的爸妈肯定恨死他了。啧。谁给起这么个名字啊？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13129
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_27901935:

    # mc "After him, there will be a speech by a professor, I think."
    mc "在他之后，应该会有一个教授的演讲，我想。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13130
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_8cf7b747:

    # mc "After that, Jill will play. Then I will play."
    mc "之后，Jill会演奏。然后轮到我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13132
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b8181654:

    # de "Sounds like a long night..."
    de "听起来是个漫长的夜晚..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13134
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f4aed49a:

    # mc "If you stick around after that, Tybalt will play too."
    mc "如果你待会儿还留在那儿，Tybalt 也会演奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13136
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_5aa86367:

    # de "Huh? What does he play?"
    de "咦？他弹什么乐器？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13138
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_27eef9d6:

    # mc "The cello, apparently. And it says on the program that he even brought a band. Can you believe that?"
    mc "大提琴，看来。而且节目单上还写着他甚至带了一整个乐队。你信不信？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13140
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_fb0dc6a3:

    # de "Ugh! I'm not sticking around to watch that. Let's bounce after you're done."
    de "啧！我可不想留下来看那个。你玩完咱们就走吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13142
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_20bf1381:

    # mc "You don't have to stay after, but I will. I get paid to be here."
    mc "你不用留下来，但我得留。我这是拿钱来这儿的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13144
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_78e4bb78:

    # de "Are you paid to party? Are you stripping for the guests or something?"
    de "你是拿钱来参加派对的？还是要给宾客跳脱衣舞之类的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13146
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_310eb256:

    # mc "They pay me to play the guitar."
    mc "他们付钱让我弹吉他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13148
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_cf72a8e4:

    # de "How much are they paying you?"
    de "他们给你多少钱？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13150
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c9a0738a:

    # mc "$100 and a free meal."
    mc "一百美元和一顿免费餐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13152
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b79e8e53:

    # de "What? Isn't the meal free?"
    de "什么？餐费不是免费的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13154
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_323848c2:

    # mc "But Professor Hoff said the real reward is to network with the guests."
    mc "但霍夫教授说真正的报酬是和客人建立人脉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13155
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_59b062a8:

    # mc "There are some esteemed ones at the party."
    mc "有些家伙可不简单。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13157
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6d514495:

    # de "Meh. And say what? I bet we have nothing in common with them."
    de "随便啦。说啥啊？我打赌我们跟他们根本没什么共同话题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13159
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_9f9bfeff:

    # mc "Well, we gotta do something while we wait."
    mc "那我们总得做点什么打发时间吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13161
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_00d2b745:

    # de "Go ahead and mingle with them if you want. I'm gonna get myself a free meal too."
    de "你要是想就去和他们混吧。我嘛，先去蹭个免费餐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13166
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_edc0be70:

    # ty "Haha, can you believe he got in dressed like that?"
    ty "哈哈，他居然这么穿就进去了，你信吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13173
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_635771f8:

    # ji "Guess who?"
    ji "猜到谁了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13177
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_fc9bd57f:

    # mc "Jill?"
    mc "Jill？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13179
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_88a157f5:

    # ji "Haha, you guessed it."
    ji "哈哈，你猜对了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13181
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f32cbfea:

    # mc "Professor Hoff?"
    mc "霍夫教授？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13183
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e486d136:

    # ji "No. It's me."
    ji "不是。是我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13185
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_44bd723d:

    # mc "Oh, good! That would have been creepy."
    mc "哦，太好了！那可就有点吓人了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13187
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c3ae8615:

    # ji "Hahaha!"
    ji "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13190
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_fb7ccde7:

    # ji "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}打耳光{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13192
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_3a1d639d:

    # ji "Are you ok?"
    ji "你没事吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13194
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_4a8afc62:

    # mc "Uh... Big night. How about you?"
    mc "嗯……今晚挺忙的。你呢？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13197
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_fb7ccde7_1:

    # ji "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}打耳光{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13199
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b92136d0:

    # mc "Wow. You look lovely."
    mc "哇，你今天真漂亮。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13201
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b376783e:

    # ji "Aw, thank you. As do you."
    ji "哎呀，谢谢。你也是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13203
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_27d89662:

    # mc "You think? I feel like I don't fit in among all the suits and fancy dresses."
    mc "你觉得吗？我感觉我跟那些西装革履、穿晚礼服的人完全不搭。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13205
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_61332c90:

    # ji "You're perfect the way you are."
    ji "你这样就已经完美了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13207
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_179bf0d9:

    # mc "How are you feeling? It's a big night."
    mc "你感觉怎么样？今晚可不简单。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13209
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6172ca0d:

    # ji "It is. I'm doing great. I'm looking forward to playing tonight."
    ji "是啊，我状态很好。我今晚就准备上台表演呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13211
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_bbf1e57e:

    # ji "Look at the stage. It's not that intimidating."
    ji "看看那个舞台。它没那么吓人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13212
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_83268ee6:

    # ji "In fact, it's not even a stage. It's a space with instruments."
    ji "其实连个舞台都算不上，就是一个摆着乐器的地方。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13214
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b8a0f281:

    # ji "And everyone here won't pay attention to us. They will mingle and talk while we play."
    ji "而且这里的人也不会注意我们。他们会到处走动聊天，而我们只需要专注演奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13215
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6b310546:

    # ji "It's nothing like the auditorium."
    ji "这跟礼堂可不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13216
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_bfc93311:

    # ji "That thought calms my nerves."
    ji "那个念头让我平静下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13218
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_cd10ca6e:

    # ji "I'm happy I get to do this with you... Again. Haha!"
    ji "我很高兴能和你一起做这件事……再次。哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13220
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_ebdb7d79:

    # sa "Don't mind me. Third wheel checking in."
    sa "别管我。第三轮登场了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13222
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_5dbae208:

    # mc "Hey, Sage. What are you doing here?"
    mc "嘿，Sage，你在这儿干嘛？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13225
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b5f83fb0:

    # sa "Somebody call security. There's a party crasher here."
    sa "有人叫保安，这儿来了个闯入者。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13226
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e5240367:

    # ji "Haha."
    ji "哈哈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13228
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_42b5bce5:

    # mc "Sage? Jill?"
    mc "Sage？Jill？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13230
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_8195124a:

    # ji "Hi, [name]."
    ji "你好，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13232
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_43852931:

    # mc "You look...wow."
    mc "你看起来……哇。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13234
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_70c80fe9:

    # sa "Yep. We both do."
    sa "当然。我们两个都这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13236
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_abd30fc1:

    # mc "For sure."
    mc "当然。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13237
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f58477a0:

    # mc "I know why Jill is here, but why are you?"
    mc "我知道Jill为什么在这里，但你为什么会来？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13239
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_38a8c02f:

    # sa "Didn't Jill tell you? I'm the closing act."
    sa "Jill没告诉你吗？我是压轴节目。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13241
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c5fa36f2:

    # mc "The closing act?"
    mc "闭幕表演？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13243
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_2d30c936:

    # sa "Yeah, I'm gonna juggle."
    sa "嗯，我打算来个杂耍。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13245
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_58382dda:

    # mc "Juggle?"
    mc "杂耍？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13247
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c3ae8615_1:

    # ji "Hahaha!"
    ji "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13248
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_a0d7a92d:

    # sa "Gullible much?"
    sa "傻乎乎的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13249
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_ea176fae:

    # sa "Jill invited me. I want to watch you perform."
    sa "Jill邀请了我，我想看看你表演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13251
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_57075781:

    # sa "Thanks for not inviting me, by the way."
    sa "顺便谢谢你没邀请我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13253
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_5c3cea90:

    # mc "I didn't realize we could invite people."
    mc "我没意识到我们还能邀请别人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13255
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_ed95727a:

    # sa "Yeah? Isn't that Derek over there stuffing his face with food?"
    sa "是吗？那边那个吃得满嘴都是的，不就是Derek吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13257
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_78246aa3:

    # mc "Derek invited himself."
    mc "Derek自己跟来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13258
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b360f32b:

    # mc "Besides, it's not our kind of party."
    mc "况且，这又不是我们那一路的派对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13260
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_875d88bf:

    # sa "It does reek of an adult party, at which we will sit at the kids' table."
    sa "这确实像个成人聚会，我们得坐在孩子们的桌旁。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13262
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_553ad249:

    # mc "At least the kids' table has Champagne."
    mc "至少孩子们的桌子有香槟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13264
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_7dcc0283:

    # sa "But no glasses... I doubt there will be a body shot competition."
    sa "但也没见酒杯……我猜大概不会有谁比谁灌得更狠的比赛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13266
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_4bbc9539:

    # mc "If there is, I call dibs on you two."
    mc "如果有的话，我先占了你们俩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13268
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_be55fa0f:

    # ji "[name]... Our parents are here. Mine are at the next table."
    ji "[name]我们的父母在这里。我的在下一张桌子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13270
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6a983c66:

    # mc "I'm not doing body shots with them."
    mc "我没打算和她们玩身体酒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13273
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_8e171b59:

    # mc "(Why is Sage here? Jill must have invited her...)"
    mc "（Sage怎么在这儿？Jill一定是请了她……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13279
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_a1d9bb24:

    # mc "(They've gotten close... I can't blame them for not wanting to talk to me.)"
    mc "（他们已经靠得很近了……我不能怪他们不想跟我说话。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13281
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_56d1f832:

    # mc "(But fuck... It hurts being ignored by them.)"
    mc "（但操...被他们无视的感觉真他妈难受。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13284
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_25de4972:

    # mc "(It seems like the news about Zoey has reached them...)"
    mc "（看来关于Zoey的消息已经传到他们耳朵里了...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13286
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_074b2c8f:

    # mc "(Fuck... Not that long ago, we were close friends, and now they're ignoring me...)"
    mc "（操... 不久前我们还是无话不谈的好朋友，现在他们却连我都不理了...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13288
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e98f60b9:

    # mc "(I can't blame them for siding with Josy and Maya...)"
    mc "（我不能怪他们站到Josy和Maya那边。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13289
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_1eb98792:

    # mc "(Even I blame myself for hurting them.)"
    mc "（就连我也会责怪自己伤到了他们。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13291
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_05070089:

    # mc "(I can't blame them for siding with Bella...)"
    mc "（我不能怪他们站到贝拉那边...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13292
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f391a5d1:

    # mc "(Even I blame myself for hurting her.)"
    mc "（就连我都在责怪自己伤了她。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13296
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_09b7808c:

    # mc "(They both hate me now...)"
    mc "（他们现在都恨我了...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13298
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_82987f78:

    # mc "(We used to be so close, and now they're ignoring me.)"
    mc "（我们曾经那么亲密，现在却连理都不理我了。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13302
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_3afa77c8:

    # mc "(They've gotten close...)"
    mc "（他们关系越来越近了...）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13303
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_67398aeb:

    # mc "(Jill is supporting Sage after our breakup.)"
    mc "（Jill现在在支持Sage，自从我们分手之后。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13305
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_8e93ba69:

    # mc "(I wish she were here for me, too, but at least she's helping Sage get through it.)"
    mc "（我希望她也能在我身边，但至少她帮着Sage度过这段日子。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13306
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_7cc08c9e:

    # mc "(It hurts to be ignored...)"
    mc "（被人无视的感觉真难受……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13310
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f04ba037:

    # mc "(Sage must have told Jill what I did...)"
    mc "(Sage肯定告诉Jill我做了什么...)"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13313
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_46b39364:

    # mc "(I have a feeling Bella told them what I did...)"
    mc "（我有种预感，贝拉告诉他们我做了什么……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13315
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_9acb96ac:

    # mc "(We used to be so close and now they're ignoring me.)"
    mc "（我们曾经那么亲密，现在却连理都不理我。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13318
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_be14d68a:

    # sa "Look who we have here."
    sa "看谁来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13320
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_a393fb96:

    # mc "Jill! Sage? Why are you here?"
    mc "Jill！Sage？你们怎么会在这里？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13322
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_d50b4bef:

    # sa "You don't sound happy to see me."
    sa "你看起来不太高兴见到我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13324
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_c0e58fbe:

    # mc "I meant, {b}why{/b} are you here? Why did you choose to come to this party?"
    mc "我是说，{b}为什么{/b}你在这儿吗？为什么选择来参加这个派对？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13326
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_ea176fae_1:

    # sa "Jill invited me. I want to watch you perform."
    sa "Jill邀请了我，我想看看你表演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13327
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_57075781_1:

    # sa "Thanks for not inviting me, by the way."
    sa "顺便谢谢你没邀请我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13329
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_5c3cea90_1:

    # mc "I didn't realize we could invite people."
    mc "我没意识到我们还能邀请别人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13331
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_ed95727a_1:

    # sa "Yeah? Isn't that Derek over there stuffing his face with food?"
    sa "嗯? 不是还有Derek在那边大吃大喝吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13333
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_78246aa3_1:

    # mc "Derek invited himself."
    mc "Derek自己来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13334
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b360f32b_1:

    # mc "Besides, it's not our kind of party."
    mc "况且，这又不是我们那一路的派对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13336
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_875d88bf_1:

    # sa "It does reek of an adult party, at which we will sit at the kids' table."
    sa "这派对一看就很成人，我们大概只能坐小孩那桌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13338
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_98027ee8:

    # mc "Is that because your parents are here?"
    mc "是因为你爸妈在这儿吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13340
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_f57985b2:

    # sa "Kinda. At least they are keeping their distance from each other."
    sa "有点。至少他们之间还保持着距离。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13341
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_381dc7c2:

    # sa "It's scary how important appearances are to them."
    sa "他们对表象的执着真是让人害怕。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13343
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_e7718748:

    # mc "So, Jill... How are you feeling about performing?"
    mc "所以，Jill... 你感觉怎么样？要上台表演了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13345
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_d7986cfc:

    # ji "I'm feeling good. I'm looking forward to playing tonight."
    ji "我感觉不错，今晚演出我挺期待的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13347
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_bbf1e57e_1:

    # ji "Look at the stage. It's not that intimidating."
    ji "看看那个舞台。一点都不吓人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13348
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_83268ee6_1:

    # ji "In fact, it's not even a stage. It's a space with instruments."
    ji "其实连个舞台都算不上，就是一个摆着乐器的地方。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13350
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_b8a0f281_1:

    # ji "And everyone here won't pay attention to us. They will mingle and talk while we play."
    ji "而且这里的人根本不会注意我们。他们会一边聊天一边打闹，我们表演的时候他们根本不会在意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13351
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_6b310546_1:

    # ji "It's nothing like the auditorium."
    ji "这跟礼堂可不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13352
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_bfc93311_1:

    # ji "That thought calms my nerves."
    ji "那个念头让我平静下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13354
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_61cb0cc0:

    # sa "You'll both do fine."
    sa "你们俩都会表现得很棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13355
translate schinese ep12_fparty_label_88ad6603:

    # sa "Did you see any booze we could yoink? This party could use some."
    sa "你看到能顺走的酒了吗？这派对缺点儿气氛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13364
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_01f80f8d:

    # sb "Bella. You came."
    sb "贝拉。你来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13366
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_9393b82c:

    # isa "Were you under the assumption that I wouldn't come?"
    isa "你是不是以为我不会来？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13368
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_4fd5caa9:

    # sb "You never know with these events. Sometimes Christmas plans interfere."
    sb "你永远不知道这些聚会会怎么样。有时候圣诞计划会搞砸一切。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13369
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_ee6a393c:

    # sb "How was your Christmas? A big family gathering?"
    sb "你圣诞节过得怎么样？是跟家人一起过的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13371
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_04f9dc5f:

    # isa "I celebrated it with friends."
    isa "我跟朋友一起过的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13373
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_d92ba9c0:

    # sb "Mine wasn't with family either. It was lonely."
    sb "我的也没和家人一起，也是一个人过的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13374
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_fca0f2b5:

    # sb "I'm not sure if you heard the news..."
    sb "我不确定你有没有听说这个消息……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13376
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_0c67c327:

    # sb "Jade and I have separated."
    sb "我和Jade已经分开了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13378
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_339a9a00:

    # isa "I'm sorry to hear that."
    isa "很遗憾听到这个消息。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13380
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_2110027a:

    # sb "I couldn't help but notice that you're not wearing your wedding band either."
    sb "我注意到你也没戴婚戒啊。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13382
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_8cfd6f3c:

    # sb "I don't want to appear nosey, but... Is everything ok at home?"
    sb "我不想知道太多，但……你家里一切还好吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13384
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_581dab4d:

    # isa "Everything is fine, thanks."
    isa "一切安好，谢谢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13386
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_9e7b87b7:

    # sb "No ring... Celebrating Christmas with friends..."
    sb "没戒指……和朋友一起过了圣诞节……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13387
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_7a7cd6fb:

    # sb "If you need to talk to someone about it, I'm always available."
    sb "如果你需要有人聊聊，我随时都在。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13389
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_19823feb:

    # isa "I celebrated Christmas with friends because that's what I wanted."
    isa "我跟朋友们一起过了圣诞节，因为那才是我想过的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13390
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_f4359726:

    # isa "We had a wonderful Christmas together, and just because I'm not wearing a ring doesn't give you an invitation to pry."
    isa "我们一起过了个很棒的圣诞节，而且我手上没戴戒指，不代表你就有权打探我的私事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13397
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_3cea6a80:

    # de "How hard can it be to play the trumpet? It has three buttons."
    de "吹小号有多难？它只有三个按键。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13399
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_8404b348:

    # mu "*{i}Snorts{/i}* It has three {b}valves{/b}. And despite that, it's a hard instrument to master."
    mu "*{i}嗤笑{/i}*它有三个{b}阀门{/b}尽管如此，这还是很难掌握的乐器。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13401
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_c8445485:

    # de "I bet I could play it. Can I try it?"
    de "我敢打赌我肯定能吹。让我试试看？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13403
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_cd47e9fb:

    # mu "Do not touch my trumpet, or any of the brass instruments lying around."
    mu "别碰我的小号，还有其他所有铜管乐器。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13405
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_2aa1ee92:

    # de "Come on. Let me hold it for a minute."
    de "行啊，让我拿一会儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13407
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_8fbd3e2b:

    # mu "This trumpet costs $3000. Could you imagine if I let some slob with greasy pork fingers touch my beloved?"
    mu "这把小号价值三千美元。你能想象如果让某个手指油腻、满手猪油的浑蛋碰了我心爱的宝贝吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13409
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_135129bf:

    # de "Your beloved? Really?"
    de "你那宝贝？真有你的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13411
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_9d985d10:

    # mu "Begone! I must focus on my upcoming solo."
    mu "滚开！我得专心准备我的独奏了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13413
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_d59f54f2:

    # ph "Muriel! I've been looking for you."
    ph "Muriel！我一直在找你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13415
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_154ea981:

    # mu "Is it time for my solo already?"
    mu "是不是该轮到我独奏了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13417
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_8c06f511:

    # ph "No, not yet. You have ample time. But I conversed with Mr. Langley about you earlier."
    ph "不，还没到。你有充足的时间。不过我之前已经和兰利先生聊过你了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13419
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_1af3b1b6:

    # mu "Mr. Langley? Are you joshing me?"
    mu "兰利先生？你是在开玩笑吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13421
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_fb112a2d:

    # ph "No. He was keen on talking to you."
    ph "不，他很想和你谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13422
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_146b673d:

    # ph "I mentioned that you and I have fought many battles on the checkered board together. And as it turns out, he's a chess player too."
    ph "我提到了我们曾在棋盘上打过很多次交道。结果发现，他也是个下棋的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13424
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty_label_a73a7c70:

    # mu "Can you introduce me? I'd love to pick his brain about his recent paper on neural networks."
    mu "你能介绍一下他吗？我很想跟他聊聊他最近关于神经网络的论文。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13435
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_eed88e05:

    # isa "Excuse me..."
    isa "不好意思..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13437
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_d6d1ae02:

    # isa "I am so happy you're here tonight."
    isa "我真高兴你今晚能来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13439
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_0d0108df:

    # ji "Why? Are you not feeling the Christmas party?"
    ji "为什么？你不想参加圣诞派对吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13441
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_936185dd:

    # isa "I don't feel like explaining why I don't have a ring on my finger to Professor Burke."
    isa "我不打算解释为什么我手指上没戴戒指给Professor Burke听。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13442
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_bcf772b8:

    # isa "He's getting more blatant."
    isa "他越来越明目张胆了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13444
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_27396999:

    # sa "What did my dad say?"
    sa "我爸爸说了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13446
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_a22b9620:

    # isa "Oh... I..."
    isa "哦……我……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13448
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_c614be01:

    # sa "What?"
    sa "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13450
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13452
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_4ae7ed22:

    # sa "What did he do?"
    sa "他干了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13454
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_8447f880:

    # isa "He hasn't done anything. But..."
    isa "他没干什么。但..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13455
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_e3ddb9f8:

    # isa "He flirts with me."
    isa "他对我搭讪。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13457
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_d0781b80:

    # sa "He flirts with you?"
    sa "他对你有意思？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13459
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_b407bf4d:

    # isa "You shouldn't have to hear this about your father."
    isa "你没必要听他这种事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13461
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_a513a996:

    # sa "How long has he flirted with you?"
    sa "他跟你调情多久了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13463
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_bd354d4a:

    # isa "Eh..."
    isa "嗯……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13465
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_8315c691:

    # sa "You said he was getting more blatant."
    sa "你说他越来越明显了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13466
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_f193d108:

    # sa "Bella?"
    sa "贝拉？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13468
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_fcfa959e:

    # isa "It's been going on for a while. He used to be subtle about it, but not so much lately."
    isa "这事儿已经持续有一段时间了。他以前还比较含蓄，但最近可就没那么客气了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13469
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_84ce47d2:

    # isa "I'm sorry."
    isa "对不起。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13471
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_85b16744:

    # sa "He's not with Mom anymore, and I know they've had issues for a long time, but yeah, it's not something nice to hear."
    sa "他现在不跟妈妈在一起了，我知道他们之间一直有些问题，但说实话，听到这些真的很让人不舒服。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13472
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_372be2d3:

    # sa "You don't have to feel sorry. You haven't done anything wrong."
    sa "你不用觉得抱歉。你没做错什么。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13474
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_9c71026b:

    # sa "I'm sorry he's hitting on you. I'll talk to him if you want."
    sa "对不起他对你有意思。如果你想的话，我可以跟他谈谈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13476
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_a37bd06b:

    # isa "No. Don't do that. I'd be embarrassed."
    isa "不，别这样。我会很尴尬的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13479
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_9020180c:

    # sa "I'm embarrassed, too. By both my parents..."
    sa "我也觉得丢脸。我爸妈两个都..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13481
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_4ed4eb96:

    # sa "I'm embarrassed, too."
    sa "我也觉得丢脸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13483
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_f4d8e1e2:

    # isa "Is your mom here tonight?"
    isa "你妈今晚在这儿吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13486
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_7fca8843:

    # sa "Yes, but I'm ignoring her. She's doing her best to save face from the divorce."
    sa "是的，但我现在故意不搭理她。她正努力在离婚后维持体面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13488
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_c4d6eb5e:

    # ji "Have you talked to her again?"
    ji "你有再跟她说话吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13490
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_2a977abb:

    # sa "We tried to get together for Christmas, but we realized it was pointless to celebrate anything this year."
    sa "我们本来打算圣诞节聚一聚，但后来觉得今年什么都庆祝不了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13492
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_3bd256fe:

    # isa "What did you end up doing?"
    isa "你最后都干了啥？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13494
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_72919670:

    # sa "Pretty much nothing. But I'm fine with it."
    sa "基本上什么都没做。但我觉得这样也挺好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13496
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_8a2e6f69:

    # sa "Yes. She's doing her best to save face from the divorce."
    sa "是的。她正尽力在离婚后维持体面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13498
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_401a3b75:

    # ji "How was your Christmas together with her?"
    ji "你和她一起过圣诞怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13500
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_671ea4b9:

    # sa "We had dinner, but it wasn't merry."
    sa "我们吃了晚饭，但一点都不开心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13502
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_336412f3:

    # sa "At least I got to celebrate Christmas with you guys."
    sa "至少我还和你们一起过了个圣诞节。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13507
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_22f7b9a0:

    # isa "Is [name] around here somewhere? I wanted to wish him good luck."
    isa "是[name]在这附近某个地方？我想祝他好运。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13509
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_b1385220:

    # ji "He needed to visit the restroom."
    ji "他得去趟洗手间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13510
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_8d9b279c:

    # ji "Also, you shouldn't wish him good luck - that's inviting bad luck. You should tell him to break a leg."
    ji "另外，你别祝他好运——那会招来厄运。你应该让他去破腿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13512
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_888bdafd:

    # isa "Yes, of course."
    isa "当然，没问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13513
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_adc3b405:

    # isa "And I want you to break a leg too."
    isa "你也得破个腿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13515
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_3c7c3e2c:

    # ji "Haha, I'll try."
    ji "哈哈，我试试看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13518
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_d754237a:

    # de "[name]. Come here."
    de "[name]过来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13520
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_1fb84e72:

    # mc "What now?"
    mc "现在怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13522
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_6d974b73:

    # de "Check out Muriel. He's about to perform."
    de "快看Muriel，他马上要表演了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13524
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_74e25987:

    # mc "Since when are you into brass music?"
    mc "你什么时候开始对铜管乐感兴趣的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13526
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_4d6f167b:

    # de "I have a feeling I will love it."
    de "我觉得这玩意儿肯定超棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13528
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_9eb8dc59:

    # mc "That's nice, I guess."
    mc "这倒是个好消息，我猜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13530
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_66508238:

    # de "And not only because I did unspeakable things to his beloved."
    de "而且不只是因为我对他心爱的号角做了不可告人的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13532
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13534
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_44f3d029:

    # de "I stuck his trumpet up my butthole."
    de "我把他的小号塞进我屁眼里了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13536
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13538
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_101edaba:

    # mc "Y-you... What?"
    mc "你... 什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13540
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_fcb48efc:

    # de "He told me I had greasy pork fingers."
    de "他跟我说我有油腻的猪肉手指。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13542
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_9592c298:

    # mc "And your instincts told you to do that to him?"
    mc "你本能地想对他这么做？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13545
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_c68a453f:

    # "{i}Vrmmmp bvaroomf!{/i}"
    "{i}咕噜咕噜！{/i}"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13547
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_a2b13309:

    # de "HAHAHA!"
    de "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13549
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_1f75cff5:

    # mu "Oh, dear God!!! What is this!?"
    mu "哦，天啊！这是什么啊！！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13551
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_2275555b:

    # ph "Muriel?"
    ph "Muriel？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13553
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_2f06e92f:

    # de "Brass music. More like ass music, am I right?"
    de "铜管乐。说白了就是肛乐，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13555
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_a6a6800d:

    # mc "What is it with you and shoving things up your ass?"
    mc "你怎么老喜欢往屁股里塞东西？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13558
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty2_label_6543775a:

    # ph "Ahem. We have a slight change in the program."
    ph "呃，节目安排稍作调整了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13564
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c82aa259:

    # ph "Up next, we'll have the first speaker of the night, who wishes to say a few welcoming words to all of you."
    ph "接下来，我们有今晚的第一位发言者，他想对在座的各位说几句话。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13565
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_1b9fa6b8:

    # ph "Everyone... Professor Stephen Burke."
    ph "各位……有请Stephen·布克教授。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13571
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_271c67a4:

    # "*{i}Smatter of applause{/i}*"
    "*{i}掌声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13576
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_033baf85:

    # sb "Thank you, Professor Hoff."
    sb "谢谢，霍夫教授。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13581
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_271df1b5:

    # sb "I want to start my speech by giving my sincere thanks to the party committee, who have arranged tonight's entertainment for you."
    sb "我想先以诚挚的感谢开启我的演讲，感谢党委会为你们安排了今晚的娱乐节目。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13582
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_a69639df:

    # sb "Professor Hoff has been a part of the committee this year, and they have decided to go with college musicians."
    sb "霍夫教授今年也参与了委员会，他们决定请来大学里的音乐人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13587
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_712d861c:

    # sb "And I know what you're thinking..."
    sb "我知道你们在想什么..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13588
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_a61dfa16:

    # sb "No, they weren't forced to be here. It won't reflect on their grades."
    sb "不，他们不是被逼来的。这不会影响他们的成绩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13589
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_af65f39e:

    # sb "And yes, their parents know where they are."
    sb "而且，他们的家长也知道他们现在在哪里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13591
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7183ca4f:

    # "*{i}Laughter{/i}*"
    "*{i}笑声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13596
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3bd66b41:

    # sb "My son is performing tonight, so I can attest to that."
    sb "我儿子今晚也在表演，我可以作证。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13601
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_fbe92dcc:

    # sb "Welcome, everyone, to our annual Christmas party."
    sb "欢迎各位来到我们一年一度的圣诞派对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13602
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_8dad572d:

    # sb "I hope everyone in the dining room can hear me as well. And I also hope that you're enjoying the fantastic buffet."
    sb "希望餐厅里的各位也能听见，也希望大家喜欢这顿丰盛的自助餐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13607
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_eecf406e:

    # sb "I look forward to this party every year, not only because it is in the middle of a mini-vacation..."
    sb "我每年都期待这个派对，不仅因为它是小假期的中间..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13608
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_991757bf:

    # sb "...but also because I get to spend it with you."
    sb "...但也是因为能和你们一起度过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13613
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5a4336ac:

    # sb "We have some notable sponsors with us tonight. And I'd like to go around the room and introduce them..."
    sb "我们今晚有一些特别的赞助商。我想绕着房间介绍一下他们……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13614
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_1ca30abf:

    # sb "First... Mr. Lyle Wallace!"
    sb "首先……莱尔·华莱士先生！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13618
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c61f8570:

    # isa "There you are."
    isa "你在这儿呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13620
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e69a73fa:

    # mc "Hey, you're here."
    mc "嘿，你在这儿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13623
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e685af43:

    # isa "In my mind, I'm giving you a kiss and a hug."
    isa "我心里想着，正给你一个吻和一个拥抱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13625
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_ec127fcb:

    # mc "It sucks that we can't do that now..."
    mc "可惜我们现在不能那样做了……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13626
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7c8144a0:

    # mc "You look beautiful tonight."
    mc "你今晚看起来真好看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13628
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_6829acda:

    # isa "Likewise, nice shirt!"
    isa "同样，你这件衬衫不错！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13629
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_f8204ca1:

    # isa "Good luck with your performance tonight."
    isa "祝你今晚演出顺利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13631
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_8055d16e:

    # ji "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Break a leg."
    ji "*{i}耳语{/i}*加油。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13633
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_324026ed:

    # isa "I meant, break a leg."
    isa "我意思是，祝你演出顺利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13635
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_83902761:

    # mc "Thanks! I'm getting excited."
    mc "谢谢！我有点兴奋。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13637
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_2eb3a459:

    # mc "Oh! FYI... Derek snuck in with me."
    mc "哦！顺便说一下，Derek 是跟着我一起进来的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13639
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_975cc30f:

    # isa "He didn't bring his sword, did he?"
    isa "他没带剑来，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13641
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_dc5281eb:

    # mc "No, I hope he learned that lesson."
    mc "不，我希望他学会了那个教训。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13642
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c0386894:

    # mc "But it took him like thirty minutes before he had to shove a trumpet up his ass."
    mc "但他在那儿待了足足三十分钟，才不得不把小号塞进屁眼里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13644
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_4cd56336:

    # isa "Is that a euphemism?"
    isa "这是个委婉说法吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13646
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3516125a:

    # mc "Ask Muriel Storch."
    mc "去问Muriel·斯托奇。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13648
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e29558cd:

    # isa "Who?"
    isa "谁？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13650
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c018bcf9:

    # mc "The brass musician who didn't play his set."
    mc "铜管乐手没完成他的演奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13655
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_9c698249:

    # isa "Good luck on your performance tonight."
    isa "今晚演出顺利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13657
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_8055d16e_1:

    # ji "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Break a leg."
    ji "*{i}耳语{/i}*加油。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13659
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_324026ed_1:

    # isa "I meant, break a leg."
    isa "我意思是，祝你演出顺利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13661
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_8151c586:

    # mc "Thank you. I will do my best. I'm getting excited."
    mc "谢谢。我会尽力的。我有点兴奋。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13662
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e4a46695:

    # mc "Although I don't think most out there are paying attention to the music."
    mc "虽然我觉得大多数人应该都没在听音乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13664
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e80c5b3c:

    # isa "Some are. It's playing in the dining room too while people are eating."
    isa "有些人在听。音乐也在食堂放，大家吃饭的时候也在放。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13665
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d833406a:

    # isa "I, for one, will listen the whole time. And I'm sure Sage will too."
    isa "我一定会全程认真听。我敢肯定Sage也会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13667
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_969dae9c:

    # sa "Sure, I will. It's the only reason I came here."
    sa "当然，我会的。这也是我来这里的原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13669
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_1adea810:

    # ji "I'm up next... I wish he would stop talking already."
    ji "下一个就轮到我了……真希望他赶紧闭嘴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13671
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_cef4bf13:

    # sa "We all do. He tends to ramble."
    sa "我们几个都这样。他总是啰嗦个没完。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13673
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5d7ecda2:

    # ji "The waiting is what kills me..."
    ji "等待才最折磨人……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13675
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_708d12d9:

    # isa "You'll do fine. Tell us about the songs you'll play."
    isa "你会表现得很棒。给我们说说你要演奏的歌曲吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13677
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7f7a2204:

    # ji "I'm going to play a few Christmas songs, but I'll start with a song I wrote for my sister."
    ji "我要演奏几首圣诞歌曲，但我会先演奏一首我为我妹妹写的歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13678
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_f696de8c:

    # ji "I wanted to surprise my parents. They always loved it when I played it for them."
    ji "我想给父母一个惊喜。他们一直很喜欢我为他们演奏这首曲子。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13680
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d1499120:

    # isa "They'll be proud of you for honoring her tonight."
    isa "他们今晚为你纪念她而感到骄傲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13682
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_ee21e021:

    # ji "I hope."
    ji "我希望。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13685
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_1adea810_1:

    # ji "I'm up next... I wish he would stop talking already."
    ji "我该上台了……希望他赶紧闭嘴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13687
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_6d48764f:

    # sa "We all do. Dad can go on for a long time unless he's stopped."
    sa "我们大家都是。我爸一说起来就没完，除非有人把他打断。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13689
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5d7ecda2_1:

    # ji "The waiting is what kills me..."
    ji "这等待真是要命..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:13691
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_708d12d9_1:

    # isa "You'll do fine. Tell us about the songs you'll play."
    isa "你会表现得很棒。说说你打算演奏哪些歌吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13693
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7f7a2204_1:

    # ji "I'm going to play a few Christmas songs, but I'll start with a song I wrote for my sister."
    ji "我要演奏几首圣诞歌曲，但我会先演奏一首我为妹妹写的歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13694
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7062fca2:

    # ji "I wanted to surprise my parents with it. They always loved it when I played it for them."
    ji "我想用这首歌给他们一个惊喜。他们一直很喜欢我演奏这首歌的时候。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13696
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d1499120_1:

    # isa "They'll be proud of you for honoring her tonight."
    isa "他们会为你今晚纪念她而感到骄傲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13698
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_ee21e021_1:

    # ji "I hope."
    ji "我希望。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13704
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_feb936bc:

    # sb "Thank you all for coming. Enjoy the food, drinks, and entertainment."
    sb "谢谢大家来参加，尽情享受美食、饮品和娱乐节目吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13705
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_963a002c:

    # sb "Happy Holidays, and have a wonderful end to the year!"
    sb "圣诞快乐，祝大家有一个美好的年末！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13707
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_271c67a4_1:

    # "*{i}Smatter of applause{/i}*"
    "*{i}掌声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13711
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_df80e396:

    # mc "Amelia. Geoff. Hi!"
    mc "Amelia，Geoff，你们好！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13713
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d67c20e2:

    # ge "I swear, the faculty gets younger and younger every year. Haha!"
    ge "我发誓，教职员工每年都越来越年轻了。哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13714
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_f2ecb2d4:

    # ge "It's good to see you, [name]!"
    ge "见到你也很高兴。[name]!"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13716
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e9a2d365:

    # jim "I take it you came to listen to Jill play."
    jim "我猜你是来听Jill演奏的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13718
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_494784dc:

    # mc "Partly. I'm here to perform, too."
    mc "部分是为了听你演奏，我也是来表演的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13720
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_813f23f8:

    # ge "Ah, of course. You have a talent, [name]. I remember your last performance at the recital."
    ge "当然，你有天赋，[name]我记得你上次在音乐会上的表现。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13721
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_61a27f8f:

    # ge "Or was it your last? Maybe you've played more in between."
    ge "或者那已经是你的最后一次了？也许你在中间还演奏过几次？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13723
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_558b4582:

    # mc "No, you're right. That was my last performance, and also why I was invited here."
    mc "不，你说得对。那确实是我的最后一次演出，也是我被邀请来这里的原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13725
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_44012860:

    # mc "I wanted to thank you for the Christmas gift Jill gave me."
    mc "我想感谢你送我的圣诞礼物，Jill。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13726
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_10b7fd97:

    # mc "I feel honored to play on Lana's guitar."
    mc "我感到很荣幸能在Lana的吉他上演出。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13728
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_b8cfb040:

    # jim "Jill insisted on giving it to you. It's nothing against you, but it was hard for us to part with it."
    jim "Jill坚持要把它送给你。这并不是针对你，只是对我们来说，很难把它交出去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13730
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c129b1ca:

    # mc "I understand. I promise to take good care of it."
    mc "我明白。我保证会好好照顾它。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13732
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3b948c10:

    # jim "You've made an impression on our daughter. She's fond of you."
    jim "你给我们的女儿留下了深刻印象，她也很喜欢你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13734
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c5992070:

    # mc "I'm fond of her too. Jill is amazing."
    mc "我也挺喜欢她的。Jill真的很棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13738
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3fe93474:

    # mc "I'll let you enjoy her music. It was nice seeing you."
    mc "我会让你享受她的音乐。能见到你也很开心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13740
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_0f8b67d7:

    # jim "Well... He is polite."
    jim "嗯……他挺有礼貌的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13742
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5ea65582:

    # ge "Jonathan was smart and polite, too."
    ge "Jonathan也挺聪明，挺有礼貌的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13772
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_ec8579bd:

    # jim "Geoff, do you hear what song your daughter is playing?"
    jim "Geoff，你听见女儿在弹什么曲子了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13780
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_54d8cb5a:

    # mu "What did you do to my trumpet!?"
    mu "你对我小号做了什么！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13782
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d97f5627:

    # de "I didn't do nothing."
    de "我没干啥。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13784
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5bf25c81:

    # mu "Didn't do nothing...? A double negative! So you {b}did{/b} do something?"
    mu "没做什么……？双重否定！所以你{b}的{/b}做点什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13786
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_2ce8a3e3:

    # de "Hey... You told me not to play it, and I didn't play it."
    de "嘿...你跟我说过别放这首歌，我没放。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13788
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_10f8378c:

    # ph "Gentlemen... Please, tone it down. Remember where you are tonight."
    ph "各位...请安静一点。记住你们现在在哪里。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13790
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c2a33252:

    # mu "Bah!"
    mu "呸！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13792
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_920edeb7:

    # ph "One of my roles on the party committee was to reach out to and invite the students who will perform here tonight."
    ph "我在这次派对委员会的一个职责，就是联系并邀请今晚在这里表演的学生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13793
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_88e7633f:

    # ph "But I don't remember extending the invite to you, Mr. Bailey."
    ph "但我可不记得邀请过你，巴利先生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13795
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e72a21b4:

    # de "Erm... I... Some cheesecake?"
    de "呃...我...来点芝士蛋糕？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13797
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3eb6467d:

    # ph "I snuck into parties when I was your age, too."
    ph "我当年也偷偷溜进过派对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13798
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_e0c7bbfe:

    # ph "But it never crossed my mind to sneak into a faculty party. Haha."
    ph "但那时候我可没想过要溜进老师们的派对。哈哈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13800
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_59b37675:

    # de "I came to see my friend play."
    de "我来见我朋友演出。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13802
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_b0cdd6f9:

    # ph "Mhm. I see."
    ph "嗯，我明白了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13803
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_0fa28b63:

    # ph "I talked to the committee the other day. You should expect to be summoned in January."
    ph "我前几天跟委员会谈过了，你一月份应该会被叫去一趟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13804
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_9e5157d2:

    # ph "How are things between you and Anthony since the altercation?"
    ph "你和Anthony最近怎么样？那件事之后？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13806
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d3bbcacc:

    # de "We haven't crossed each other's paths more than during the finals."
    de "我们俩除了决赛期间，几乎没碰过面。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13807
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_5aa47ef6:

    # de "But it went ok."
    de "但还算过得去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13809
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_51d74b8f:

    # ph "What was it all about, if I may ask?"
    ph "这事儿有什么好说的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13811
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_925e2e61:

    # de "I thought the meeting was in January."
    de "我以为会议是在一月份。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13813
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_28d3e33d:

    # ph "This is just between you and me. We're at a party, aren't we?"
    ph "这事儿就咱俩知道。我们不正在派对上吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13815
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_9e192496:

    # de "Well... I'm in love with his girlfriend."
    de "好吧……我爱上了他的女朋友。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13817
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_1891e6f3:

    # ph "A lovers' quarrel, you say."
    ph "你说的是情人间的争吵吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13819
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_a54cd6b6:

    # de "You can call it that."
    de "你可以这么叫。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13821
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_b97a30c1:

    # ph "Ahh... To be young and experience heartbreak again."
    ph "啊...年轻的时候再次经历心碎的感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13823
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_89a56ec3:

    # de "Yeah? Were you a ladies' man?"
    de "你也是吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13825
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_37c10bbe:

    # ph "Haha. Not as much as I wish."
    ph "哈哈，比我想象中没那么惨。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13826
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_c6087f7a:

    # ph "But I, too, was in love with someone who got away from me."
    ph "但我也曾经爱过一个离开了我的人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13828
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_64598ad5:

    # ph "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    ph "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13830
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_52046de2:

    # ph "Are you a smoker, Bailey?"
    ph "你抽不抽烟，贝利？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13832
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7b9e2fbc:

    # de "Nah."
    de "不。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13834
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_b4dc34c9:

    # ph "Me neither. Except for a cigar here and there."
    ph "我也不抽。除了偶尔抽根雪茄。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13835
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_7a763c49:

    # ph "Care to join me for one? Bad habits like company."
    ph "要来一根吗？这种坏习惯得找个伴。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13837
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_73b0052f:

    # de "Is there a drink that comes with it?"
    de "来点酒吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13839
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_11b46363:

    # ph "Haha! I'll look the other way if you want to grab yourself a whisky. I'll show you where it is."
    ph "哈哈！如果你想来点威士忌，我装作没看见。我带你去拿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13841
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_ca87afea:

    # ph "Now, what did you really do to Muriel's trumpet?"
    ph "现在，你到底对Muriel的号角做了什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13843
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d2bd5781:

    # de "I may have shoved it up my butt."
    de "我可能把它塞进我屁股里了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13845
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_007580ff:

    # ph "BAHAHA! You're quite a joker, Bailey."
    ph "哈哈！你这家伙真会开玩笑，巴利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13847
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_d8cb4f18:

    # ph "If there's any truth to that, I don't want to know."
    ph "如果这话属实，我可不想知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13848
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty3_label_3979a8e1:

    # ph "Muriel is a great chess player, but he's a sore loser. He gets on my nerves, too."
    ph "Muriel棋下得很好，但他输不起，也很烦人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13861
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_19dda0e8:

    # "*{i}Applause{/i}*"
    "*{i}掌声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13863
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_fd3519ff:

    # jim "That was beautiful. Well done."
    jim "那局下得太漂亮了。干得不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13865
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_05c700ac:

    # ge "I'm proud of you. Superbly played."
    ge "我为你感到骄傲。演奏得太棒了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13867
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_8c972237:

    # ji "Thank you so much. I hope you liked my surprise."
    ji "谢谢你们，希望你们喜欢我的惊喜。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13869
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_61f4c7a6:

    # jim "It's been a long time since we heard you play her song. It made us happy that you remembered it."
    jim "上次你唱她的歌已经很久了，你记得它让我们很感动。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13872
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_dabad169:

    # ji "*{i}Excited noises{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}兴奋的声音{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13874
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_a7b02c64:

    # isa "You did it!"
    isa "你做到了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13876
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_5aa9de3a:

    # ji "I did it!"
    ji "我做到了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13878
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_e396f405:

    # sa "You didn't have to be nervous about that at all. You nailed it."
    sa "你根本不用紧张的，你表现得超棒的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13880
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_185ccee3:

    # ji "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I feel so relieved."
    ji "*{i}叹气{/i}*我感觉松了一口气。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13885
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_90545c3e:

    # mc "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}一巴掌{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13887
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_2f06eaee:

    # mc "You played it so well."
    mc "你演得太棒了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13889
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_110cd448:

    # ji "What are you still doing here? You're supposed to go up after me."
    ji "你还在干嘛？该轮到你上场了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13891
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_049b4858:

    # mc "I can't follow you without an intermission! The audience will laugh at me."
    mc "我不能在没有中场休息的情况下跟上去！观众会笑我的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13893
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_ee79a1a3:

    # ji "Oh, stop it."
    ji "别装了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13895
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_714657ae:

    # mc "I'm heading up there. You were amazing!"
    mc "我上去了，你刚才太棒了！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13898
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_5c5e70a5:

    # mc "You were amazing, Jill. You'll be a tough act to follow, but I'm heading up there."
    mc "你演得太棒了，Jill。你这表演真是难接，但我还是上去吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13900
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_ece7d5b4:

    # isa "Good luck!"
    isa "祝你演出顺利！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13902
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_77be271a:

    # ji "Break a leg."
    ji "破个腿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13904
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_b62fa310:

    # isa "Dammit."
    isa "该死。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13908
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_1efaec3b:

    # isa "[name] is next... I don't feel like watching this."
    isa "[name]接下来... 我不想看这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13910
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_de6c0f0c:

    # isa "[name] is next."
    isa "[name]是下一回合。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13913
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_4924d878:

    # ji "Can we go somewhere else?"
    ji "我们去别处吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13918
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_1d4b8881:

    # ji "I feel bad..."
    ji "我感觉不太好……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13920
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_882ee114:

    # sa "I do too, but what about Josy and Maya? How do you think they feel?"
    sa "我也一样，但 Josy 和 Maya 怎么样？你觉得她们感觉如何？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13922
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_242b6ecf:

    # isa "We can still show him some support."
    isa "我们还能给他一些支持。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13924
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_41ece9ab:

    # sa "No... I can't do this."
    sa "不行...我做不到。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13930
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_a19e2e02:

    # sa "Let's leave."
    sa "我们走吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13932
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_c6e862a9:

    # sa "Can we leave? I don't want to watch this."
    sa "我们走吧，我不想看这个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13937
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_3575d950:

    # mc "(I'll do what the others did. I'll just start playing.)"
    mc "（我也会像其他人一样，我这就开始玩。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13940
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5_label_b20f3954:

    # mc "(No talk... Just music.)"
    mc "（别说话……只管放音乐。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13955
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_c90bdfbb:

    # sb "Mr. Wallace. Are you enjoying the evening?"
    sb "Mr. Wallace，今晚过得愉快吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13957
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_86ea1c59:

    # wl "Stephen! We were talking about you."
    wl "Stephen！我们刚才还在说你呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13958
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_e60b0192:

    # wl "Did you say hi to Mr. Dahl yet?"
    wl "你跟Mr. Dahl打过招呼了吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13960
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_e3939db2:

    # sb "We spoke earlier tonight together with Mr. Finch."
    sb "我们刚才和芬奇先生一起聊过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13962
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_6ccbd99a:

    # wl "Excellent."
    wl "很好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13963
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_9daa542c:

    # wl "We were debating who contributed the most this year, haha."
    wl "我们在争论谁今年捐得最多，哈哈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13965
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_4230e17b:

    # dh "Yes, Stephen. Help us settle the argument."
    dh "对，Stephen。帮我们解决这个争论吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13967
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2433944b:

    # sb "I'm sure both of you know how much you donated to B&R."
    sb "我敢肯定你们俩都知道自己给B&R捐了多少钱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13969
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_ba3b0a90:

    # dh "Well, I don't. But Mr. Wallace seems to suggest that not knowing the exact figure is equal to peanuts."
    dh "那我可就不知道了。不过Mr. Wallace好像觉得，不知道具体数字就等于没捐什么。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13971
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_801ae69a:

    # wl "Hahaha!"
    wl "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13973
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_b25555f2:

    # sb "It wasn't peanuts. I can assure you."
    sb "这可不是小数目。我敢保证。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13974
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_e306619a:

    # sb "Tell me, did you find any prospects among the candidates?"
    sb "说说看，你有没有在候选人里发现什么有潜力的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13976
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_a27e12cc:

    # dh "Yes. Yes. A couple of them caught my attention."
    dh "是的。是的。有几个挺吸引我的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13977
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_075a5fbf:

    # dh "Mr. Syles! He shows promise. I take it you will put in a good word for me."
    dh "赛尔斯先生！他很有潜力。我想您会替我美言几句吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13979
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_c1f5f305:

    # sb "I can be very convincing."
    sb "我可以说服任何人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13981
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_bae29bde:

    # wl "As long as the top candidates reach out to me, I take no issue with that."
    wl "只要顶尖候选人主动联系我，我不会有什么意见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13983
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_7e4d63aa:

    # sb "The candidates are always handpicked and tailored to your business. There won't be any conflict of interest or shady acts."
    sb "候选人们都是精心挑选和量身打造的，完全符合你的业务需求。不会有利益冲突或者见不得人的勾当。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13985
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_7bb2f911:

    # dh "Right. But the news said you dealt in quid pro quo."
    dh "对，但新闻说你搞的是权钱交易。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13987
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f881439c:

    # sb "I don't know who told them that. But you have my word that it will stay a rumor - a forgotten one at that."
    sb "我不知道是谁告诉他们的。但你放心，这事我会让它保持在谣言阶段——甚至可能被彻底遗忘。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13988
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_a7cedff4:

    # sb "It will not affect you or reflect on your donations in any negative way."
    sb "这不会影响到你，也不会对你过去的捐赠有任何负面评价。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13990
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_4492a23d:

    # wl "Stephen."
    wl "Stephen。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13992
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f2483fad:

    # sb "Yes?"
    sb "嗯？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:13994
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_d59504c6:

    # wl "I'm going to hold you to that."
    wl "我可不会拿这话开玩笑。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14004
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_19dda0e8:

    # "*{i}Applause{/i}*"
    "*{i}掌声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14019
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_248c07f9:

    # mc "(That's it... Phew... I made it through. And barely any mistakes at that.)"
    mc "（搞定啦……呼……我总算撑过来了。而且几乎没出错。）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14021
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2e81d144:

    # de "That was awesome, [mc_de]. Top-tier stuff!"
    de "那太棒了，[mc_de]顶级货！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14023
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_ea987129:

    # mc "You're drinking and smoking? You should be careful around these people."
    mc "你喝酒抽烟？在这群人面前得小心点。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14025
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_55d6004b:

    # de "Don't worry. Professor Hoff gave me the cigar and told me I could swipe some whisky."
    de "别担心。霍夫教授给了我一支雪茄，还说可以拿点威士忌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14027
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_906c5aa3:

    # mc "I can't with your lies right now."
    mc "我现在真受不了你的谎言了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14029
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_08970cbc:

    # bru "Wow! You are talented. Your performance blew us away."
    bru "哇！你真有才华，表演简直太棒了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14031
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f6c5b5ff:

    # mc "Oh, thank you..."
    mc "哦，谢谢..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14033
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_96e50094:

    # bru "You can call me Bruce. And this is my wife, Ursula."
    bru "叫我Bruce就好。这位是我的妻子Ursula。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14035
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_5ca67b7e:

    # urs "You sure brought the Christmas spirit with that."
    urs "你这下可真是把圣诞精神带出来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14037
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_0cb4f6cb:

    # mc "Thank you very much! That's what I tried to do."
    mc "谢谢您！我就是这么想的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14039
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_6c647fdf:

    # bru "We were discussing when you played..."
    bru "我们是在讨论你什么时候表演的..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14040
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_617940fa:

    # bru "We both swore we knew you from somewhere."
    bru "我们俩都发誓认识你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14041
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cf44e3fe:

    # bru "Tell us, did you perchance play Pachelbel's Canon in D in a video online?"
    bru "你是不是在某个视频里弹过帕赫贝尔的《D大调卡农》？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14043
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_695a3dc9:

    # mc "I played that song at a recital here at B&R, and someone put it online."
    mc "我在B&R的演奏会上弹过那首曲子，后来有人把它上传到网上了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14045
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_30dd2bee:

    # urs "I told you it was him!"
    urs "我就是他！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14047
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_5b934a81:

    # bru "Our daughter showed us that video. She would be thrilled to learn that we met you."
    bru "我们女儿给我们看了那个视频。她要是知道我们认识了你，肯定会激动得不行。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14049
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_602f5382:

    # urs "She went on and on about how this cute guy played our wedding song on the guitar."
    urs "她一直唠叨着说这个可爱的家伙用吉他弹了我们婚礼的歌曲。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14051
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_a3b47ab7:

    # mc "Oh, you got married to it?"
    mc "哦，你跟那首歌结婚了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14053
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_b09b0734:

    # bru "Oh, like 17 years ago, when she was a child. But our daughter saw the video from it and loved that song."
    bru "哦，像17年前，她还是个孩子的时候。但我们的女儿看了那个视频，特别喜欢那首歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14055
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_3b63f8dc:

    # urs "Would you mind taking a picture with us? We'd love to show it to her."
    urs "你介意和我们拍张照片吗？我们想给她看看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14057
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cf5fa4db:

    # mc "Sure, I don't mind."
    mc "当然可以，没问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14062
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f2f1bb14:

    # urs "Thank you so much."
    urs "谢谢你们。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14064
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2f9928a1:

    # de "This guy sure can play, yeah?"
    de "这小子可真会玩，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14066
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_7858da7d:

    # bru "Haha, yes. He sure can."
    bru "哈哈，是啊。他确实挺行的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14067
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_8179eac2:

    # bru "Is he a friend of yours?"
    bru "他是你朋友吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14069
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cc9a8ac6:

    # de "Friends? Uh... We are MORE than just friends."
    de "朋友？呃……我们可不止是朋友。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14071
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cc2085dc:

    # urs "Oh..."
    urs "哦..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14073
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_5855cbfa:

    # mc "What are you saying? We are not more than friends."
    mc "你在说什么？我们可没那么亲密。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14076
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_d473e483:

    # de "I'm saying we're best friends."
    de "我在说我们是最好的朋友。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14078
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_fe7d5731:

    # de "I'm saying we're very close friends."
    de "我在说我们是关系很近的朋友。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14080
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_24a695de:

    # mc "That's not how that came out."
    mc "那话说得可真不咋地。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14082
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_4c51f107:

    # urs "Haha..."
    urs "哈哈..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14084
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f79cad69:

    # bru "Excuse us. And thank you for the music."
    bru "打扰一下，谢谢你们的音乐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14086
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_57ddbe4e:

    # mc "Why did you have to say that?"
    mc "你干嘛非要说那话？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14088
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_0504a2b6:

    # mc "And stop smoking indoors."
    mc "而且别在室内抽烟。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14092
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_9dce1bf6:

    # ja "Well played, [name]."
    ja "妙啊，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14094
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_83c5df38:

    # mc "Thank you, Dr. Burke."
    mc "谢谢，伯克博士。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14095
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_0d5f8cc1:

    # mc "Um... Is it still Burke, by the way?"
    mc "嗯……话说回来，还是Burke吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14097
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_a676fac1:

    # ja "Yes. We're both keeping it. It makes life in academia simpler."
    ja "是的。我们俩都保留着。这样在学术圈里更方便。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14099
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_80804871:

    # mc "Oh, how so?"
    mc "哦，怎么个情况？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14101
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_61b9d946:

    # ja "For notoriety reasons. It appears more coherent when you publish works, papers, communications, books, etc."
    ja "因为声望的问题。当你发表作品、论文、通信、书籍等等时，看起来会更连贯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14103
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_71455abd:

    # mc "How's the party for you? I can't imagine that it's any fun having to endure Stephen being in the spotlight."
    mc "你在派对上过得怎么样？我实在想象不到，硬要让你看着Stephen在聚光灯下晃来晃去，该有多难受。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14105
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_25513065:

    # ja "I didn't enjoy it when we were married either. I've gotten good at ignoring it."
    ja "我结婚的时候也不喜欢这种场面。我早就练就了一身无视它的本事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14106
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_8e015fb4:

    # ja "As for the party, it's the same old."
    ja "至于派对嘛，跟以前一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14108
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_ec84ebe9:

    # ja "I miss Cathy, though. We used to have a good time together at these parties."
    ja "不过我倒是挺想Cathy的。我们以前在这些派对上总是玩得很开心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14111
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cbcb8331:

    # ja "Speaking of Cathy..."
    ja "说到Cathy..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14113
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_d639ab6b:

    # mc "We shouldn't talk about her here..."
    mc "我们这儿不该提她……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14115
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_28061f27:

    # ja "Oh, I know. You don't have to worry. I'll choose my words carefully."
    ja "哦，我知道。你不用担心，我会注意说话的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14116
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_bbdbf999:

    # ja "I was thinking that next time, maybe we could reverse the roles."
    ja "我想下次 也许 我们可以换个方式玩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14118
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_361ca3ea:

    # mc "I think I get what you mean. But even if I don't, I'm game."
    mc "我想我明白你的意思了。就算我不明白，我也愿意试试。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14120
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cf87804f:

    # ja "Haha... You would say yes to anything. Wouldn't you?"
    ja "哈哈... 你对啥都点头啊，是不是？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14122
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_6bf4ccb7:

    # mc "I like to party."
    mc "我喜欢聚会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14124
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_4534f503:

    # ja "Then party we shall."
    ja "那咱们就来场派对吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14127
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_4f32d4a5:

    # mc "I miss her too."
    mc "我也想她。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14130
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_3d2c3442:

    # mc "By the way, there's something I need to talk to you about. But this isn't the place for it."
    mc "顺便说一句，我有件事想和你谈谈。但这里不是说这个的地方。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14132
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_80268cb4:

    # ja "Leave it for another time, [name]."
    ja "暂且放下[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14134
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_3382f2dc:

    # ja "I should continue to mingle. Have a nice evening."
    ja "我得继续去和人聊聊天。晚上愉快。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14138
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_f0b94e7a:

    # ji "Unsurprisingly, you were great."
    ji "毫无疑问，你表现得非常棒。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14140
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_48f262bf:

    # sa "That was so good, [name]."
    sa "那太棒了，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14142
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_34eec1cc:

    # isa "Yes. Well done."
    isa "嗯，做得不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14144
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_9dfc6f60:

    # ji "It's so easy to tell that you enjoy being on stage."
    ji "这么明显你享受在舞台上表演。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14146
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_37a6757a:

    # mc "Yeah, I had a good time tonight. This made me want to play more."
    mc "嗯，今晚玩得很开心。这让我更想多弹点了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14148
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2a6f6bc7:

    # ji "You should. Share your beautiful music with others."
    ji "你应该这么做。把你的美妙音乐分享给别人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14150
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_e7db7c43:

    # mc "So should you."
    mc "你也该这么做。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14151
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_7de88990:

    # mc "That song you wrote for Lana... I've heard you play it before."
    mc "那首你为Lana写的歌……我以前听过你演奏过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14153
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_c19c2919:

    # ji "It's a special song that I wrote for her after she passed away."
    ji "这是我在她去世后专门为她写的歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14154
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_19edb9fd:

    # ji "I wanted to play it tonight because my parents are here. They love that song."
    ji "我想今晚演奏那首歌是因为我爸妈在这儿。他们特别喜欢这首歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14156
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_bdaf94d3:

    # mc "What a nice gesture."
    mc "这真是个暖心的举动。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14160
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_7d636e05:

    # sa "You're the best. How do you feel?"
    sa "你是最棒的。你感觉怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14162
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_996d7f0e:

    # mc "I enjoyed it. It wasn't scary at all. I can see myself doing this again."
    mc "我挺享受的。一点都不吓人。我觉得自己还能再做一次。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14164
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2c36e61e:

    # sa "You should. It felt like you belonged up there on stage."
    sa "你应该上台，你看起来真的很适合站在舞台上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14166
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_07723a89:

    # mc "I don't know about that."
    mc "我不知道是不是这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14168
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_715c2079:

    # ji "Beautifully played, [name]."
    ji "漂亮地玩了一局，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14170
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_2ab1659e:

    # isa "It was music to my ears."
    isa "这句真好听。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14172
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_c373ea7b:

    # mc "Haha, funny."
    mc "哈哈，挺有趣的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14175
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_e3cedea4:

    # isa "Simply divine."
    isa "纯粹的天籁之音。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14177
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_715c2079_1:

    # ji "Beautifully played, [name]."
    ji "漂亮地玩了一局，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14179
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_854bb038:

    # sa "Yeah, that was so good."
    sa "嗯，那演奏太棒了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14181
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_8324354b:

    # mc "Aw, thank you."
    mc "唉，谢谢啦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14185
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_cf5ad40e:

    # mc "Isn't it Tybalt's turn to play next?"
    mc "是不是该轮到Tybalt上场了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14187
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty4_label_34c3a14c:

    # sa "Oh, I want to record this trainwreck."
    sa "哦，我想录下这场灾难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14194
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_0c301746:

    # isa "I believe your brother is up next."
    isa "我相信你兄弟该轮到他上了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14199
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_34c3a14c:

    # sa "Oh, I want to record this trainwreck."
    sa "哦，我想录下这个灾难现场。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14208
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_a8fa7809:

    # isa "He brought a band?"
    isa "他带了乐队？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14210
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_782c4ea7:

    # sa "Lose the \"r\". I haven't seen the guy before, but I think I recognize the girl."
    sa "去掉“r”。我之前没见过这人，但我觉得我认得那个女孩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14212
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_291b62ea:

    # isa "Oh. Do you think he hired them to play?"
    isa "哦，你认为他是请他们来演奏的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14214
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_bfaf2c68:

    # sa "Well, I doubt they are his friends."
    sa "那家伙怕不是请他们来表演的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14220
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_f30decc7:

    # ty "Good evening. I hope you're enjoying the Christmas party."
    ty "晚上好。希望你们正在享受这个圣诞派对。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14221
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_ec00a7ed:

    # ty "I'm Tybalt Burke, and I'm here to bless you with a song."
    ty "我是Tybalt·伯克，来给你们献上一首歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14222
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_e6b37cfa:

    # ty "You'll only get one song from me tonight."
    ty "你今晚只能听到我一首歌。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14224
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_e6bd8aea:

    # sa "Tch. Because he could only learn one. Am I right?"
    sa "啧。因为他只能学会一首。对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14229
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1a494076:

    # ty "But it's a special song."
    ty "但这首歌可不一般。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14230
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c54175ee:

    # ty "It's called \"To be a winner\", and I wrote it myself."
    ty "叫《成为赢家》，是我自己写的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14233
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_7df8f6e1:

    # nik "*{i}Whispers{/i}* Didn't you write it?"
    nik "*{i}耳语{/i}*你不是写的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14244
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_6b79266d:

    # sa "What the fuck!? He's good!?"
    sa "什么鬼！？他真他妈的厉害！？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14246
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d9db2a04:

    # ji "When did that happen?"
    ji "什么时候发生的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14247
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_fed7a429:

    # ji "I'm telling you, the last time I heard him play was like listening to a bag of cats being beaten with rocks."
    ji "我跟你说，上次我听他弹琴，那感觉就像是在听一袋猫被石头砸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14249
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c59054e7:

    # sa "I'm not gonna record this."
    sa "我可不会录下来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14262
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_4d6e1aec:

    # mc "(Nikita?)"
    mc "(Nikita?)"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14264
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_88b192a9:

    # mc "(She plays the bass...)"
    mc "（她弹着贝斯……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14265
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_fb3ad979:

    # mc "(That's so hot...)"
    mc "（太性感了……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14267
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_ceea4f9e:

    # mc "(But she's playing it with Tybalt...)"
    mc "（但她是用 Tybalt 的方式在演奏……）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14268
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_b9536823:

    # mc "(Why would she do that?)"
    mc "（她为什么会这么做？）"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14287
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_19dda0e8:

    # "*{i}Applause{/i}*"
    "*{i}掌声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14293
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_acc120c1:

    # ty "Thank you, everyone. Thanks for being here tonight."
    ty "谢谢大家，感谢今晚能来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14294
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1333572e:

    # ty "I want to give an extra thanks to the people I couldn't have done this without..."
    ty "我想特别感谢那些没有他们我根本不可能做到这一切的人..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14301
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_bf4373ce:

    # ty "The donors, who keep B&R well-funded and, with that, students well-educated. I applaud you."
    ty "捐赠者们，你们让B&R保持充足的资金，也让学生们能够接受良好的教育。我向你们致敬。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14306
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_0213f39e:

    # ty "And of course, another thanks to someone who's been motivating me daily to do this..."
    ty "当然，还要感谢一些每天都在激励我做这件事的人..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14311
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_5cc1092a:

    # ty "My girlfriend Paula."
    ty "我女朋友Paula。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14316
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d64623e0:

    # ji "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I need a drink..."
    ji "*{i}叹气{/i}*我需要喝点东西..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14318
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_df329299:

    # sa "Ditto."
    sa "同感。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14320
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_944c06fe:

    # isa "You go ahead. Sadly, I should mingle more tonight."
    isa "你先来吧。可惜的是，我今晚得多和人打打交道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14325
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_a3392fd2:

    # mc "That was something else."
    mc "那可真是不一样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14327
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_7d50cba8:

    # nik "Ditto. I watched you play before we got on."
    nik "一样。我看到你玩完才上场的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14328
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_216d8bc2:

    # nik "Of course, it had to be you who played before us."
    nik "当然，轮到你之前玩的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14330
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_6fa98925:

    # nik "I started to suspect that you were following me..."
    nik "我开始怀疑你是在跟着我..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14331
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_842a78ea:

    # nik "...but tonight I followed you in a sense. So, I'm torn."
    nik "但今晚我某种程度上也跟着你了。所以，我有点纠结。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14333
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_08f563a5:

    # mc "So, you play the bass."
    mc "所以你弹贝斯。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14335
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_b39815f9:

    # nik "And you play the guitar."
    nik "你弹吉他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14337
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_ba709879:

    # mc "Marry me."
    mc "娶我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14339
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_96cd654e:

    # nik "Hahaha!"
    nik "哈哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14341
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_36057f4a:

    # mc "I have to ask..."
    mc "我得问一句..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14342
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_a7c9a78c:

    # mc "Why do you play with...him?"
    mc "为什么你非要和他一起演奏？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14344
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_dae11b83:

    # nik "With Tybalt Burke?"
    nik "和Tybalt·伯克？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14345
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_0f164ab5:

    # nik "Well, my older brother Tim works as a music teacher, and Tybalt hired him to teach him how to play better."
    nik "好，我哥哥蒂姆是音乐老师，他雇了Tybalt来教他怎么弹得更好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14347
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d6ff97b4:

    # nik "He paid quite a handsome sum for Tim to write him a piece and to perform it here."
    nik "他付了相当可观的一笔钱，让Tim为他写了一首曲子，并在这里演奏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14348
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_67484e3b:

    # nik "Tim asked me to help him out, and of course, I'll help my brother."
    nik "Tim让我帮忙，我当然会帮我哥哥。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14350
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_9f5ab04f:

    # mc "Oh, good... I thought you were friends with Tybalt or something."
    mc "哦，好啊……我本来以为你是和Tybalt那种朋友关系呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14352
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c40f19c3:

    # nik "Friends? Oh, no. Actually, we're lovers."
    nik "朋友？哦不，实际上我们是恋人。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14354
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14356
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_0b0f796a:

    # nik "Or we're not lovers, and I can tell you don't like him for some reason."
    nik "或者我们根本不是情侣，而且我能感觉到你对他有某种原因不喜欢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14358
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_8714ad6b:

    # mc "Hahaha... You got me."
    mc "哈哈哈……你可真会说。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14359
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_5a43dae8:

    # mc "Yeah... There are reasons."
    mc "嗯……确实有原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14362
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_3f5f1249:

    # ty "Hey. *{i}Snaps fingers{/i}* Hey, blondie!"
    ty "嘿。*{i}打响指{/i}*嘿，金发妞！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14363
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_23392922:

    # ty "I paid for the entire evening."
    ty "我请了整晚的客。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14365
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_148ed9ae:

    # nik "I can probably guess what they are."
    nik "我大概能猜到是什么原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14366
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_6da3b678:

    # nik "I'd better go before I get Tim into trouble."
    nik "我最好先走，别让Tim惹上麻烦。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14368
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_f2f5d596:

    # mc "I...um..."
    mc "我……呃……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14370
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c67dbaeb:

    # de "You almost had her..."
    de "你差点就让她上钩了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14372
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_08fbe973:

    # mc "Were you eavesdropping?"
    mc "你是在偷听吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14374
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_048a5134:

    # de "What else am I gonna do here? The party sucks."
    de "我在这里还能做什么？这个派对烂透了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14375
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_df10a706:

    # de "You could have closed the deal with her. It's not hard."
    de "你本来可以搞定她的，这不难。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14377
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_3e3906d6:

    # de "\"We should get together and play something.\""
    de "我们找个时间一起玩点什么吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14378
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1895a402:

    # de "\"How about we meet up after?\""
    de "怎么样，我们之后约个时间？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14380
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_46b39a89:

    # mc "I got tongue-tied, ok?"
    mc "我卡壳了，行吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14382
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_842404e0:

    # de "Want me to ask her?"
    de "要我问问她吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14384
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1b219e83:

    # mc "No... I'm gonna ruin this one on my own."
    mc "不... 我自己搞定。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14390
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1b70af0d:

    # dav "These Christmas parties are always the same."
    dav "这些圣诞派对每次都一个样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14392
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d1a0e185:

    # mc "I wouldn't know; it's my first. I'm a student here."
    mc "我可不知道，这是我第一次。我在这里读书。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14394
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c9991621:

    # dav "I know. I didn't mistake you for a faculty member. I watched you play before."
    dav "我知道。我没把你当成教职员工，我之前看过你打球。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14395
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_9899ef4a:

    # dav "You're talented. It was an impeccable performance you put on."
    dav "你表现得很有天赋，刚才的演出简直完美无瑕。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14397
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_89110ec4:

    # mc "Thank you, sir."
    mc "谢谢您，先生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14399
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_df23f333:

    # dav "No sirs needed. Call me David."
    dav "不用叫我先生，叫我David。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14402
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_40172f83:

    # mc "I'm David, too."
    mc "我也叫David。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14404
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_3cf51d08:

    # mc "I'm [name]."
    mc "我正在[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14407
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_785e5bb2:

    # dav "That's easy to remember."
    dav "那很容易记住。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14408
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_2d5166d3:

    # dav "I used to play the guitar when I was your age."
    dav "我年轻的时候也弹过吉他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14409
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_4f6d220f:

    # dav "The Stratocaster. That one was my favorite."
    dav "斯特拉特卡斯特。那把是我最喜欢的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14411
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_9ad63f29:

    # mc "Good taste. That's a nice guitar."
    mc "好品味。这把吉他不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14412
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_dfc63d56:

    # mc "Are you still playing?"
    mc "你还弹吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14414
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_b2e91cf8:

    # dav "I still jam, from time to time. But work has a habit of keeping me from it."
    dav "我偶尔还会即兴弹奏一下，但工作总让我没时间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14416
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_be958211:

    # mc "That's a shame. You should make more time for it."
    mc "真可惜。你应该多抽点时间去玩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14417
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_488e3d6c:

    # mc "What line of work are you in?"
    mc "你做什么工作的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14419
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_06ab8d26:

    # dav "I'm in the Medtech sector."
    dav "我在医疗科技行业工作。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14421
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1a1f1304:

    # mc "That's interesting! I'm studying science. I think I'm going to pursue a master's degree in engineering."
    mc "这挺有意思的！我在学科学，我想攻读工程专业的硕士学位。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14422
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_f8d42bc2:

    # mc "Either that or a bachelor's degree. I haven't made up my mind yet."
    mc "要么就是个学士学位。我还没想好呢。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14424
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_913555d0:

    # dav "Oh, really? That's a breath of fresh air."
    dav "哦，真的吗？这可真是让人耳目一新。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14425
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d25116ef:

    # dav "Most people I've talked to at this party are interested in finance."
    dav "大多数在场的人都对金融感兴趣。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14427
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d87bf35e:

    # dav "Do you perform as well in school as you do with that guitar?"
    dav "你上课表现也这么好吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14430
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_c321ce3b:

    # mc "I think I'm doing well."
    mc "我觉得自己表现得还不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14432
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_bab56ed4:

    # mc "It's tough, but I'm trying..."
    mc "这挺难的，但我正在努力..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14434
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_4d2a1852:

    # dav "Modesty is admirable. You got invited tonight. That alone speaks volumes to me."
    dav "谦虚是值得称赞的。你今晚能被邀请过来，这一点就说明了很多。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14436
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_8e604e0f:

    # dav "I hated college. They made it harder than it had to be."
    dav "我讨厌大学。他们把事情搞得比它本身要难多了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14437
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_32f792b9:

    # dav "All these redundant classes you needed to pass..."
    dav "这么多没用的课程你都得修..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14439
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_2657cdd3:

    # dav "Today, I know you should look at the person, not just the grades."
    dav "今天，你应该看人，而不是只看分数。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14440
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1937f2b2:

    # dav "If you get a good feeling from someone, follow that instinct."
    dav "如果你对某人有直觉上的好感，就跟着感觉走。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14441
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_d0d601ae:

    # dav "That's how we hire our employees. We let the gut lead."
    dav "这就是我们招聘员工的方式。我们让直觉来主导。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14443
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_ece05bcc:

    # mc "Sounds healthy to me. When I'm applying for a job, I'd want the recruiter to be like that, for sure."
    mc "听起来挺健康的。我找工作的时候，也希望招聘的人能这么想，肯定没问题。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14444
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_f96c8d5d:

    # mc "And hey, that makes sense for you. Using chemistry in other aspects of your work, too."
    mc "而且，这对你来说也挺合理的。你在工作其他方面也用点化学反应嘛。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14446
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_e9f633cd:

    # dav "Haha! Clever! Do you have any summer jobs lined up yet?"
    dav "哈哈！聪明！你有安排好暑假的工作吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14448
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_5189e20f:

    # mc "Summer? It's December. All that's on my mind right now is whether I passed the finals."
    mc "夏天？现在是十二月。我脑子里现在只想着期末考有没有过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14450
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_59fc6d3d:

    # dav "I take that as a no."
    dav "我当这是个拒绝。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14451
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_a365bf15:

    # dav "Well, if you're interested in Medtech, I might have something for you."
    dav "那如果对你来说医工科技感兴趣的话，我可能有东西能给你。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14453
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_cb99b08e:

    # mc "Seriously? I don't have any experience with that."
    mc "真的？我可没有这方面的经验。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14455
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_262d9b9c:

    # dav "Companies want you to have 10 years of work experience when you graduate from college. It's absurd."
    dav "公司恨不得你大学毕业时就有十年工作经验，简直荒唐。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14456
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_5e5f2564:

    # dav "Sometimes in life, you've got to catch a break. And I believe in passing things forward."
    dav "有时候人生里你得抓住点运气，而且我相信该把东西传下去。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14458
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_b32243b6:

    # mc "I'm interested, sure."
    mc "我感兴趣，当然。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14460
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_22735fe2:

    # dav "You don't even know what the job would be, but you're already interested. Haha!"
    dav "你连工作内容都不知道，就已经感兴趣了。哈哈！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14461
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_a4a276cc:

    # dav "That's the good feeling I was talking about."
    dav "这就是我刚才说的那种好感觉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14463
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_1a8aa44e:

    # mc "The good feeling goes both ways."
    mc "这感觉是双向的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14465
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_ed24b20d:

    # dav "Haha! I like it."
    dav "哈哈！我喜欢这个说法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14467
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_af090afc:

    # dav "Well, it's a summer job. But who knows? It could lead to a career."
    dav "好吧，这算个暑假工。但谁知道呢？说不定能发展成一份事业。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14468
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_6c66d7a6:

    # dav "Here. Take my card."
    dav "拿去吧，我的名片。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14469
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_cf772593:

    # dav "Send me an e-mail when you get the chance, and I'll take care of it."
    dav "有空给我发个邮件，我来处理。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14471
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_7b6eb2df:

    # mc "Can you do that?"
    mc "你能做到吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14473
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_7b8db956:

    # dav "I own the company. I sure hope I can."
    dav "我就是这家公司的老板。我真希望我能。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14475
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_9e1b9e60:

    # dav "Nice to meet you, [name]."
    dav "很高兴见到你，[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14477
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty5b_label_01876072:

    # mc "You too, David."
    mc "你也是，David。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14488
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_27eea3ee:

    # ji "Thanks for coming tonight."
    ji "谢谢你能来今晚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14490
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_1e014533:

    # sa "All things considered, it was worth it."
    sa "综合考虑，这趟还是值得的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14492
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_1a5b4f90:

    # ji "I'm sorry that your brother didn't suck."
    ji "你弟弟并不差，真抱歉。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14494
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_02fc71e4:

    # sa "Me too."
    sa "我也是。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14495
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7ea72e5d:

    # sa "He's not even walking funny anymore. He didn't embarrass himself at all tonight..."
    sa "他现在走路都正常了，今晚根本没丢脸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14497
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_f4c468f8:

    # ji "Did he tell you how that happened to him?"
    ji "他跟你说他怎么弄伤的吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14499
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_bd7c8ac1:

    # sa "How he got injured?"
    sa "他怎么受伤的？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14501
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_0839e7d0:

    # ji "Yes... Because I'm the reason why he tore his scrotum."
    ji "是的……因为是我害的，他撕裂了睾丸。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14503
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_43f38343:

    # sa "Come again?"
    sa "你再说一遍？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14505
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7d8a2e9a:

    # ji "It was me. I kicked him between his legs."
    ji "是我。我踢了他的腿间。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14507
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7cecb81c:

    # sa "You're the hoodlum he got into a fight with?"
    sa "你就是和他打架的那个小流氓？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14509
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_4b1d3f33:

    # ji "*{i}Sigh{/i}* It appears so."
    ji "*{i}叹气{/i}*看起来是这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14511
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_e30d8067:

    # sa "Why did you do that to him?"
    sa "你为什么对他这么做？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14513
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_2dd8fb52:

    # ji "I'm not sure if you want to know why."
    ji "我不确定你是不是想知道原因。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14515
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_b6ef536f:

    # sa "Well, without a reason, I don't know what to think about it."
    sa "那我也没什么好想的了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14516
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_a477cc29:

    # sa "He's been hurting a lot."
    sa "他最近一直挺难受的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14518
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_b0fdb831:

    # ji "He stole my underwear. And I caught him...um..."
    ji "他偷了我的内裤。而且我抓住他了……呃……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14519
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_88e9a7e8:

    # ji "I'm going to ruin watermelons for you."
    ji "我以后要让你看到西瓜就有阴影。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14521
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_ee9b149e:

    # sa "Watermelons? What's going on?"
    sa "西瓜？怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14523
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_e731f18f:

    # ji "He dressed up a watermelon with my underwear, a picture of me, and what I believe was a lock of my hair..."
    ji "他用我的内衣、我的照片，还有我相信是一缕我的头发，把西瓜打扮得像个我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14524
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_f3d06970:

    # ji "And I caught him pleasuring himself with it."
    ji "我还抓到他用那玩意儿自慰。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14526
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_f2074b2a:

    # sa "You're joking."
    sa "你在开玩笑吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14528
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_d0cd26dc:

    # ji "I wish. Trent was there with me."
    ji "要是Trent在就好了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14530
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_2c3845a5:

    # ji "When I saw it... I reacted to it..."
    ji "当我看到它……我做出了反应……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14531
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_413abf9d:

    # ji "And my reaction was to kick him between the legs."
    ji "我的反应是踢了他一下腿。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14533
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_0f398484:

    # sa "I can't believe he would do that... That is so creepy."
    sa "我真不敢相信他会这么做……这也太诡异了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14534
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_0788a800:

    # sa "Yeah, I would have kicked him in the balls, too."
    sa "我也会踢他裆部的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14536
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_1012d454:

    # ji "Your brother has been in love with me."
    ji "你兄弟一直对我有好感。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14537
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_a66774ca:

    # ji "He even proposed to me."
    ji "他甚至向我求婚了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14539
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7c62904f:

    # sa "He proposed to you!?"
    sa "他向你求婚了？！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14541
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_74f44abf:

    # ji "How do you treat someone like him?"
    ji "你怎么对他这种人？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14542
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_b62d86cd:

    # ji "I tried to be nice, but he kept pushing it."
    ji "我试着好好说话，但他一直逼我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14543
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_4540b0f9:

    # ji "He told me I couldn't see [name], and he forced me to date him."
    ji "他告诉我我不能看见[name]，他逼我跟他约会。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14545
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_cad8c402:

    # sa "I didn't know he put you through all of that. That's disgusting."
    sa "我都不知道他对你做了这么多。这太恶心了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14546
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7729fc37:

    # sa "Did you tell someone about it? I'm sure it could get him into big trouble."
    sa "你告诉别人了吗？我敢肯定这能让他吃大亏。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14548
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_adf92f7b:

    # ji "I told Bella and [name]."
    ji "我告诉贝拉和[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14550
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_fcb87b1a:

    # ji "[name] told me to show him mercy."
    ji "[name]让我放过他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14552
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_531a9aa0:

    # sa "[name] told you that?"
    sa "[name]你跟我说过吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14554
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_7d288228:

    # ji "I believe he wanted me to take the high road."
    ji "我相信他想让我高抬贵手。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14556
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_d1241235:

    # sa "I appreciate that..."
    sa "我明白你的意思..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14557
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_88341e53:

    # sa "What Tybalt did was a scumbag thing to do, but..."
    sa "Tybalt的做法确实很卑鄙，可是……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14559
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_0c8bbded:

    # ji "You don't think he deserves to be punished, either?"
    ji "你也不觉得他该被惩罚吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14561
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_127b50fa:

    # ji "[name] encouraged me to punish Tybalt."
    ji "[name]鼓励我惩罚 Tybalt。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14562
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_e9ca380a:

    # ji "I considered bringing it up to the disciplinary committee."
    ji "我考虑过向纪律委员会提起这件事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14564
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_b1b78603:

    # sa "You could ruin his future..."
    sa "你可能会毁了他的未来..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14566
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_e39fa93f:

    # ji "I'm aware."
    ji "我知道。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14568
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_b78219a6:

    # sa "What he did was a scumbag thing to do, but..."
    sa "他的做法确实很卑鄙，可是……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14570
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_68387637:

    # ji "You don't think he deserves to be punished?"
    ji "你就不觉得他该被惩罚吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14572
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_5f55742c:

    # sa "Don't get me wrong... I hate him."
    sa "别误会……我恨他。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14573
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_8ba9afc6:

    # sa "But he's my brother. I get to do that."
    sa "但他是我弟弟。我有这个权利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14575
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_c9f7c28c:

    # sa "And my family isn't strong right now."
    sa "而我的家庭现在并不坚强。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14576
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_f7aef31f:

    # sa "We could use less drama surrounding us..."
    sa "我们周围少点戏剧性就好了..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14578
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_c97467f5:

    # ji "I understand."
    ji "我明白。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14580
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_1a182a10:

    # sa "Is Tybalt still being a pain in your ass?"
    sa "你还在为难他吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14582
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_aef742cf:

    # ji "Not since I caught him with my fruity alter ego."
    ji "从我看到他和我那个水果味的另一个自我在一起之后，他就没这么干过。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14583
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_9a96dfd5:

    # ji "He's going out of his way to ignore me now."
    ji "他现在故意躲着我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14585
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_44e319c6:

    # sa "Well, that's better. And now that he has a girlfriend, he might leave you alone."
    sa "那就好。现在他有女朋友了，应该不会再招惹你了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14586
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_dba83dc0:

    # sa "He gloated a lot about Paula over Christmas."
    sa "他圣诞节期间还一直炫耀着Paula。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14588
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_bfae102c:

    # ji "I hope he has moved on then."
    ji "希望他现在已经放下了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14590
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_ce97b48e:

    # sa "Thanks for confiding in me. It couldn't have been easy."
    sa "谢谢信任我。这事儿对你来说肯定不容易。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14592
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_8328b6e7:

    # ji "You make it easy. You're so outspoken and unafraid to say what you think."
    ji "你让人省心。你这么直率，从不害怕表达自己的想法。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14593
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_5515cfe7:

    # ji "I wish I were the same."
    ji "我希望自己也能这样。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14595
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_e222863e:

    # sa "You have qualities that I could use as well."
    sa "你也有我需要的品质。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14597
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_2fb1b8c7:

    # ji "Like what?"
    ji "像什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14599
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_028012e4:

    # sa "You're level-headed and so fucking nice."
    sa "你很冷静，而且他妈的还特别好相处。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14601
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_59e1bb67:

    # ji "You're nice too."
    ji "你也很不错。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14604
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_c8f317bd:

    # sa "Thanks..."
    sa "谢谢..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14606
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_afbb5566:

    # sa "Um... There's something I'd like to run by you, too. I could use some advice."
    sa "嗯……我也有点事想和你商量一下，想听听你的意见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14608
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_8814a770:

    # ji "What about?"
    ji "怎么了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14610
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_ea6378b7:

    # sa "It's about [name]."
    sa "这关乎[name]."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14612
translate schinese ep12_no_fparty6_label_6189b7d6:

    # ji "Oh? Is something wrong?"
    ji "哦？出什么事了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14625
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_def0489a:

    # sb "Wallace! It's been years since I heard your voice. How have you been?"
    sb "华莱士！好久没听到你的声音了，你最近怎么样？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14627
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_37ca2d6b:

    # sb "Oh, haha! You saw that?"
    sb "哦，哈哈！你看到了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14628
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_9eae115f:

    # sb "Yeah, what can I tell you? Journalists... They always fixate on something you said in passing."
    sb "嗯，我能跟你说啥？记者这种人啊，总是对你说的那些随口一提的话特别上心。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14630
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f62bfa18:

    # sb "No, it is true. I am indeed a big part of that process, but it's not going nearly as well as they worded it."
    sb "不，这话是真的。我确实参与了这个过程，但情况远没有他们说得那么顺利。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14631
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_2b2c4801:

    # sb "Securing funds is hard work, and there is always a need for more."
    sb "筹钱可不容易，永远都缺钱。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14633
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_b455e66e:

    # sb "He did? Yes, I kept Levenson in my social network, but I can assure you, there's no conflict of interest or anything."
    sb "他真这么说了？是啊，我一直在社交圈里留着利文森，但我可以向你保证，没有任何利益冲突或者什么的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14638
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_a713739e:

    # sb "Good, I didn't want you to think that I'm competing for your clients. I've got my own thing going on here."
    sb "好，我可没想让你觉得我在抢你的客户。我这边也有自己的事要忙。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14639
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_7788c9b1:

    # sb "There's nothing fishy about it. I never did those things; I'm sure you remember."
    sb "这事儿一点都不奇怪。我从来没做过那些事，你肯定记得。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14643
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_d9740aa6:

    # sb "Well, Levenson's had a great year and needed a write-off."
    sb "嗯，利文森这一年过得不错，现在需要一笔支出。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14644
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_19ad8e13:

    # sb "The donation is for a good cause, and he wanted to thank me for what I did for him in the past."
    sb "这笔捐款是用于一个好项目，他想感谢我过去为他所做的事。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14646
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f5d2d784:

    # sb "Haha! Yes! Symbiosis. You remembered."
    sb "哈哈！对！共生关系。你记起来了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14648
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f478bf51:

    # sb "Oh, right. I believe they wrote that in the newspaper."
    sb "哦，对了，我记得他们是在报纸上写的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14650
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_16f02a65:

    # sb "Yeah, I heard. It took some time, but that trade I suggested to Levenson came through. I made a killing on it myself."
    sb "嗯，我听说了。花了一些时间，但我和莱文森做的那笔交易终于成交了。我自己也赚了不少。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14651
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_413105a7:

    # sb "If you had only trusted my analysis, haha..."
    sb "如果你当初只相信我的分析，哈哈……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14653
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_79c5fb77:

    # sb "Sure, I'd be thrilled to have lunch with you. But let me say this up front, you're not getting me back."
    sb "当然，我很乐意和你共进午餐。但我要先说清楚，你别指望能把我拉回来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14654
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_cc282ed9:

    # sb "I'm done with that life, and I'd like to keep whatever hair I have left rather than lose it to stress."
    sb "我再也不想过那种生活了，而且我也想留着剩下的头发，而不是让压力把它全薅光。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14656
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_bbd01851:

    # sb "Haha! Great! Tomorrow then."
    sb "哈哈！好啊，明天见。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14659
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_ad3ff354:

    # sb "Time's out. Pencils down."
    sb "时间到，笔放下。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14660
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_31081440:

    # sb "Turn in your papers before you leave."
    sb "交卷后离开。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14662
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_9cdf713a:

    # pris "You put some tough questions in there, Professor."
    pris "教授，您这题出得挺难的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14664
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_a19e0b8e:

    # sb "I don't make the questions. Blame it on B&R's test system."
    sb "我可没出这些题，怪就怪在B&R的考试系统上。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14666
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f694dd33:

    # pris "Hopefully, I'll pass."
    pris "希望我能及格。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14668
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_46984ea3:

    # sb "..."
    sb "..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14670
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_e5b7c50b:

    # ca "Another year, but it feels like the same old students."
    ca "又是一年，但感觉还是那些老面孔。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14672
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_1aafa6d2:

    # sb "Having a couple of retakes?"
    sb "有几人重考吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14674
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_3019cb6e:

    # ca "Mhm... Several."
    ca "嗯……好几个。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14676
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_482797aa:

    # sb "Maybe they keep coming back because they like you as a teacher so much?"
    sb "也许他们一直回来是因为太喜欢你这个老师了？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14678
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f8ef9834:

    # ca "Haha! Good one!"
    ca "哈哈！说得不错！"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14679
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_87239fd0:

    # ca "I'll see you on Monday. Don't stay too late correcting tests."
    ca "周一见。别改卷改得太晚。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14684
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_91b1122d:

    # "*{i}Phone rings{/i}*"
    "*{i}电话铃声响起{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14686
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_08b13ce0:

    # sb "Wallace... Thanks again for lunch the other day."
    sb "华莱士……前几天那顿午餐，再次谢谢您。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14688
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_6655f0c6:

    # sb "I thought about your offer, but I have to decline."
    sb "我考虑过你的提议，但不得不拒绝。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14689
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_6605d94b:

    # sb "I think you know why, but if you need me to enlighten you..."
    sb "我觉得你大概已经明白我的意思了，不过如果你需要我再解释一遍……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14691
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_f3877ba3:

    # sb "Frankly, I don't believe for a second that the money you'd donate is fair game. We both know how you operate."
    sb "坦白说，我根本不信你捐的那些钱是光明正大的。我们俩都清楚你是怎么运作的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14693
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_6efd5286:

    # sb "I believe you'd use B&R as a funnel, putting in dirty money and getting white write-offs."
    sb "我相信你会用B&R当做一个渠道，把脏钱灌进去，再搞出一些干净的账目来。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14694
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_db06115a:

    # sb "Furthermore, it sounded like you wanted me to scout for talented students and introduce them to your firm, which would create a potential quid pro quo."
    sb "而且听起来你希望我物色一些有才华的学生，把他们介绍给你公司，这可能会形成一种利益交换。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14696
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_29af7b64:

    # sb "Tell me how close I was with that assessment?"
    sb "你跟我说说，我刚才那番分析有多接近真相？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14697
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_2c8bf87b:

    # sb "I realize I would look good procuring that sizeable donation, but I'm doing fine without it."
    sb "我明白我看起来像是在为这笔大额捐款奔波，但我不需要它，我现在过得很好。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14699
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_1744a768:

    # sb "Yes, I did say that we need more money for scholarships, but-"
    sb "是的，我确实说过我们需要更多钱来设立奖学金，但——"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14700
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_db5744e3:

    # sb "You can tell me to think about it all you want, but I won't change my mind on this."
    sb "你可以一直让我考虑这件事，但我不会改变主意。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14702
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_94a883cc:

    # sb "Have a good evening, Mr. Wallace."
    sb "祝您今晚愉快，Mr. Wallace。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14708
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_69166a65:

    # "*{i}Door knock{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门声{/i}*"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14710
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_0acf518a:

    # sb "Yes? Come on in."
    sb "是？进来吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14712
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_9672f3c4:

    # pris "Hi, Professor."
    pris "你好，教授。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14714
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_bcd3f50c:

    # sb "Priscilla... Why are you still here? It's Friday. Off and enjoy your weekend."
    sb "Priscilla……你怎么还在这里？今天是周五，回去享受周末吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14716
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_e339fbb6:

    # pris "Says you. Do you always work this late?"
    pris "你说的。你总是这么晚才工作吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14718
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_742f37aa:

    # sb "When work calls for it, I have to find time to correct the tests, and I don't like to procrastinate."
    sb "工作需要的时候，我得抽时间批改试卷，我可不喜欢拖延。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14720
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_7855ca2e:

    # pris "Oh, right... The tests..."
    pris "哦，对了……那些试卷……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14726
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_8bf040e9:

    # sb "Uh... Priscilla. What can I do for you?"
    sb "呃……Priscilla。我能为你做什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14728
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_68877bea:

    # pris "Look, I'm going to level with you."
    pris "直说吧，我没什么好藏着掖着的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14730
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_c75f33d2:

    # pris "That test today... I flunked it. Hard."
    pris "那场考试今天...我挂了。挂得挺惨的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14732
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_10346229:

    # sb "Maybe you did, maybe you didn't? I haven't corrected your test yet, but you never know-"
    sb "也许你通过了，也许没通过？我还没改你的试卷，但你永远不知道——"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14734
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_294d63cf:

    # pris "Exactly! You never know, right?"
    pris "正好！你永远不知道，对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14736
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_d6c54f8f:

    # pris "Thing is...I didn't even answer any of the questions. I doodled on my papers because I didn't know any of the answers."
    pris "事情是...我连一道题都没答，我直接在试卷上涂鸦了，因为我不知道任何答案。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14738
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_30bc803e:

    # sb "Ah. That's a different story, then."
    sb "啊，那可就完全是另一回事了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14740
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_1d1ab82d:

    # pris "But...you never know... Right?"
    pris "但……你永远不知道……对吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14742
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_e65cf6cc:

    # sb "Priscilla, did you want something?"
    sb "Priscilla，你有什么事吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14744
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_a1307ab0:

    # pris "I talked to my friends about how they get out of these situations, and they say professors are often nice to them..."
    pris "我跟朋友聊过怎么应付这种状况，他们说教授们通常对他们挺照顾的……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14745
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_e4928385:

    # pris "They offer them these extracurricular activities and whatnot to boost their grades."
    pris "他们用这些课外活动什么的来提升成绩。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14747
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_26219b71:

    # sb "Did you come here looking to get a bump on your grade?"
    sb "你来找我是想让我帮你抬高成绩吗？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14749
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_810417e6:

    # pris "You're smart. I bet that's why you are a professor, haha."
    pris "你挺聪明的，估计这就是你当教授的原因，哈哈。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14751
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_d23ce5b7:

    # sb "I can't bump your grade if you're not passing to begin with."
    sb "我怎么可能帮你提升成绩，如果你连及格都做不到。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14752
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_afa59262:

    # sb "The extracurricular activities you mentioned are for students who are close to earning a different grade."
    sb "你提到的这些课外活动是给那些快要拿到其他成绩的学生准备的。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14754
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_d6571083:

    # sb "They aren't used as a Hail Mary to get out of a failing grade. You need to put in effort, too."
    sb "他们不是用来当临门一脚逃过不及格的。你也要付出努力。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14756
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_52458415:

    # pris "I put in effort."
    pris "我努力了。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14760
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_ab829df9:

    # sb "Priscilla... What are you doing?"
    sb "Priscilla……你在做什么？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14762
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_7c09d293:

    # pris "Putting in the effort."
    pris "努力一下吧。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14764
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_ab801057:

    # pris "I've noticed how you watch me in class."
    pris "我注意到你在课堂上一直盯着我看。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14766
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_0c7abcff:

    # sb "I'm your teacher; I watch all of my students."
    sb "我是你的老师，我看着我所有的学生。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14768
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_1765d552:

    # pris "Not in the way you've been watching me. Your eyes wander all over my body. Undressing me with your gaze."
    pris "不是像你一直在盯着我那样。你的眼神到处乱瞟，把我从头到脚都看个遍，用目光给我脱衣服。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14770
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_b0151678:

    # pris "Looking up my skirt when I sit at my desk..."
    pris "偷看我坐在桌边时掀开的裙摆..."

# episode12\update12.rpy:14772
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_244bcee9:

    # pris "All I'm asking for is a passing grade. It's not much... Surely, you can do that?"
    pris "我只要个及格分。这要求可不高……你肯定能做到吧？"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14773
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_5213fbcf:

    # pris "And in return..."
    pris "作为回报……"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14775
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_a0382a31:

    # pris "I'll let you fuck me right now."
    pris "我现在就让你干我。"

# episode12\update12.rpy:14776
translate schinese ep12_stephen_label_a969ad63:

